
# game/a2s2.rpy:2
translate latin a2s2_02747d86:

    # "Hearing that, my whole body numbs up."
    "His auditis, totum corpus meum torpescit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:3
translate latin a2s2_e618ef9b:

    # "I can barely feel my feet hitting the ground, pumping my arms as I tear through the garden."
    "Vix sentio pedes terram ferire, dum brachia iacto et per hortum rapidissime curro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:4
translate latin a2s2_88c8798b:

    # "I don't even bother with the paths, instead crashing through the foliage and bushes, scratching up the skin on my arms and legs as I trample over something covered in thorns."
    "Ne semitas quidem curo; potius per frondes et frutices irrumpo, cutem brachiorum crurumque lacerans dum aliquid spinis obtectum conculco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:5
translate latin a2s2_60e1742a:

    # "I don't even care as I run straight through a ten foot-wide spiderweb, the massive spider in the middle hitting my chest then falling and disappearing under my feet."
    "Ne id quidem curo, cum recta per telam araneae decem pedes latam curro; ingens aranea in medio posita pectus meum ferit, deinde cadit et sub pedibus meis evanescit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:6
translate latin a2s2_92ab23a1:

    # "The sound of Cato and Amicus struggling behind me has long since faded."
    "Sonus Catonis et Amici post me luctantium iam pridem evanuit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:7
translate latin a2s2_4abeac96:

    # "Now all there is is my heavy breathing and the snapping and crashing of the plants around me."
    "Nunc tantum respiratio mea gravis et plantae circa me fractae ac concussae audiuntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:8
translate latin a2s2_178f35b5:

    # "I wonder if maybe I should stop making noise, try to hide instead...but I worry that Com will know exactly where I'm at."
    "Mecum quaero an mihi strepere desinendum sit et potius occultari conandum...sed timeo ne Com exacte sciat ubi sim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:9
translate latin a2s2_375b8bd7:

    # "I know they're following me right now, and ominously, I can't hear a damn thing."
    "Scio ea nunc me sequi; horrendum est quod nihil omnino audio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:10
translate latin a2s2_40fcc3f0:

    # "I can't see them either, just the flashes of branches and greenery around me."
    "Ne ea quidem video, tantum ramos et virentia circa me praetervolantes."

# game/a2s2.rpy:12
translate latin a2s2_52296950:

    # "When I finally make it to the main path to the palace, I catch my first glimpse of the drones."
    "Cum tandem ad primariam semitam ad palatium ducentem pervenio, primum automata volitantia conspicio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:13
translate latin a2s2_b3122489:

    # "They're hovering further up the path, toward the amphitheater."
    "Longius per semitam, versus amphitheatrum, in aere pendent."

# game/a2s2.rpy:14
translate latin a2s2_bbb38b73:

    # "It makes me wonder if they're stuck on a grid somehow and had been unable to follow me into the actual garden."
    "Quare mecum quaero an quodammodo reticulo alligata sint atque me in ipsum hortum sequi nequiverint."

# game/a2s2.rpy:15
translate latin a2s2_dc8b60a0:

    # "I think about turning back and trying to hide in the garden again just as I rush through the entrance, but I realize immediately that they're too close."
    "Dum per aditum irruo, cogito reverti et rursus in horto me occultare; statim tamen intellego ea nimis prope esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:16
translate latin a2s2_f97e60a4:

    # "Sure enough, I hear a crack behind me just as I turn the corner in the main hall, toward Neferu's room."
    "Et certe post me fragorem audio simul atque in aula principali angulum versus cubiculum Neferu circumverto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:18
translate latin a2s2_d1265088:

    # "I get a glimpse of it out of the corner of my eye."
    "Ab extremo oculo eum conspicio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:19
translate latin a2s2_4fb1087c:

    # "I'm not sure what I expected the weaponry to be."
    "Nescio quid me de genere telorum exspectasse putaverim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:20
translate latin a2s2_b57d7b1f:

    # "A red laser, an arc of electricity, actual bullets, maybe?"
    "Fortasse radium lasericum rubrum, arcum electricum, aut veras glandes?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:21
translate latin a2s2_db688664:

    # "What I do see is a strange bending of the air in the space I'd just been a second ago, like looking through a warped piece of glass before suddenly, it snaps back into place, making my ears pop and throwing my body sideways."
    "Quod video est mira aeris flexio in loco ubi modo ante unum secundum eram, quasi per vitrum distortum aspicerem; deinde subito in locum suum redit, aures mihi crepitare faciens et corpus meum in latus impellens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:22
translate latin a2s2_c446bb14:

    # "I stumble, but I don't stop, Neferu's room just a few dozen feet ahead of me."
    "Titubo; sed non consisto. Cubiculum Neferu paucis tantum denis pedibus ante me est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:23
translate latin a2s2_68295adc:

    # "Now I can hear the drones; an odd, angry buzzing, like wasps."
    "Nunc automata audio: mirum bombum iratum, velut vesparum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:24
translate latin a2s2_7241fee4:

    # com "\"Halt, [mc].\""
    com "\"Consiste, [mc].\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:25
translate latin a2s2_c44d7e73:

    # "I hear Com's gentle, calm voice; a stark contrast to what he's actually doing right now."
    "Vocem Com lenem et placidam audio, quae valde ab eo discrepat quod nunc re vera facit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:26
translate latin a2s2_7b5c4940:

    # "It startles me and I put on an extra burst of speed just before I reach Neferu's door."
    "Me terret, et paulo etiam celerius curro antequam ad ianuam Neferu pervenio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:27
translate latin a2s2_3a4011d5:

    # "I can only hope that he's there, otherwise I'm going to be cornered...it'll be where I die."
    "Tantum sperare possum eum ibi esse; alioquin in angulum cogar...ibi moriar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:28
translate latin a2s2_085758eb:

    # "With my breath wheezing through my throat, I throw a hand out desperately, pressing it to the black panel on the door."
    "Dum spiritus per fauces cum stridore transit, desperatus manum porrigo et tabellam nigram in ianua premo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:29
translate latin a2s2_97d7e1ff:

    # "...Nothing."
    "...Nihil."

# game/a2s2.rpy:30
translate latin a2s2_6e5da9af:

    # "It doesn't open, it's locked."
    "Non aperitur; clausa est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:31
translate latin a2s2_6cade93b:

    # "I thought doors don't lock here?"
    "Putabam ianuas hic non obserari?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:32
translate latin a2s2_f1b8dc93:

    # "I see the drones out of the corner of my eye and I pound on the door as hard as I can, screaming as loud as I can."
    "Ab extremo oculo automata video; ianuam quam vehementissime pulso et quam maxime possum clamo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:33
translate latin a2s2_5b26751d:

    # m "\"NEFERU! NEFERU HELP!\""
    m "\"NEFERU! NEFERU, SUCCURRE!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:34
translate latin a2s2_9c62690e:

    # "There's a pause, and I hear something to my right that sounds like static, getting louder and louder and I press myself against the door, waiting for whatever it is the blast will do to me."
    "Morula fit; aliquid ad dextram audio quod strepitui electrico simile est, magis magisque sonans. Me contra ianuam premo, exspectans quidquid ictus mihi facturus sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:36
translate latin a2s2_50efe45e:

    # "Then I'm falling through space."
    "Tum per inane cado."

# game/a2s2.rpy:37
translate latin a2s2_1682b3b1:

    # "I'm convinced then that I've died, that this falling sensation is what it's like to die."
    "Tum mihi persuasum est me mortuum esse, hunc cadendi sensum ipsum esse mortis sensum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:38
translate latin a2s2_8c9e632a:

    # "Will I land on something, or just fall forever?"
    "Cadamne in aliquid, an in aeternum cadam?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:39
translate latin a2s2_bdf23c9b:

    # "I get my answer almost immediately as I hit the ground face-first on the hard, marble floor."
    "Responsum paene statim accipio cum vultu primum in durum pavimentum marmoreum incido."

# game/a2s2.rpy:43
translate latin a2s2_aec90906:

    # "I'm dazed as there's a sharp crack behind me, and I feel the force of it sending a gust of air over me."
    "Obstupesco dum acer fragor post me fit; vim eius sentio flatum aeris super me mittentem."

# game/a2s2.rpy:44
translate latin a2s2_7225e2ff:

    # n "\"Ahhotep!\""
    n "\"Ahhotep!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:45
translate latin a2s2_8dd9306e:

    # "Neferu's voice yelps above me and I hear the sound of the door sliding shut."
    "Vox Neferu supra me exclamat, et ianuam delapsam claudi audio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:48
translate latin a2s2_638aec6b:

    # n "\"Com, what is going on!?\""
    n "\"Com, quid agitur!?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:49
translate latin a2s2_5542be78:

    # com "\"Disengage your door's security measures, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Neferu, ianuae tuae tutelam remove.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:51
translate latin a2s2_f41c1a5a:

    # n "\"What's happening?\""
    n "\"Quid accidit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:52
translate latin a2s2_0d8b9dad:

    # "Neferu is crouching over me now, and I think he's talking to me, but Com answers him instead as the jackal starts to help me to my feet."
    "Neferu nunc super me se inclinat; puto eum mecum loqui, sed Com ei respondet dum chacalus me in pedes attollere incipit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:53
translate latin a2s2_2a38b33d:

    # com "\"The child is to be terminated. Please disengage security to allow drone entry.\""
    com "\"Ille e Liberis necandus est. Tutelam remove, quaeso, ut automata intrare possint.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:55
translate latin a2s2_b3682948:

    # n "\"What!? No. [mc], what's happening?\""
    n "\"Quid!? Non. [mc], quid accidit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:56
translate latin a2s2_aa390f5e:

    # "Neferu has pulled me to my feet at this point, looking me right in the eye."
    "Neferu iam me in pedes traxit et recta in oculos meos aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:57
translate latin a2s2_9e74e174:

    # m "\"A—Ami—\""
    m "\"A—Ami—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:58
translate latin a2s2_36fc7164:

    # "I find myself way more out of breath than I thought I was as I try to gasp out an answer."
    "Dum responsum anhelans proferre conor, intellego spiritum mihi multo magis deesse quam putaveram."

# game/a2s2.rpy:59
translate latin a2s2_000ec750:

    # m "\"Amicus...lost emperorship—\""
    m "\"Amicus...imperium amisit—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:61
translate latin a2s2_c6e756be:

    # ca "\"Neferu, open the damn door!\""
    ca "\"Neferu, aperi ianuam, di boni!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:62
translate latin a2s2_f0ffef17:

    # "Cato's voice crackles through the speakers above me, making me jump."
    "Vox Catonis ex instrumentis sonantibus supra me crepitat et me subsilire facit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:63
translate latin a2s2_dcab0d23:

    # "It's strained and breathing heavily, and I wonder what he's doing right now...what Amicus is doing."
    "Vox contenta est et graviter respirat; mecum quaero quid nunc faciat...quid Amicus faciat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:65
translate latin a2s2_8d207e9a:

    # "The jackal pushes me back to stand behind him, keeping himself between me and the door."
    "Chacalus me retro impellit ut post eum stem, ipse inter me et ianuam manens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:66
translate latin a2s2_d290924d:

    # "Even though he's got his face set into a stern glare, he's as calm as he always is."
    "Quamquam vultu severo ac torvo aspicit, placidus est ut semper."

# game/a2s2.rpy:67
translate latin a2s2_0905bc18:

    # n "\"Cato, what a pleasant surprise to hear your voice. May I ask why you want entry into my quarters?\""
    n "\"Cato, quam iucundum est improviso vocem tuam audire. Licetne rogare cur in cubiculum meum intrare velis?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:68
translate latin a2s2_9ae7ea22:

    # ca "\"The emperor's quarters, you dog. Com, override door security.\""
    ca "\"In cubiculum imperatoris, canis. Com, tutelam ianuae vi remove.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:69
translate latin a2s2_f0acee69:

    # com "\"Overriding security.\""
    com "\"Tutelam vi removeo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:71
translate latin a2s2_67db27cc:

    # "There's a hiss and click from the door and suddenly it slides open."
    "Ex ianua sibilus et crepitus fiunt; subito delabitur et aperitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:72
translate latin a2s2_745a084f:

    # "Quickly, Neferu backs into me, much like Amicus did earlier this morning, and I find myself pressed back into one of the pillars, the jackal's body almost entirely covering me up."
    "Neferu celeriter retro in me recedit, sicut Amicus hodie mane fecerat; me ad unam e columnis pressum invenio, corpore chacali me paene totum tegente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:73
translate latin a2s2_db967baa:

    # "Although I know Amicus is a good deal bigger than Neferu, I'm still struck by the jackal's size now that he's so close to me."
    "Quamquam scio Amicum multo maiorem esse quam Neferu, magnitudo chacali adhuc me percellit nunc cum tam prope sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:74
translate latin a2s2_7764e23c:

    # com "\"Step aside, Neferu, or risk being shot.\""
    com "\"Recede, Neferu, aut periculum est ne telo feriaris.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:75
translate latin a2s2_afdf2c77:

    # ca "\"DON'T shoot the jackal. Neferu, what are you doing with it?\""
    ca "\"Canem aureum NE ferias. Neferu, quid cum illo facis?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:76
translate latin a2s2_eb4dd846:

    # "Cato is breathing heavily, and it sounds like he's moving around."
    "Cato graviter respirat; videtur se movere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:77
translate latin a2s2_23aea082:

    # ca "\"Can't see a damn thing! Have you called a ship!?\""
    ca "\"Nihil prorsus videre possum! Vocavistine navem!?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:78
translate latin a2s2_8b7d6140:

    # al "\"Yes, your Imperial Majesty.\""
    al "\"Ita, Tua Maiestas Imperatoria.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:79
translate latin a2s2_b83d4523:

    # "There's more muffled moving around, and I wonder what Cato's speaking into, maybe a drone."
    "Plures soni motus suffocati audiuntur; mecum quaero in quid Cato loquatur, fortasse in automaton volitans."

# game/a2s2.rpy:80
translate latin a2s2_5b539352:

    # ca "\"Neferu, I asked you a question!\""
    ca "\"Neferu, te aliquid rogavi!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:82
translate latin a2s2_624b42af:

    # n "\"Simply protecting a fellow Khemian.\""
    n "\"Tantum alterum Khemium tueor.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:83
translate latin a2s2_d2781e7e:

    # "There's a moment of silence."
    "Paulisper silentium est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:84
translate latin a2s2_da47bde0:

    # ca "\"A what?\""
    ca "\"Alterum quid?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:86
translate latin a2s2_3e2bb40b:

    # n "\"Khemian.\""
    n "\"Khemium.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:87
translate latin a2s2_7e8c91cb:

    # "Neferu enunciates very slowly, and I look up at the back of his head, just as confused as Cato."
    "Neferu lentissime pronuntiat; occiput eius suspicio, aeque perplexus ac Cato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:88
translate latin a2s2_b24f8348:

    # ca "\"Agh! Don't press so damn hard, cat!\""
    ca "\"Agh! Noli tam vehementer premere, feles!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:89
translate latin a2s2_efecbe3d:

    # ca "\"What do you mean, Neferu?\""
    ca "\"Quid vis dicere, Neferu?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:90
translate latin a2s2_5902be0e:

    # "Cato's voice takes on a more growly tone as he turns his attention from whatever he was doing back on us."
    "Vox Catonis magis fremere incipit dum animum rursus ab eo quod faciebat ad nos convertit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:91
translate latin a2s2_0bbb3758:

    # n "\"I mean that the child has been granted citizenship in the Khemian kingdom, and it would be unwise to attack him.\""
    n "\"Dico illi e Liberis civitatem in regno Khemiorum concessam esse, eumque oppugnare imprudentem rem fore.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:92
translate latin a2s2_de5259dc:

    # "Neferu's voice takes on an almost smug tone."
    "Vox Neferu paene sibi placentis est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:93
translate latin a2s2_93a188ea:

    # n "\"An attack on him would be an attack on us all. Surely you understand this, emperor.\""
    n "\"Qui eum oppugnet nos omnes oppugnet. Hoc certe intellegis, imperator.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:94
translate latin a2s2_d0bbda1f:

    # ca "\"You lie.\""
    ca "\"Mentiris.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:96
translate latin a2s2_a73b0e63:

    # n "\"Would you like to test that?\""
    n "\"Visne experiri?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:97
translate latin a2s2_73970d06:

    # "There's a long pause."
    "Longa mora fit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:98
translate latin a2s2_d4c35033:

    # "In the meantime, a low, rumbling sound grows, audible not only through the intercom, but through the floor of the palace as well."
    "Interim humilis sonus fremens crescit, qui non solum per instrumenta ad colloquendum sed etiam per palatii pavimentum percipitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:99
translate latin a2s2_78026106:

    # al "\"The ship is arriving your Imperial Majesty.\""
    al "\"Navis advenit, Tua Maiestas Imperatoria.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:100
translate latin a2s2_d0e9a0fc:

    # ca "\"Yes, I can see that, cat. Neferu...\""
    ca "\"Ita, hoc video, feles. Neferu...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:101
translate latin a2s2_fa5b4290:

    # "Another long pause."
    "Iterum longa mora."

# game/a2s2.rpy:102
translate latin a2s2_025a2245:

    # ca "\"We will discuss this further once I'm back in the palace. I don't know what you and Amicus have planned, but know that I'll be keeping a very close eye on you. That creature is not to leave the palace.\""
    ca "\"Plura de hoc loquemur cum in palatium rediero. Nescio quid tu et Amicus paraveritis; scito tamen me diligentissime te observaturum esse. Illud animal e palatio exire non debet.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:103
translate latin a2s2_1a02fa06:

    # "The wolf suddenly grunts and I can hear the voices of other wolves as well."
    "Lupus subito grunnit; voces aliorum luporum quoque audio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:104
translate latin a2s2_779080d9:

    # ca "\"I'm fine, I'm fine, just get me to hospital.\""
    ca "\"Bene me habeo, bene me habeo; tantum me ad valetudinarium ferte.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:105
translate latin a2s2_1223d402:

    # "There are more sounds of movement, grunting, cursing, and voices of concern before the wolf speaks to us again."
    "Plures soni motus, grunnitus, maledicta et voces sollicitae audiuntur antequam lupus rursus nobis loquitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:106
translate latin a2s2_b5a96b73:

    # ca "\"And remember, you have no way off this moon at the moment. It would be wise to do as I say.\""
    ca "\"Et memento: nunc nullam habes viam qua ex hac luna abire possis. Prudens fueris si quae dico feceris.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:108
translate latin a2s2_07573df4:

    # n "\"Of course, Your Majesty.\""
    n "\"Certe, Tua Maiestas.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:109
translate latin a2s2_34bf00aa:

    # "Cato grunts."
    "Cato grunnit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:110
translate latin a2s2_81433756:

    # ca "\"Com, cancel last directive. Execute [mc] if he tries to leave the palace.\""
    ca "\"Com, ultimum mandatum rescinde. [mc] neca si e palatio exire conetur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:111
translate latin a2s2_6123227d:

    # com "\"Yes, Cato.\""
    com "\"Ita, Cato.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:112
translate latin a2s2_b3798bc0:

    # "The connection suddenly cuts off, and the two of us are left to stand in silence."
    "Colloquium subito abrumpitur; ambo taciti stantes relinquimur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:113
translate latin a2s2_6674d214:

    # "Finally, Neferu lets out a long, soft sigh."
    "Tandem Neferu longum ac lenem suspirium emittit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:116
translate latin a2s2_264cefef:

    # n "\"Damn.\""
    n "\"Malum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:117
translate latin a2s2_f85c6915:

    # "The jackal finally takes a few steps forward before turning to face me."
    "Chacalus tandem paucos passus procedit, deinde se vertit ut me aspiciat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:118
translate latin a2s2_21628405:

    # n "\"Well, this situation is less than ideal. I receive news that you somehow rose from the dead last night, and now this. Com, send us the physician.\""
    n "\"Haec sane rerum condicio minime optima est. Nuntium accipio te heri noctu quodammodo a mortuis resurrexisse, et nunc hoc. Com, medicum nobis mitte.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:119
translate latin a2s2_f3dada3b:

    # "Even though I've caught my breath at this point, I realize that I'm sweaty and covered in scratches."
    "Quamquam iam spiritum recepi, intellego me sudare et vulneribus levibus obtectum esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:120
translate latin a2s2_e2a35d68:

    # com "\"Cannot comply with directive. Felix is currently in the dungeons.\""
    com "\"Mandato obtemperare nequeo. Felix nunc in carceribus subterraneis est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:122
translate latin a2s2_413b73c8:

    # n "\"What!? Why?\""
    n "\"Quid!? Cur?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:123
translate latin a2s2_610c879d:

    # com "\"Under the orders of the emperor, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Iussu imperatoris, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:125
translate latin a2s2_264cefef_1:

    # n "\"Damn.\""
    n "\"Malum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:126
translate latin a2s2_5f8a04f3:

    # "This time the jackal says it out of amazement rather than annoyance."
    "Hac vice chacalus haec stupens potius quam iratus dicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:127
translate latin a2s2_740a9e74:

    # n "\"Well, send bandages and a salve, at least.\""
    n "\"Ergo saltem fascias et unguentum mitte.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:128
translate latin a2s2_3fa27c24:

    # com "\"Yes, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Ita, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:131
translate latin a2s2_40b2766f:

    # n "\"[mc]...what happened? Where's Amicus?\""
    n "\"[mc]...quid accidit? Ubi est Amicus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:132
translate latin a2s2_99c6c22c:

    # "After a few more deep breaths, I begin to go over everything that just happened, starting at the point where we were woken up by Cato and ending where I'd attacked Cassius and made a run for Neferu's room."
    "Post paucos alios spiritus altos omnia quae modo acciderunt narrare incipio, ab eo loco quo Cato nos excitavit usque ad eum quo Cassium aggressus sum et ad cubiculum Neferu effugi."

# game/a2s2.rpy:133
translate latin a2s2_86bc9f22:

    # "I try to keep things vague, like Cato just decided Amicus was unfit for the job and wanted to illegitimately put Cassius on the throne, but of course Neferu immediately realizes that I'm leaving things out."
    "Res obscure referre conor, quasi Cato tantum decreverit Amicum muneri imparem esse atque Cassium contra ius in solio collocare voluerit; Neferu autem statim intellegit me quaedam omittere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:135
translate latin a2s2_9564dcea:

    # n "\"Then why does he want you executed? It seems odd he'd suddenly decide to do all of this now.\""
    n "\"Cur igitur te necari vult? Mirum videtur eum subito nunc omnia haec facere decrevisse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:136
translate latin a2s2_310baa64:

    # "I hesitate, and it's at this moment that the door slides open, causing me to jump and cower as a drone enters."
    "Cunctor; hoc ipso momento ianua delabitur et aperitur. Subsilio et metu me contraho cum automaton intrat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:138
translate latin a2s2_6fe2e7b6:

    # n "\"Steady, [mc], it's just the medical supplies I requested. Have a seat on the bed.\""
    n "\"Tranquillus esto, [mc]; tantum res medicae sunt quas poposci. In lecto sede.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:139
translate latin a2s2_96cbd4bd:

    # "There are two beds, but the jackal gestures at the smaller one."
    "Duo lecti sunt; chacalus tamen minorem gestu indicat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:140
translate latin a2s2_1770000d:

    # "Dumbly, I point this out to him."
    "Insulse hoc ei indico."

# game/a2s2.rpy:141
translate latin a2s2_2868e8ca:

    # m "\"Why do you have two beds?\""
    m "\"Cur duos lectos habes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:142
translate latin a2s2_f3ad8b01:

    # "As I sit, Neferu sets the supplies, all laid out on a metal tray, to the side, uncorking a bottle and dipping a brush into it."
    "Dum sedeo, Neferu res, omnes in lance metallica ordinatas, ad latus ponit; lagenam aperit et penicillum in eam mergit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:143
translate latin a2s2_d288d868:

    # "He then starts to apply a dark, orange liquid to the cuts on my arms and legs."
    "Deinde liquorem obscurum aurantii coloris vulneribus brachiorum crurumque meorum illinere incipit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:145
translate latin a2s2_69714a97:

    # n "\"Well, one for the emperor and, interestingly enough, this one for the emperor's pet. Lift your arm.\""
    n "\"Alter imperatori destinatus est; et, quod mirum est, hic alter animali domestico imperatoris. Brachium tolle.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:146
translate latin a2s2_b71f7594:

    # "I do as he says, still feeling numb as he starts to coat a rather deep cut on the underside of my arm."
    "Quod dicit facio, adhuc torpens, dum vulnus satis altum in parte inferiore brachii mei oblinere incipit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:147
translate latin a2s2_bac355e0:

    # m "\"Can we go find Amicus?\""
    m "\"Possumusne ire ut Amicum inveniamus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:149
translate latin a2s2_f6c19511:

    # n "\"Where is Amicus, Com?\""
    n "\"Ubi est Amicus, Com?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:150
translate latin a2s2_66293a06:

    # com "\"That information is confidential and only accessible by the emperor, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Haec notitia arcana est; solus imperator ad eam accedere potest, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:152
translate latin a2s2_83ddf71f:

    # "I see the jackal's eyes narrow as my stomach twists."
    "Oculos chacali contrahi video, dum venter meus contorquetur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:153
translate latin a2s2_9406e39b:

    # m "\"What does that mean?\""
    m "\"Quid hoc significat?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:154
translate latin a2s2_4c7aa90b:

    # n "\"Could mean any number of things.\""
    n "\"Multa varia significare potest.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:155
translate latin a2s2_5096bbb0:

    # "I clutch my hands together, feeling my anxiety grow."
    "Manus inter se stringo, anxietatem meam crescere sentiens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:156
translate latin a2s2_bf46e7ba:

    # m "\"But is he alright? What if Cato did something to him—\""
    m "\"Sed bene se habet? Quid si Cato aliquid ei fecit—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:157
translate latin a2s2_ac6ce3f2:

    # "Neferu rests a paw on my shoulder."
    "Neferu manum umero meo imponit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:159
translate latin a2s2_f2342e00:

    # n "\"I understand your worry for Amicus's safety, but also understand that Cato would not even think of taking Amicus's life. Your wolf is likely imprisoned somewhere after what he did.\""
    n "\"Intellego te de salute Amici sollicitum esse; tamen intellege Catonem ne cogitaturum quidem esse de vita Amico adimenda. Lupus tuus fortasse alicubi in carcere est post ea quae fecit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:160
translate latin a2s2_1a70ba86:

    # "That doesn't make me feel all that much better, but I manage to hold still as the jackal continues to treat me."
    "Hoc me non multo melius habere facit; tamen immotus manere possum dum chacalus me curare pergit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:161
translate latin a2s2_25846949:

    # "After a period of silence though, Neferu sighs."
    "Post aliquod tamen silentium Neferu suspirat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:163
translate latin a2s2_e2ad9316:

    # n "\"So...at this point it seems we're in a rather precarious situation. I promised Amicus that if something happened to him, I would do everything in my power to keep you safe.\""
    n "\"Ergo...iam in satis ancipiti rerum condicione esse videmur. Amico promisi, si quid ei accideret, me omnia quae possem facturum esse ut te salvum servarem.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:164
translate latin a2s2_60c8e14c:

    # "Neferu pauses, and only continues when I look up to meet his eyes."
    "Neferu consistit; tantum pergit cum oculos tollo ut eius oculos aspiciam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:165
translate latin a2s2_927987e0:

    # n "\"It would seem that what he worried about has come to pass, and now I must carry out that promise, but to do that...I need you to be honest with me so that I may know exactly what we are dealing with.\""
    n "\"Videntur ea quae ille timebat accidisse; nunc mihi promissum illud praestandum est. Sed ut id faciam...te vera mihi dicere oportet, ut exacte sciam quibus rebus occurramus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:166
translate latin a2s2_86db693b:

    # "I gaze at Neferu for a while, wondering how much is at stake right now."
    "Neferu aliquamdiu intueor, mecum quaerens quanta nunc in discrimine sint."

# game/a2s2.rpy:167
translate latin a2s2_7c27b66b:

    # "The events of the past hour have left me emotionally drained, numb aside from the twisting anxiety of wondering what's happening to Amicus right now."
    "Quae ultima hora acciderunt animum meum exhauserunt; torpeo, praeter anxietatem contorquentem qua rogo quid nunc Amico accidat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:168
translate latin a2s2_4c28d073:

    # "I feel myself deflate."
    "Sentio me deficere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:169
translate latin a2s2_a0adc871:

    # m "\"...Amicus made First Contact with me. Cato found out.\""
    m "\"...Amicus Primum Congressum mecum fecit. Cato rescivit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:170
translate latin a2s2_de41e865:

    # "I wait for a moment, wondering if the jackal is just going to toss me out into the hall after learning such a terrible secret."
    "Paulisper exspecto, mecum quaerens an chacalus, tam horrendo secreto cognito, me in ambulacrum eiecturus sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:171
translate latin a2s2_05786aec:

    # "But when Neferu doesn't say anything, I look up."
    "Sed cum Neferu nihil dicit, oculos tollo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:173
translate latin a2s2_2b831b4c:

    # "I guess I expected to see a look of shock, or even horror on the jackal's face, but it mostly just looks annoyed."
    "Puto me exspectavisse stuporem aut etiam horrorem in vultu chacali videre; maxime autem iratus videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:174
translate latin a2s2_fde63e3e:

    # n "\"You know, I had suspected such a thing considering all of the odd quirks you possess, but I had also thought that even Amicus would not be so foolish enough to do it.\""
    n "\"Scis, tale aliquid suspicatus eram, omnibus illis miris proprietatibus tuis consideratis; sed putaveram ne Amicum quidem tam stultum esse ut hoc faceret.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:175
translate latin a2s2_ed07d11a:

    # "I feel myself grow a little defensive."
    "Me paulo promptiorem ad defendendum fieri sentio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:176
translate latin a2s2_e9f8af50:

    # m "\"Hey, he didn't know. We'd been contacted by the wolves before, but we lost the history of it somehow.\""
    m "\"Heus, nesciebat. Lupi antea nos convenerant; sed memoriam eius rei quodammodo amisimus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:177
translate latin a2s2_7d5b33aa:

    # n "\"Even so, he should have taken more care.\""
    n "\"Etiam sic diligentius cavere debuit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:179
translate latin a2s2_afac4355:

    # n "\"That's in the past now, however. We must focus on the present.\""
    n "\"Hoc tamen iam praeteritum est. Rebus praesentibus animum intendere debemus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:180
translate latin a2s2_699a6bcd:

    # m "\"Aren't you worried about getting in trouble?\""
    m "\"Nonne times ne in difficultates incidas?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:182
translate latin a2s2_8c05a777:

    # n "\"Me? Why would I be worried?\""
    n "\"Ego? Cur timeam?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:183
translate latin a2s2_5ca7dae1:

    # m "\"Isn't unauthorized First Contact like, really, really bad?\""
    m "\"Nonne Primus Congressus sine permissu factus valde, valde malus est?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:184
translate latin a2s2_0b06eeb0:

    # n "\"Well, yes, but I'm not the one that commited the crime. The burden rests on Amicus and on the wolves. I'm merely here to help a sapient that I did not know was an un-contacted alien.\""
    n "\"Sane; sed ego scelus non commisi. Onus Amico et lupis incumbit. Tantum hic sum ut ratione praedito auxilier, quem alienum nondum conventum esse nesciebam.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:185
translate latin a2s2_beb53b74:

    # "Neferu starts to wrap the bandages around the deepest cut on my arm."
    "Neferu fascias circa altissimum vulnus in brachio meo circumdare incipit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:186
translate latin a2s2_1b982da1:

    # m "\"And how did I become a citizen?\""
    m "\"Et quomodo civis factus sum?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:188
translate latin a2s2_bf0156a3:

    # n "\"I authorized it at the embassy shortly after the deal I made with Amicus. You were never officially his pet, thus never a member of the empire. We thought it best to simply grant you citizenship in the meantime.\""
    n "\"Hoc in legatione permisi paulo post pactum quod cum Amico feci. Numquam publice animal domesticum eius fuisti, itaque numquam pars imperii. Optimum putavimus tibi interim simpliciter civitatem concedere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:189
translate latin a2s2_6f98858f:

    # m "\"You can just...do that?\""
    m "\"Potesne hoc...ita facere?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:191
translate latin a2s2_158cece4:

    # n "\"Well yes, I'm the son of the Pharaoh.\""
    n "\"Sane, filius Pharaonis sum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:192
translate latin a2s2_49db7a95:

    # m "\"Don't I have to sign something..or something?\""
    m "\"Nonne aliquid subsignare...vel quid simile debeo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:193
translate latin a2s2_d137aae8:

    # n "\"It has been taken care of.\""
    n "\"Hoc iam curatum est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:194
translate latin a2s2_bf992361:

    # m "\"How?\""
    m "\"Quomodo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:196
translate latin a2s2_6060c90b:

    # n "\"Again; son of the pharaoh.\""
    n "\"Rursus dico: filius Pharaonis.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:197
translate latin a2s2_ad46aba7:

    # "I sit in silence for a while, trying to comprehend all of this while still worrying about Amicus."
    "Aliquamdiu tacitus sedeo, haec omnia comprehendere conans, dum adhuc de Amico sollicitus sum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:198
translate latin a2s2_9ad6d811:

    # m "\"Can we find out where Amicus is?\""
    m "\"Possumusne cognoscere ubi Amicus sit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:199
translate latin a2s2_6e84a551:

    # n "\"We will shortly.\""
    n "\"Mox cognoscemus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:200
translate latin a2s2_bf992361_1:

    # m "\"How?\""
    m "\"Quomodo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:201
translate latin a2s2_b7c284f3:

    # n "\"Even if it was supposedly a secret, word spreads fast in these halls.\""
    n "\"Etiam si arcanum esse dicitur, fama celeriter per haec ambulacra serpit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:202
translate latin a2s2_4fd6da99:

    # m "\"Why are you helping me? This is all so...crazy.\""
    m "\"Cur me adiuvas? Haec omnia tam...insana sunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:204
translate latin a2s2_57b4a069:

    # n "\"I've told you before [mc], it is the duty of a Khemian to help a sapient in distress.\""
    n "\"Iam tibi dixi, [mc]: Khemii officium est ratione praedito in calamitate versanti succurrere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:205
translate latin a2s2_c98c8996:

    # "I stare at the jackal."
    "Canem aureum intueor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:206
translate latin a2s2_5f0d9f6e:

    # m "\"Uh-huh, and why else?\""
    m "\"Ita sane; sed quae alia causa est?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:207
translate latin a2s2_1de069de:

    # "Neferu smiles gently at me."
    "Neferu mihi leniter arridet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:209
translate latin a2s2_49c4517b:

    # n "\"Despite our past interactions, I consider Amicus a friend. You are very important to him, and I see it as my duty to keep you safe...and would it be strange that I consider {i}you{/i} a friend as well?\""
    n "\"Quamquam antea inter nos quaedam acciderunt, Amicum amicum habeo. Tu ei magni momenti es; meum officium esse puto te salvum servare...et mirumne esset si {i}te{/i} quoque amicum haberem?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:210
translate latin a2s2_14b90d82:

    # "Friend."
    "Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:211
translate latin a2s2_070a335a:

    # m "\"Does this have to do with the alliance?\""
    m "\"Num hoc ad foedus pertinet?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:212
translate latin a2s2_c53ab923:

    # "Neferu continues to smile."
    "Neferu arridere pergit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:213
translate latin a2s2_347ce1ff:

    # n "\"I suppose there {i}are{/i} a few other reasons.\""
    n "\"Puto alias quoque aliquot causas {i}esse{/i}.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:214
translate latin a2s2_972b19f0:

    # "Those reasons are pretty easy to figure out."
    "Illas causas satis facile est intellegere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:215
translate latin a2s2_f4b08ce7:

    # "Keeping me protected will keep Amicus happy, and Amicus knowing that Neferu did that will make the alliance more likely...assuming we get out of this mess"
    "Me tutum servans Amicum laetum servabit; Amicus autem sciens Neferu hoc fecisse facilius foedus faciet...si quidem ex hoc malo evaserimus"

# game/a2s2.rpy:216
translate latin a2s2_80402a17:

    # "Obviously Neferu won't say, but knowing this is most likely the main reason actually makes me feel a bit better."
    "Neferu sane id non dicet; tamen intellegere hanc verisimiliter praecipuam causam esse me paulo melius habere facit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:217
translate latin a2s2_e048ed7c:

    # "I don't have to worry that the jackal has some other nefarious plan in store for me."
    "Non mihi timendum est ne chacalus aliud nefarium consilium de me paratum habeat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:218
translate latin a2s2_960cb6ac:

    # com "\"Virginia requests access to your quarters, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Virginia rogat ut in cubiculum tuum intret, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:220
translate latin a2s2_5442246f:

    # n "\"Ah, and here might be the answer to your earlier question. Granted, Com.\""
    n "\"Ah, et fortasse hic responsum quaestioni tuae priori habemus. Permitto, Com.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:222
translate latin a2s2_ecace549:

    # "The door slides open, revealing Virginia."
    "Ianua delabitur et aperitur, Virginiam ostendens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:225
translate latin a2s2_798a37f1:

    # "She doesn't look happy."
    "Non laeta videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:226
translate latin a2s2_1300969e:

    # "Immediately, she stalks into the room, eyes on me, glaring."
    "Statim magnis passibus in cubiculum intrat, oculis torvis in me fixis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:227
translate latin a2s2_805369e1:

    # "I wonder what exactly it is she's waiting for, then the door slides shut."
    "Mecum quaero quidnam exacte exspectet; tum ianua delapsa clauditur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:229
translate latin a2s2_faa38439:

    # v "\"What in the name of the Romanus have you done, alien?\""
    v "\"Per Romanum, quid fecisti, alienigena?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:230
translate latin a2s2_adaeddad:

    # "Neferu chuckles."
    "Neferu leniter ridet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:232
translate latin a2s2_c5215e39:

    # n "\"Easy, Virginia. He's been through quite a lot in the past hour.\""
    n "\"Lenior esto, Virginia. Multa ultima hora perpessus est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:234
translate latin a2s2_9fe64ac8:

    # v "\"Easy? Cassius and Cato are in hospital. Amicus is in the dungeons...Cassius is to become emperor! Our plans are in ruins, Neferu!\""
    v "\"Lenior? Cassius et Cato in valetudinario sunt. Amicus in carceribus subterraneis...Cassius imperator fiet! Consilia nostra eversa sunt, Neferu!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:235
translate latin a2s2_826f5b1c:

    # "The wolf folds her arms and walks around slowly so that she can better look at me."
    "Lupa brachia complicat et lente circumit ut me melius aspiciat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:237
translate latin a2s2_df803c26:

    # v "\"What happened?\""
    v "\"Quid accidit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:238
translate latin a2s2_816d8c09:

    # "My first instinct is to stay quiet, cross my eyes in that dull, vacant stare and pretend not to understand."
    "Primum instinctu cupio tacere, oculos in hebetem vacuumque obtutum convergere et me non intellegere simulare."

# game/a2s2.rpy:239
translate latin a2s2_3cdc5d3a:

    # "But then I realize I don't have to anymore."
    "Tum autem intellego mihi hoc non iam faciendum esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:240
translate latin a2s2_562a757c:

    # "I'd come to this realization after the second trial, but now that everything has fallen apart, now that I actually have some protection, I find myself bristling at the she-wolf's accusing stare."
    "Hoc post secundum certamen intellexeram; nunc autem, omnibus collapsis et me tandem aliqua tutela munito, indignor ob accusantem lupae obtutum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:241
translate latin a2s2_eab91f31:

    # m "\"Cato's a complete monster. He staged the third trial so that Amicus would lose. I used the nervo on Cassius and should have done the same to Cato, then Amicus ripped his visor off.\""
    m "\"Cato monstrum omnino est. Tertium certamen ita composuit ut Amicus perderet. Instrumento nervo in Cassium usus sum et idem Catoni facere debui; deinde Amicus oculorum tegumentum ei avulsit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:243
translate latin a2s2_15c598e5:

    # "Virginia gives me a look of surprise, probably not expecting me to be so honest...or maybe she's just shocked at how brutal things got."
    "Virginia me stupens aspicit, fortasse non exspectans me tam aperte loqui...vel fortasse tantum horrens quod res tam saevae factae sint."

# game/a2s2.rpy:244
translate latin a2s2_630a93ec:

    # "She then looks to Neferu who nods in response."
    "Deinde Neferu aspicit, qui respondens annuit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:246
translate latin a2s2_09f50656:

    # v "\"But why?\""
    v "\"Sed cur?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:247
translate latin a2s2_c9f08ce3:

    # "That's when I hesitate again, but again, I feel like it doesn't matter much anymore."
    "Tum rursus cunctor; rursus tamen sentio hoc iam non multum referre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:248
translate latin a2s2_933bd775:

    # m "\"Amicus made First Contact with my species.\""
    m "\"Amicus Primum Congressum cum specie mea fecit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:250
translate latin a2s2_3c70118a:

    # v "\"WHAT!?\""
    v "\"QUID!?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:251
translate latin a2s2_970ff615:

    # "The wolf looks horrified, bringing a paw to her muzzle."
    "Lupa horrere videtur et manum rostro admovet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:252
translate latin a2s2_f85767aa:

    # "Now this is the kind of reaction I'd expect."
    "Haec quidem responsio est quam exspectarem."

# game/a2s2.rpy:253
translate latin a2s2_5f35bab5:

    # v "\"Why would he do such a thing?\""
    v "\"Cur tale quid faceret?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:254
translate latin a2s2_63e86c88:

    # m "\"I don't know...his research on my planet told him otherwise, I think.\""
    m "\"Nescio...studium eius de planeta meo aliud indicaverat, ut puto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:255
translate latin a2s2_2574aae5:

    # "Virginia just stares at me, then looks away, toward the door."
    "Virginia tantum me intuetur, deinde oculos avertit ad ianuam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:257
translate latin a2s2_333fc668:

    # n "\"Honestly, knowing your brother, it's not all that surprising.\""
    n "\"Sane, fratrem tuum cognoscenti hoc non admodum mirum est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:259
translate latin a2s2_bd0f1f61:

    # v "\"I know my brother is an idiot. I did not know he's psychotic.\""
    v "\"Scio fratrem meum stultum esse. Nesciebam eum mente captum esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:260
translate latin a2s2_c69c49fc:

    # "Now I really bristle."
    "Nunc vere indignor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:261
translate latin a2s2_a54a971c:

    # "The idiot thing might be kind of true, but talking about Amicus like this after everything that's happened, while he's sitting in the \"dungeons\", wherever those are, it makes me angry."
    "Fortasse aliquatenus vere stultus est; tamen de Amico sic loqui post omnia quae acciderunt, dum in \"carceribus subterraneis\" sedet, ubicumque illi sunt, me iratum facit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:262
translate latin a2s2_8c6a0983:

    # m "\"Hey, he had no reason to believe we weren't part of the {i}Galaxias{/i}. The library, or archives, or whatever told him that we were. He just panicked and rushed things when he found out the truth...\""
    m "\"Heus, nullam habuit causam cur nos ad {i}Galaxias{/i} non pertinere crederet. Bibliotheca, vel tabularia, vel quidquid erat, ei nos pertinere indicaverat. Tantum perterritus est et res festinavit cum veritatem cognovit...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:264
translate latin a2s2_91a21646:

    # "Neferu and Virginia stare at me, looking unconvinced."
    "Neferu et Virginia me intuentur, nondum persuasi."

# game/a2s2.rpy:265
translate latin a2s2_3f739ce1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:266
translate latin a2s2_0c6a8b9b:

    # m "\"So where are the dungeons? Is he okay, can I see him?\""
    m "\"Ergo ubi sunt carceres subterranei? Bene se habet? Possumne eum videre?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:267
translate latin a2s2_e24b1a83:

    # "Virginia paces around to the side, staring into the fountain."
    "Virginia ad latus ambulat et fontem intuetur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:268
translate latin a2s2_e21865e9:

    # v "\"He was stunned by a drone, but was conscious as he was escorted. The dungeons are under the palace...possibly just under our feet.\""
    v "\"Automaton eum obstupefecerat; tamen compos sui erat cum deduceretur. Carceres sub palatio sunt...fortasse recta sub pedibus nostris.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:269
translate latin a2s2_9b72840e:

    # "I look down automatically at the marble floor, picturing the wolf sitting down there."
    "Sua sponte oculos ad pavimentum marmoreum demitto, lupum ibi infra sedentem animo fingens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:270
translate latin a2s2_73c53b2f:

    # m "\"Can I see him?\""
    m "\"Possumne eum videre?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:271
translate latin a2s2_eb8edf22:

    # v "\"Obviously not. Cato has allowed access only for himself. That authority will pass on to Cassius when he becomes emperor.\""
    v "\"Plane non. Cato aditum sibi soli permisit. Ea potestas ad Cassium transibit cum imperator fiet.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:272
translate latin a2s2_24316088:

    # "I continue to stare at the floor."
    "Pavimentum intueri pergo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:273
translate latin a2s2_90c1adf6:

    # "I feel better now that I know that he's at least alive, but I want to see him...I NEED to see him."
    "Melius me habeo nunc cum sciam eum saltem vivere; sed eum videre volo...eum videre NECESSE EST."

# game/a2s2.rpy:274
translate latin a2s2_ed1c2dfd:

    # v "\"So what do we do now?\""
    v "\"Quid igitur nunc facimus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:275
translate latin a2s2_993b3b13:

    # "I look up to see that Virginia's talking to Neferu."
    "Oculos tollo et Virginiam cum Neferu loqui video."

# game/a2s2.rpy:277
translate latin a2s2_65c22092:

    # n "\"I'm working on it. This will take time to sort out.\""
    n "\"Id ago. Tempus opus erit ut res componantur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:278
translate latin a2s2_ac9ba8cc:

    # v "\"And it was all going so well.\""
    v "\"Et omnia tam bene procedebant.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:279
translate latin a2s2_538511ae:

    # n "\"As it often does before it falls apart.\""
    n "\"Ut saepe procedunt antequam corruant.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:280
translate latin a2s2_a4ffe513:

    # m "\"What are you talking about?\""
    m "\"De quo loquimini?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:281
translate latin a2s2_4181d482:

    # "Virginia glances at me in mild surprise, like she forgot I was there."
    "Virginia me paulum stupens aspicit, quasi me adesse oblita sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:283
translate latin a2s2_f7667f32:

    # v "\"It does not concern you, [mc]. You look injured, why don't you rest?\""
    v "\"Ad te non pertinet, [mc]. Laesus videris; cur non quiescis?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:284
translate latin a2s2_1950528a:

    # "I stand up."
    "Surgo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:285
translate latin a2s2_c7f1b84d:

    # m "\"Look, I think by now you should know that I'm not some idiot slave for you to order around anymore. It was an act. I understand everything you say, and I know all of you have your own little agendas.\""
    m "\"Audi: iam scire debes me non iam servum quendam stultum esse cui imperes. Simulabam. Omnia quae dicitis intellego, et scio vos omnes parva vestra consilia habere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:286
translate latin a2s2_1fa05feb:

    # "I see Virginia bristling, but I just don't care anymore."
    "Virginiam indignari video; sed iam nihil curo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:287
translate latin a2s2_71704244:

    # m "\"But honestly, I don't really give a fuck what either of you want. I just want to help Amicus. So if that's part of this plan you're talking about, then I want to know about it.\""
    m "\"Sane autem minime curo quid alteruter vestrum velit. Tantum Amicum adiuvare volo. Si igitur hoc pars est consilii de quo loquimini, de eo cognoscere volo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:288
translate latin a2s2_e95fa0ec:

    # "The two aliens stare at me."
    "Ambo alienigenae me intuentur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:290
translate latin a2s2_4faf0456:

    # "Then Neferu starts laughing, but I cut him off."
    "Tum Neferu ridere incipit; ego autem eum interrumpo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:291
translate latin a2s2_019176c0:

    # m "\"Stop acting like everything's so fucking amusing to you! This isn't funny. Amicus is in trouble, and even though he put me in this mess, he's the only one I know for sure that gives damn about what happens to me.\""
    m "\"Desine, per deos, quasi omnia tam ridicula tibi sint agere! Hoc ridiculum non est. Amicus in periculo est; et quamquam me in hoc malum coniecit, solus est quem certe scio curare quid mihi accidat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:293
translate latin a2s2_2917827c:

    # "Thankfully, the Jackal does stop laughing, regarding me with those blue eyes."
    "Feliciter chacalus ridere desinit et illis oculis caeruleis me aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:294
translate latin a2s2_de33c459:

    # n "\"You're right, [mc], I apologize. I was just not expecting such a powerful retort. I like it.\""
    n "\"Recte dicis, [mc]; veniam peto. Tantum tam vehementem responsionem non exspectabam. Mihi placet.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:295
translate latin a2s2_f2e42d7a:

    # "He then turns to Virginia."
    "Deinde ad Virginiam se vertit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:296
translate latin a2s2_703a6ab8:

    # n "\"He's a part of this as much as we are. I believe he should know what we are up to.\""
    n "\"Ille aeque atque nos pars huius rei est. Puto eum scire debere quid agamus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:297
translate latin a2s2_3d947017:

    # "Virginia sniffs."
    "Virginia naso flatum edit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:298
translate latin a2s2_a1dd1ed5:

    # v "\"Granting him Khemian citizenship seems to have bolstered his boldness. I wonder if that was a mistake.\""
    v "\"Civitas Khemia illi concessa audaciam eius auxisse videtur. Mecum quaero an erratum sit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:299
translate latin a2s2_92c78e39:

    # n "\"It was necessary.\""
    n "\"Necessarium erat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:300
translate latin a2s2_4aa09714:

    # "Neferu then turns to me."
    "Tum Neferu ad me se vertit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:301
translate latin a2s2_7f062213:

    # n "\"[mc], these 'plans' were meant to be set in motion once Amicus became emperor. We both have...interests in Amicus becoming emperor.\""
    n "\"[mc], haec 'consilia' agi debebant simul atque Amicus imperator factus esset. Ambobus nobis...utile est Amicum imperatorem fieri.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:302
translate latin a2s2_40baac0a:

    # n "\"We did not interfere during the trials, but we did plan to begin our work when it was all but confirmed he would become emperor.\""
    n "\"Inter certamina non intervenimus; tamen opus nostrum incipere paraveramus cum iam fere certum esset eum imperatorem futurum esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:303
translate latin a2s2_8b60562d:

    # m "\"What 'interests'?\""
    m "\"Quomodo 'utile'?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:304
translate latin a2s2_ee4165a4:

    # n "\"Well, it may come as no surprise that I wish to have the alliance. Virginia on the other hand...\""
    n "\"Sane, fortasse non miraberis me foedus velle. Virginia autem...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:305
translate latin a2s2_adaff685:

    # "Neferu glances at her."
    "Neferu eam aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:306
translate latin a2s2_a3e2a6fd:

    # "The wolf barely seems interested and shrugs her shoulders."
    "Lupa vix rem curare videtur et umeros tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:307
translate latin a2s2_553f7fa8:

    # v "\"To be his chief advisor.\""
    v "\"Ut eius princeps consiliaria sim.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:308
translate latin a2s2_97bc9266:

    # n "\"In the end, we both agreed that Amicus would be best to fulfill both our interests as opposed to Cassius. We simply agreed to help each other accomplish these plans of ours.\""
    n "\"Denique ambo consensimus Amicum potius quam Cassium aptissimum esse ad ea quae uterque nostrum velit perficienda. Tantum consensimus alter alterum adiuvare ut haec consilia nostra efficiamus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:309
translate latin a2s2_4bde5c03:

    # "Interests."
    "Utilitas."

# game/a2s2.rpy:310
translate latin a2s2_27ebbcf7:

    # "I guess that's the appropriate word to describe what most relationships hinge on in this stupid empire."
    "Puto hoc verbum aptum esse ad describendum id quo plurimae necessitudines in hoc stulto imperio nitantur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:311
translate latin a2s2_b4b747f3:

    # m "\"Do you even care that your brother is in the dungeons?\""
    m "\"Curasne omnino quod frater tuus in carceribus subterraneis est?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:312
translate latin a2s2_c54eb3a8:

    # "I ask Virginia directly, surprising myself."
    "Virginiam recta rogo, me ipsum mirans."

# game/a2s2.rpy:313
translate latin a2s2_41b3f785:

    # m "\"Or do you just care about what {i}interests{/i} you?\""
    m "\"An tantum curas quid {i}tibi utile{/i} sit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:316
translate latin a2s2_84b40305:

    # "Virginia scoffs at me and Neferu gives me what I can only imagine is a warning look."
    "Virginia me deridet; Neferu eo vultu aspicit quem, ut puto, monentem esse oportet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:317
translate latin a2s2_e6b9b565:

    # v "\"I care deeply about many things. What I don't care for is being lectured by an alien who does not understand the meaning of wolven legacy.\""
    v "\"Multas res penitus curo. Quod mihi non placet est ab alienigena admoneri qui quid patrimonium lupinum significet non intellegit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:318
translate latin a2s2_1cad72d0:

    # "I don't say anything and Neferu coughs."
    "Nihil dico; Neferu tussit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:320
translate latin a2s2_eb696e60:

    # n "\"Anyway, we have plans to work together to see if there might not be a way to redeem Amicus and place him on the throne.\""
    n "\"Utut est, una operari instituimus ut videamus an via sit qua Amicus restituatur atque in solio collocetur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:321
translate latin a2s2_28a13001:

    # m "\"Already? Wait, did you already have plans to unseat Cassius if he won?\""
    m "\"Iam? Exspecta: iamne consilia habebatis ut Cassium deponeretis si vicisset?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:323
translate latin a2s2_fa71c540:

    # n "\"...Yes.\""
    n "\"...Ita.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:324
translate latin a2s2_b3a4f6c6:

    # "I shake my head, realizing just how much of a facade this entire empire really is."
    "Caput quatio, intellegens quantum totum hoc imperium re vera specie tantum nitatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:325
translate latin a2s2_76fe843c:

    # m "\"Well, then I want to help.\""
    m "\"Ergo ego quoque adiuvare volo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:327
translate latin a2s2_354b698d:

    # v "\"And what would you be able to do?\""
    v "\"Et quid facere posses?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:328
translate latin a2s2_570c40ff:

    # "While I never had a problem with Virginia while I was pretending to be a pet, I find talking with her directly to be rather unpleasant."
    "Dum animal domesticum esse simulabam, nihil umquam cum Virginia mihi displicuit; nunc autem recta cum ea loqui satis iniucundum invenio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:329
translate latin a2s2_005488cc:

    # "But I guess it makes sense that she'd be bitter towards me."
    "Puto tamen intellegi posse cur mihi infensa sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:330
translate latin a2s2_3ba4dda8:

    # "I'm technically the reason her brother is in the dungeons, and her chance of being advisor is now zero under Cassius."
    "Re vera ego causa sum cur frater eius in carceribus sit; sub Cassio autem nullam iam spem habet consiliariam fieri."

# game/a2s2.rpy:331
translate latin a2s2_fd2775ce:

    # n "\"Virginia may be right, [mc]. You're on unstable ground with Cato and Cassius...the two most powerful wolves on the moon. You should probably stay hidden in my quarters for the foreseeable future.\""
    n "\"Virginia fortasse recte dicit, [mc]. Res tuae cum Catone et Cassio incertae sunt...cum duobus lupis in hac luna potentissimis. Fortasse in cubiculo meo occultus manere debes quamdiu prospicere possumus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:332
translate latin a2s2_e499761a:

    # "I frown."
    "Frontem contraho."

# game/a2s2.rpy:333
translate latin a2s2_97be9352:

    # m "\"All day...every day?\""
    m "\"Toto die...cotidie?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:334
translate latin a2s2_d0c65d3d:

    # n "\"Yes.\""
    n "\"Ita.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:335
translate latin a2s2_7928cab4:

    # "I don't like the sound of that at all."
    "Hoc mihi nullo modo placet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:336
translate latin a2s2_34b4fbdf:

    # v "\"Well, you could be useful if the third trial was truly staged. Obviously your word won't hold much weight, but if we can find footage to go along with it, we might be able to put a dent in Cato and Cassius's image.\""
    v "\"At utilis esse posses si tertium certamen vere compositum erat. Sane verba tua non multum valebunt; sed si imagines simul invenire poterimus, fortasse existimationem Catonis et Cassii minuere poterimus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:337
translate latin a2s2_b04dc1fe:

    # "I look at Virginia, but she's already stalking off toward the door."
    "Virginiam aspicio; illa autem iam magnis passibus ad ianuam it."

# game/a2s2.rpy:339
translate latin a2s2_4077e4a8:

    # v "\"Unfortunately, I have to attend a meeting in Cato's stead, for obvious reasons. We'll have to discuss all of this in depth later.\""
    v "\"Infeliciter mihi conventui loco Catonis interesse necesse est, causis manifestis. Haec omnia diligentius postea nobis tractanda erunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:340
translate latin a2s2_9602b926:

    # "As she reaches out for the black panel, I suddenly have an idea."
    "Dum manum ad tabellam nigram porrigit, subito aliquid mihi in mentem venit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:341
translate latin a2s2_efaba556:

    # m "\"Virginia?\""
    m "\"Virginia?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:342
translate latin a2s2_e1872096:

    # "She doesn't say anything, but her ears perk."
    "Nihil dicit, sed aures eriguntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:343
translate latin a2s2_6bbdd771:

    # m "\"Could you...could you talk to Cassius when he's emperor about letting me see Amicus? I just want to make sure he's okay.\""
    m "\"Possesne...possesne cum Cassio, cum imperator erit, loqui ut mihi Amicum videre permittat? Tantum certus esse volo eum bene valere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:344
translate latin a2s2_f2c4d707:

    # "There's a short pause, as the door opens before I see her nod her head."
    "Brevis mora fit dum ianua aperitur; deinde eam capite annuere video."

# game/a2s2.rpy:345
translate latin a2s2_4e9cfe0e:

    # v "\"I'll see what can be done.\""
    v "\"Videbo quid fieri possit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:348
translate latin a2s2_abb52d0a:

    # "With that, she steps out and the door closes behind her."
    "His dictis, exit et ianua post eam clauditur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:349
translate latin a2s2_59bde580:

    # "I'm left alone with the jackal, my new...well, not master."
    "Solus cum chacalo relinquor, novo meo...sane, non domino."

# game/a2s2.rpy:350
translate latin a2s2_442e441d:

    # "I guess more of a partner."
    "Potius, ut puto, socio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:351
translate latin a2s2_88cb6798:

    # "He smirks at me."
    "Subridens me aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:353
translate latin a2s2_93d9df43:

    # n "\"Try not to antagonize her too much in the future.\""
    n "\"Conare ne eam posthac nimis irrites.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:354
translate latin a2s2_94dcc097:

    # m "\"She started it.\""
    m "\"Illa incepit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:355
translate latin a2s2_0868c412:

    # n "\"I recognize that, and it was wise of you to put your foot down not only with her, but with me as well—\""
    n "\"Hoc agnosco; prudenter egisti cum non solum ei sed etiam mihi firmiter restitisti—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:356
translate latin a2s2_c194fb52:

    # n "\"—but she's very, very smart, and it's essential we have her on our side.\""
    n "\"—sed illa valde, valde callida est, et necesse est eam nobis faventem habere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:357
translate latin a2s2_5098215e:

    # "He's not wrong."
    "Non errat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:358
translate latin a2s2_255036e3:

    # "I realized just before she left that she's basically my only connection to Cato and Cassius, both of whom I'd doubt would want to talk to me."
    "Paulo antequam abiret intellexi eam fere unicum vinculum meum cum Catone et Cassio esse; dubito an alteruter mecum loqui velit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:359
translate latin a2s2_6e90eae3:

    # n "\"Now—\""
    n "\"Nunc—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:360
translate latin a2s2_ce3e3f99:

    # "The Jackal moves to the door himself, calling over his shoulder."
    "Ipse chacalus ad ianuam it, capite ad umerum verso vocans."

# game/a2s2.rpy:361
translate latin a2s2_dc17fe48:

    # n "\"Unfortunately, I also must take my leave. I'm going to gather a bit of information from the city. I'll be back toward the end of the day. Again, try to stay inside this room. It's locked to everyone but the emperor.\""
    n "\"Infeliciter mihi quoque abeundum est. Paulo plura ex urbe cognitum eo. Ad finem diei redibo. Rursus te rogo ut in hoc cubiculo maneas. Omnibus praeter imperatorem occlusum est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:364
translate latin a2s2_1558f17a:

    # "With that, the jackal leaves the room as well, leaving me alone in the room."
    "His dictis, chacalus quoque e cubiculo exit et me solum ibi relinquit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:365
translate latin a2s2_f3994895:

    # "I lay back, wondering how things went so wrong, so fast."
    "Supinus me reicio, mecum quaerens quomodo res tam celeriter tam male cesserint."

# game/a2s2.rpy:366
translate latin a2s2_d2c76dec:

    # "I don't like any of this, and just like my first day on this moon, I feel out of place and completely out of my element."
    "Nihil horum mihi placet; sicut primo die meo in hac luna, me alieno in loco esse sentio et omnino incertum quid agam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:367
translate latin a2s2_d1cc0a89:

    # "I just wish Amicus were here."
    "Tantum Amicum hic esse velim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:368
translate latin a2s2_a33578e0:

    # "I roll over, hugging the pillow as I try to fall asleep."
    "In latus me verto et cervical amplector, dormire conans."

# game/a2s2.rpy:372
translate latin a2s2_cc37fe39:

    # "The idea of me staying in Neferu's room constantly for the foreseeable future doesn't last long."
    "Consilium quo perpetuo in cubiculo Neferu manerem quamdiu prospicere possimus non diu durat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:373
translate latin a2s2_db88b18a:

    # "In fact, a few hours later, I find myself leaving his quarters and wandering the halls of the palace like I have so many times before."
    "Re vera paucis horis post ex cubiculo eius egredior et per palatii ambulacra erro, sicut totiens antea feci."

# game/a2s2.rpy:374
translate latin a2s2_7b6f6680:

    # "Cato and Cassius probably won't be back for a little while, so I don't really have anything to be worried about as far as I know."
    "Cato et Cassius fortasse nondum paulisper redibunt; itaque, quantum scio, nihil re vera mihi timendum est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:375
translate latin a2s2_2c03ddae:

    # "Just as I'm thinking this, I see something out of the corner of my eye."
    "Dum haec cogito, aliquid ab extremo oculo conspicio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:378
translate latin a2s2_1e071ed5:

    # "A gray tail, green stripes..."
    "Cauda cinerea, virides fasciae..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:379
translate latin a2s2_f830a01c:

    # "Alexios."
    "Alexios."

# game/a2s2.rpy:380
translate latin a2s2_d5b7a0e8:

    # "Seeing the cat suddenly reminds me of all those suspicions I've been keeping bottled up about him, if only to keep the peace in the palace."
    "Fele visa, repente omnium suspicionum quas de eo in me continueram memini, vel tantum ut pax in palatio servaretur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:381
translate latin a2s2_1ace3202:

    # "Again, with all that thrown out the window, I find myself fast-walking in Alex's direction, determined to confront him."
    "Nunc rursus, his omnibus abiectis, celeribus passibus ad Alex eo, certus eum ipsum interrogare."

# game/a2s2.rpy:382
translate latin a2s2_4faf68c3:

    # "While I feel like complete shit after what's happened, I also feel completely liberated."
    "Quamquam post ea quae acciderunt pessime me habeo, me quoque omnino liberatum sentio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:383
translate latin a2s2_83ff813f:

    # "Cat's out of the bag."
    "Feles iam e sacco effugit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:384
translate latin a2s2_f26006df:

    # "I can basically say whatever I want now."
    "Iam fere quidquid volo dicere possum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:385
translate latin a2s2_f2e470f8:

    # "Well...mostly, definitely should still be careful."
    "At...plerumque tantum; certe mihi adhuc cavendum est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:386
translate latin a2s2_cabf6a62:

    # "I turn the corner as I'm thinking this and find myself standing just a dozen feet away from the cat, Alex bent over as he waters one of the plants."
    "Dum haec cogito, angulum circumverto et me tantum duodecim pedes a fele stantem invenio; Alex incurvus unam e plantis rigat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:389
translate latin a2s2_def6e2b9:

    # "He's humming again, and he's smiling when he looks up at me."
    "Rursus submurmurat; arridet cum oculos ad me tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:392
translate latin a2s2_54ee6b45:

    # "That smile immediately vanishes."
    "Ille risus statim evanescit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:393
translate latin a2s2_c18b7a21:

    # "He drops his watering can, sending it and the contents spilling across the floor with a clanging noise."
    "Urceum ad rigandum dimittit; is et quae continet cum clangore per pavimentum effunduntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:394
translate latin a2s2_2ca540ef:

    # "He basically lost all chance of looking not-suspicious in the first second he saw me."
    "Primo ipso momento quo me vidit omnem fere spem amisit ne suspectus videretur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:395
translate latin a2s2_374ce464:

    # al "\"Aaah!\""
    al "\"Aaah!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:397
translate latin a2s2_778a256b:

    # al "\"Uh, I mean...ah, [mc], how are you this fine morning?\""
    al "\"Em, dico...ah, [mc], quomodo te hoc pulchro mane habes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:398
translate latin a2s2_f9e0bab6:

    # m "\"Terrible. What are you doing?\""
    m "\"Pessime. Quid facis?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:400
translate latin a2s2_3049470f:

    # al "\"Oh! I'm...I'm so sorry to hear that. Are you feeling ill? What happened to your arm?\""
    al "\"Oh! Ego...valde doleo hoc audire. Aegrotesne? Quid brachio tuo accidit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:401
translate latin a2s2_30469cd8:

    # "Alex's eyes go to the bandage on my bicep, but I ignore him, taking a step forward."
    "Oculi Alex ad fasciam in brachio meo superiore feruntur; ego autem eum neglego et passum procedo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:403
translate latin a2s2_89e4ae61:

    # "In response, he takes one back."
    "Ille contra passum recedit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:404
translate latin a2s2_19b7a102:

    # m "\"What have you been up to?\""
    m "\"Quid egisti?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:405
translate latin a2s2_e066636a:

    # al "\"Up to?\""
    al "\"Quid egi?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:406
translate latin a2s2_f6e1e148:

    # "His eyes dart left and right, as if looking for an escape."
    "Oculi eius celeriter dextra sinistraque moventur, quasi exitum quaerat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:407
translate latin a2s2_cc6375c2:

    # m "\"Telling Neferu about me, telling the triumvirates about what I told you.\""
    m "\"De me Neferu narrasti, triumviris de eo quod tibi dixi narrasti.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:408
translate latin a2s2_c3b0ad22:

    # "I don't know if he actually did that last one, but his reaction seems to tell me."
    "Nescio an hoc ultimum vere fecerit; responsio eius tamen id mihi indicare videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:410
translate latin a2s2_54a8508b:

    # "His eyes widen as he backs away."
    "Oculi eius dilatantur dum recedit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:411
translate latin a2s2_f726992e:

    # al "\"I have no idea—\""
    al "\"Nihil omnino scio—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:412
translate latin a2s2_99e758a8:

    # m "\"Did you talk to Cato yesterday, after you saw me in the gardens last night? You realize what's happening right now, right?\""
    m "\"Locutusne es cum Catone heri, postquam heri noctu me in hortis vidisti? Intellegis quid nunc agatur, nonne?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:414
translate latin a2s2_6309bfbd:

    # al "\"[mc], you're scaring me...\""
    al "\"[mc], me terres...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:415
translate latin a2s2_5b826ac8:

    # "The cat continues to back away."
    "Feles recedere pergit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:416
translate latin a2s2_c165da08:

    # "I follow, and that's when Alex just gives up on his act, turns tail and sprints down the hall."
    "Eum sequor; tum Alex simulationem relinquit, se vertit et per ambulacrum rapidissime fugit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:419
translate latin a2s2_45a68153:

    # "Before I know it, I'm running after him, eyes focused on his thrashing tail as his sandals slap against the marbled floor."
    "Antequam intellego, post eum curro, oculis in caudam eius iactatam fixis, dum soleae eius pavimentum marmoreum feriunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:420
translate latin a2s2_718cb439:

    # al "\"Stop chasing me! I don't know what you want!\""
    al "\"Desine me sequi! Nescio quid velis!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:421
translate latin a2s2_84a97689:

    # "I don't bother responding, starting to reach out to grab the back of his robes."
    "Respondere non curo; manum porrigere incipio ut tergum tunicae eius prehendam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:422
translate latin a2s2_6efd6cce:

    # "Just as I make contact though, he comes to a sudden halt, pressing himself against the wall so that I stumble and slide past him."
    "Sed simul atque eum tango, subito consistit et se ad parietem premit, ita ut ego titubans praeter eum delabar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:423
translate latin a2s2_ec06f327:

    # "He's at a door, and he presses his paw to the black panel so that it slides open before he dashes inside."
    "Apud ianuam est; manum tabellae nigrae admovet, ut delapsa aperiatur, deinde intus irruit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:424
translate latin a2s2_fceb64d5:

    # "I don't think he was really thinking about where he was going to end up, because I know that that's the bathing room, and I know he's trapped."
    "Non puto eum vere cogitavisse quo venturus esset; scio enim hoc balneum esse, et scio eum in laqueo esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:426
translate latin a2s2_2b1c41c6:

    # "I turn around and run inside after him, just in time to see him (still sprinting) slip dramatically on the wet floor, flying through the air for a moment before landing painfully on the corner of the bath."
    "Me verto et post eum intus curro, in tempore ut eum adhuc currentem in pavimento umido vehementer labi videam; paulisper per aerem volat, deinde dolore in angulum labri incidit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:428
translate latin a2s2_ba91f865:

    # "I hear him wheeze before he plunges into the hot water."
    "Eum anhelare audio antequam in aquam calidam mergitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:430
translate latin a2s2_09f5b56f:

    # "If he lost his breath, it's back as he comes back up with a gasp, letting that all out in a scream of pain."
    "Si spiritum amiserat, is redit cum rursus emergit et anhelat, totum eum in clamorem doloris emittens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:431
translate latin a2s2_3dc25a3b:

    # al "\"AHHHH! HOT!\""
    al "\"AHHHH! CALIDUM!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:432
translate latin a2s2_8bfac41d:

    # "The cat scrambles out of the water clumsily, scrabbling at the sides with his claws before finally rolling out, looking small and disheveled with his fur all matted up against his skin."
    "Feles inepte ex aqua evadere conatur, latera unguibus scalpit et tandem extra se volvit; parvus et inordinatus videtur, omnibus pilis contra cutem agglutinatis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:433
translate latin a2s2_c7ceaa49:

    # "He curls up and, to my surprise, I see that he's crying."
    "Se contrahit; miror cum eum flere video."

# game/a2s2.rpy:436
translate latin a2s2_1ace0cab:

    # "This sight alone is enough to give me some doubts that Alex is the conniving saboteur I think him to be."
    "Hic solus aspectus satis est ut dubitare incipiam an Alex ille callidus subversor sit quem puto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:437
translate latin a2s2_0b0309e9:

    # "He looks so...pathetic right now."
    "Nunc tam...miserabilis videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:438
translate latin a2s2_ba8f45c3:

    # "I stand over him for a bit, looking down at his pitiful form before clearing my throat."
    "Paulisper super eum sto, miseram figuram eius desuper aspiciens, deinde fauces purgo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:439
translate latin a2s2_b8a72137:

    # m "\"Um...you okay?\""
    m "\"Em...bene te habes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:441
translate latin a2s2_ca4def9d:

    # al "\"Okay!? I think you broke my ribs!\""
    al "\"Bene!? Puto te costas mihi fregisse!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:442
translate latin a2s2_14eeaaa2:

    # m "\"ME!? You're the one that ran away for no reason!\""
    m "\"ME!? Tu sine ulla causa effugisti!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:444
translate latin a2s2_75071334:

    # al "\"No reason? You advanced upon me in a threatening manner!\""
    al "\"Sine causa? Mihi minans accessisti!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:445
translate latin a2s2_f907e305:

    # "The cat curls up again and makes some more sobbing noises, and I'm between believing him and believing that he's flat-out faking."
    "Feles rursus se contrahit et plures singultus edit; dubito an ei credam an eum plane simulare putem."

# game/a2s2.rpy:446
translate latin a2s2_be9ba7e9:

    # m "\"Sit on the bench.\""
    m "\"In scamno sede.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:447
translate latin a2s2_f64446a3:

    # "I reach down a hand to help him up, but he swats it away."
    "Manum deorsum porrigo ut eum attollam; ille autem eam repellit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:448
translate latin a2s2_0cd535bd:

    # "I narrow my eyes."
    "Oculos contraho."

# game/a2s2.rpy:449
translate latin a2s2_341e0da9:

    # m "\"Answer my questions, Alex.\""
    m "\"Quaestionibus meis responde, Alex.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:450
translate latin a2s2_24993c56:

    # "The cat finally sits up, sniffling and rubbing at his nose while the other paw clutches at his side."
    "Feles tandem se erigit, subinde naso spiritum trahens et eum fricans, altera manu latus stringens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:451
translate latin a2s2_76005d64:

    # al "\"I have no answers. I'm simply a pet.\""
    al "\"Nulla habeo responsa. Tantum animal domesticum sum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:452
translate latin a2s2_38069bad:

    # "Painfully, Alex gets to his feet before setting himself gingerly on the bench while stripping off his wet robe."
    "Alex cum dolore in pedes surgit, deinde caute in scamno considit, tunicam umidam exuens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:453
translate latin a2s2_dd61b0d1:

    # m "\"Yeah, and I was simply a pet just yesterday. I'm not as stupid as you think, Alexios.\""
    m "\"Ita, et ego heri tantum animal domesticum eram. Non tam stultus sum quam putas, Alexios.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:455
translate latin a2s2_f7bb9f54:

    # "Alex looks up at me, that pathetic, sad look replaced by one that I can't really explain."
    "Alex oculos ad me tollit; ille obtutus miserabilis et tristis alio substituitur quem vere explicare nequeo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:456
translate latin a2s2_cb0d52de:

    # "When he remains quiet, I try again."
    "Cum tacet, rursus conor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:457
translate latin a2s2_3f79192f:

    # m "\"I know everyone has 'interests' here. What are yours...maybe we have the same ones?\""
    m "\"Scio omnes hic 'utilitates' suas habere. Quae sunt tuae...fortasse eadem volumus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:458
translate latin a2s2_1d22ebce:

    # al "\"You're not being very subtle, are you?\""
    al "\"Non admodum callide celas, nonne?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:459
translate latin a2s2_a1e944a6:

    # m "\"What you did yesterday wasn't subtle at all. Who else would have told Cato that I was conscious again, that me and Amicus are lovers?\""
    m "\"Quae heri fecisti minime callide celata sunt. Quis alius Catoni narravisset me rursus compos mentis esse, me et Amicum amantes esse?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:461
translate latin a2s2_386573ed:

    # "Alex frowns then shrugs."
    "Alex frontem contrahit, deinde umeros tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:462
translate latin a2s2_47e0539f:

    # al "\"How am I supposed to know? I told Cassius last night. He could have told a number of people, especially Cato.\""
    al "\"Unde scire possim? Cassio heri noctu narravi. Ille multis narravisse potuit, praesertim Catoni.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:463
translate latin a2s2_665f9952:

    # "That makes me pause."
    "Hoc me consistere facit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:464
translate latin a2s2_740e2f16:

    # "Of course Alex talks to Cassius on a regular basis, probably every night."
    "Alex sane cum Cassio regulariter loquitur, fortasse omni nocte."

# game/a2s2.rpy:465
translate latin a2s2_1b70da13:

    # "It would make much more sense that the wolf was the one to tell Cato, rather than Alexios."
    "Multo magis rationi conveniret lupum Catoni narravisse, potius quam Alexios."

# game/a2s2.rpy:466
translate latin a2s2_4defcac6:

    # m "\"But what about the lovers thing? You were the only one that suspected.\""
    m "\"Sed quid de nobis amantibus? Tu solus suspicabaris.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:467
translate latin a2s2_4c52ffdd:

    # "Well, him and Neferu, but I know Neferu wouldn't tell."
    "Sane, ille et Neferu; sed scio Neferu non narraturum esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:469
translate latin a2s2_4aa5c8a8:

    # "Alex scoffs, having taken off his robe and in the process of examining his side."
    "Alex deridet, iam tunica exuta et latus suum inspiciens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:470
translate latin a2s2_cdb02323:

    # "It looks fine to me, no blood or anything, but he winces as he prods at it."
    "Mihi sanum videtur, sine sanguine aut re simili; tamen vultum dolore contrahit dum id premit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:471
translate latin a2s2_610e406d:

    # al "\"You think it wasn't obvious? It was a prominent rumor ever since the first trial.\""
    al "\"Putasne hoc manifestum non fuisse? Fama notissima erat iam inde a primo certamine.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:472
translate latin a2s2_91907f2b:

    # "That...and I guess Cato did walk in on us in bed together."
    "Hoc...et Cato quidem nos una in lecto deprehendit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:473
translate latin a2s2_54d9618a:

    # "I feel my resolve failing a bit, but then I remember Neferu again."
    "Sentio constantiam meam paulum deficere; deinde tamen rursus Neferu memini."

# game/a2s2.rpy:474
translate latin a2s2_53122dbb:

    # m "\"But Neferu told me that you confessed my intelligence to him...why would you do that?\""
    m "\"Sed Neferu mihi dixit te me ratione praeditum esse ei aperuisse...cur hoc faceres?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:476
translate latin a2s2_1b242024:

    # "This time the cat's reaction is rather different, his ears blushing as he looks away."
    "Hac vice feles aliter se gerit; aures eius rubescunt dum oculos avertit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:477
translate latin a2s2_44a6539f:

    # al "\"He was...he was curious about you, and he can be persuasive. I'm sorry I told him, but again I thought it was obvious...and I didn't think he'd tell you.\""
    al "\"Ille...de te curiosus erat, et persuadere potest. Doleo me ei narravisse; sed rursus putabam hoc manifestum esse...et non putabam eum tibi narraturum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:479
translate latin a2s2_3d303d39:

    # "Alex scowls, massaging his ribs."
    "Alex torve aspicit, costas suas perfricans."

# game/a2s2.rpy:480
translate latin a2s2_e2120fce:

    # "I glare at the cat, wondering if I'd just made a huge mistake."
    "Felem torve aspicio, mecum quaerens an modo ingentem errorem fecerim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:481
translate latin a2s2_4bcc1167:

    # m "\"But...what about the triumvirates. I told you first and then they all suddenly found out somehow.\""
    m "\"Sed...quid de triumviris? Tibi primo narravi, deinde omnes subito quodammodo resciverunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:483
translate latin a2s2_31a6ccac:

    # "Alex quirks his head."
    "Alex caput inclinat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:484
translate latin a2s2_b11a55ea:

    # al "\"Well, Cassius was discussing it with someone else, wasn't he?\""
    al "\"Cassius cum alio hoc tractabat, nonne?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:485
translate latin a2s2_180a4bd0:

    # "Virginia."
    "Virginia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:486
translate latin a2s2_b63c568d:

    # al "\"Maybe it was that person?\""
    al "\"Fortasse ille alter erat?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:487
translate latin a2s2_8e9297c9:

    # "Neferu had said they hadn't interfered at all in the trials, and Virginia didn't show any indication that she might have sabotaged her own brother."
    "Neferu dixerat eos inter certamina omnino non intervenisse; Virginia autem nullo signo ostenderat se fortasse fratrem suum insidiis impedivisse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:488
translate latin a2s2_c0cc995a:

    # "But then again, I have the feeling that she's probably a lot better at acting than anyone else here."
    "Sed rursus sentio eam fortasse simulationis multo peritiorem esse quam quemquam alium hic."

# game/a2s2.rpy:489
translate latin a2s2_2d4d4b32:

    # "I know I can't really trust anyone now...except Amicus...and maybe Neferu."
    "Scio me iam nemini vere confidere posse...nisi Amico...et fortasse Neferu."

# game/a2s2.rpy:490
translate latin a2s2_bbf660ba:

    # "I'd been so confident just moments ago, and now I find myself feeling guilty as I watch the sopping wet cat clutch himself, hunched over."
    "Ante pauca momenta tam certus eram; nunc autem culpam meam sentio, dum felem madidissimam, incurvam et sese amplectentem, observo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:491
translate latin a2s2_d3b1a112:

    # "I don't trust him to be telling me the truth, not at all, but I also don't trust myself in being so confident that he's lying."
    "Minime confido eum verum dicere; sed nec mihi confido ita certo credenti eum mentiri."

# game/a2s2.rpy:492
translate latin a2s2_c37a3bd4:

    # "So, shamefully, I reach out a hand, resting it on his shoulder."
    "Itaque, pudens, manum porrigo et umero eius impono."

# game/a2s2.rpy:493
translate latin a2s2_75f4b547:

    # "He flinches, then glares up at me."
    "Subito se contrahit, deinde oculos torvos ad me tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:495
translate latin a2s2_79ec4dd9:

    # m "\"Sorry...I just thought...I'm just trying to figure out what's happening.\""
    m "\"Ignosce...tantum putabam...tantum conor intellegere quid agatur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:496
translate latin a2s2_d8bd57d2:

    # "Alex carefully moves my hand off his shoulder, but he doesn't seem all that angry."
    "Alex caute manum meam ab umero suo removet; tamen non admodum iratus videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:498
translate latin a2s2_e788f16b:

    # al "\"That's fine, just...don't do it in such a brutish manner next time. You frightened me.\""
    al "\"Bene est, tantum...proxima vice ne tam ferociter facias. Me terruisti.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:499
translate latin a2s2_6960dfed:

    # m "\"Yeah, and sorry about your ribs too, even if you did it to yourself.\""
    m "\"Ita; de costis tuis quoque veniam peto, etiamsi ipse tibi hoc fecisti.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:500
translate latin a2s2_713c846c:

    # "Alex probably hears the smile creeping into my voice at the end of the sentence because he glares at me again."
    "Alex fortasse in fine sententiae risum in voce mea insinuantem audit; rursus enim me torve aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:502
translate latin a2s2_ee37ea5a:

    # al "\"That {i}really{/i} hurt, you know. And now I have to go to the city to see a physician. I'll have to take the awful, bumpy carriage too since Cassius forbids me from flying.\""
    al "\"Hoc {i}vere{/i} doluit, scis. Et nunc mihi in urbem eundum est ut medicum videam. Raeda quoque illa horrenda et salebrosa vehar, quoniam Cassius me aere vehi vetat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:503
translate latin a2s2_25f90e96:

    # "Alexios shakes his head."
    "Alexios caput quatit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:504
translate latin a2s2_567984cf:

    # "I rub my arm awkwardly."
    "Incommode brachium meum frico."

# game/a2s2.rpy:505
translate latin a2s2_51e734c7:

    # m "\"Why's that?\""
    m "\"Cur?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:506
translate latin a2s2_0147a4a2:

    # "Alexios looks up at me."
    "Alexios oculos ad me tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:508
translate latin a2s2_54dcb6a2:

    # al "\"Ever since his father's ship crashed and the investigation was botched, he's petrified of it.\""
    al "\"Ex quo navis patris eius cecidit et inquisitio male gesta est, aere vehi pertimescit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:509
translate latin a2s2_23da56fc:

    # m "\"Botched?\""
    m "\"Male gesta?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:510
translate latin a2s2_b9240da5:

    # al "\"Yes, so they don't know how it crashed. Odd thing, isn't it?\""
    al "\"Ita, itaque nesciunt quomodo ceciderit. Mira res, nonne?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:511
translate latin a2s2_6bff4e6b:

    # m "\"...Yeah.\""
    m "\"...Ita.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:512
translate latin a2s2_cad81d4d:

    # "Just when I was having my doubts, I get another flare of suspicion as to why he's telling me something like this, but I brush it aside for now."
    "Modo cum dubitare inciperem, rursus suspicio me incendit cur tale quid mihi narret; nunc tamen eam depono."

# game/a2s2.rpy:513
translate latin a2s2_cc5da70a:

    # m "\"So you know about everything that's happened?\""
    m "\"Ergo scis omnia quae acciderunt?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:514
translate latin a2s2_f3765cd2:

    # al "\"Vaguely, though I'd rather not be involved. Anyway, I suppose it's not so inconvenient for me that I go. I was meaning to visit Cassius in hospital today anyway.\""
    al "\"Obscure, quamquam malim non implicari. Utut est, fortasse non tam incommodum mihi est abire. Hodie Cassium in valetudinario visere volueram.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:515
translate latin a2s2_53a5ffe1:

    # "The cat stands up, bending down with a grimace to pick up his robes."
    "Feles surgit et vultu contracto se inclinat ut tunicam tollat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:517
translate latin a2s2_8cec16e9:

    # al "\"And...I am sorry about what happened to your wolf. I hope you're able to figure it out.\""
    al "\"Et...doleo quod lupo tuo accidit. Spero te rem expedire posse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:519
translate latin a2s2_803d6e2e:

    # "And with that, the cat walks out of the bathing room, his tail dragging limply behind him."
    "His dictis, feles e balneo exit, cauda post eum languide tracta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:520
translate latin a2s2_4a600b16:

    # "I want to say more to him, to figure out exactly what he's up to."
    "Plura ei dicere volo, ut exacte intellegam quid agat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:521
translate latin a2s2_be295f1d:

    # "I might have been wrong about him, but I also don't feel satisfied with his explanations."
    "Fortasse de eo erravi; tamen explicationibus eius non contentus sum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:522
translate latin a2s2_c535c1da:

    # "I can tell now that we're not exactly friends anymore, even before I caused him to shatter his ribs and boil in the hot tub."
    "Iam intellego nos non plane amicos esse, etiam antequam effecerim ut costas frangeret et in labro calido coqueretur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:523
translate latin a2s2_dae7b446:

    # "I sit on the bench for a while, thinking about soaking in the bath."
    "Aliquamdiu in scamno sedeo, cogitans an in balneo macerer."

# game/a2s2.rpy:524
translate latin a2s2_3f66df55:

    # "I realize then that the last time I did that was with Amicus, and doing so now, alone, would be way too depressing."
    "Tum intellego ultimam vicem qua hoc feci cum Amico fuisse; nunc autem solus hoc facere nimis triste esset."

# game/a2s2.rpy:525
translate latin a2s2_407fac9b:

    # "I get up and leave, hoping that Virginia took my request seriously."
    "Surgo et exeo, sperans Virginiam rogatum meum serio accepisse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:526
translate latin a2s2_bf60fd8a:

    # "Imagining the wolf below me, alone, is too much to think about."
    "Lupum infra me solum animo fingere nimis grave est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:528
translate latin a2s2_5cc624f3:

    # "So I head back out into the halls, deciding to just go back to Neferu's room and stay there like I'd been told to."
    "Itaque rursus in ambulacra eo, decernens tantum ad cubiculum Neferu redire et ibi manere sicut iussus sum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:531
translate latin a2s2_e393d82c:

    # "A few days pass like this."
    "Aliquot dies ita praetereunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:532
translate latin a2s2_7b3af0a9:

    # "There's a bizarre calm in the air."
    "Mira tranquillitas in aere est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:533
translate latin a2s2_13dc9331:

    # "The palace is quiet despite the absolute chaos that the top echelon of the empire is in right now."
    "Palatium quietum est, quamquam summus imperii ordo nunc in summa confusione versatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:534
translate latin a2s2_a69f555a:

    # "In the meantime, Cassius becomes emperor with surprisingly little fanfare."
    "Interim Cassius imperator fit, mirum quam parva pompa adhibita."

# game/a2s2.rpy:535
translate latin a2s2_16b242db:

    # "I watch it on the screens, the young white wolf's right leg and left arm in casts (which is explained several times to have happened in the third trial) as he's coroneted by Cato, who is now missing his visor."
    "Hoc in tabulis visoriis specto: iuvenis lupus albus, crure dextro et brachio sinistro fasciis rigidis obvolutis, a Catone coronatur, cui iam oculorum tegumentum deest. Aliquoties explicatur eum in tertio certamine ita laesum esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:536
translate latin a2s2_4f6f2bd3:

    # "That isn't explained to the viewers at all."
    "Hoc spectatoribus omnino non explicatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:537
translate latin a2s2_6a53447f:

    # "I don't feel much as this happens."
    "Dum hoc fit, non multum sentio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:538
translate latin a2s2_d1b504a2:

    # "Realizing how...fake all of this is, how it doesn't seem to mean anything despite how much I'm told it means—"
    "Intellegere quam...simulata omnia haec sint, quam nihil significare videantur, etsi totiens mihi dicitur quantum significent—"

# game/a2s2.rpy:539
translate latin a2s2_f2b2c71a:

    # "—It's all theatrics."
    "—Omnia spectaculum sunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:540
translate latin a2s2_e62e580d:

    # "What matters most now is taking the two of them down, and getting Amicus up and out from that dungeon."
    "Quod nunc maxime refert est ambos illos deponere et Amicum ex illo carcere attollere atque liberare."

# game/a2s2.rpy:541
translate latin a2s2_b2ad53b9:

    # "Even now, I'm not really thinking about getting home despite the fact that the Stretch Drive {i}should{/i} be returning at any moment now, if it hasn't already."
    "Etiam nunc non re vera cogito domum redire, quamquam Propulsio Dilatatoria iam quovis momento redire {i}debet{/i}, nisi iam rediit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:542
translate latin a2s2_429d9cf1:

    # "There are bigger things at stake here, the main one being my best friend's life."
    "Maiora hic in discrimine sunt, praecipue vita amicissimi mei."

# game/a2s2.rpy:543
translate latin a2s2_ed95eb50:

    # "And that's why on the third day after the fake trial, I find myself eagerly involving myself in a discussion with Neferu as he tells me his plans."
    "Ideo tertio die post simulatum certamen cupide colloquio cum Neferu me immisceo, dum mihi consilia sua narrat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:544
translate latin a2s2_a0c3c2a2:

    # "Cato is due back in the palace that day, and we both suspect he'll be making a trip to our room."
    "Cato eo die in palatium rediturus est; ambo suspicamur eum ad cubiculum nostrum venturum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:548
translate latin a2s2_e7052c68:

    # n "\"So the most important thing to the wolves is drama, a scene, something memorable. That's all they seem to care about around here.\""
    n "\"Ergo lupis maxime refert spectaculum, res palam acta, aliquid memorabile. Hoc solum hic curare videntur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:550
translate latin a2s2_947f4089:

    # "Neferu sniffs dismissively as he sips at his wine, and I find myself starting to see why Amicus might find him so irritating."
    "Neferu naso contemptim flat dum vinum sorbet; incipio intellegere cur Amico tam molestus videri possit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:551
translate latin a2s2_8caa68d7:

    # "Not that he's wrong though, and I usually find myself agreeing with him."
    "Non tamen errat, et plerumque ei assentior."

# game/a2s2.rpy:552
translate latin a2s2_d7ca4a8a:

    # m "\"So...make a scene that makes Cato and Cassius look bad?\""
    m "\"Ergo...rem palam agamus qua Cato et Cassius male videantur?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:553
translate latin a2s2_6c77ce37:

    # n "\"Well, most importantly we need to find...or even make up information about them that will irreparably damage their reputation in the public sphere.\""
    n "\"Praecipue de eis notitias invenire...vel etiam fingere debemus, quae existimationem eorum apud populum irreparabiliter laedant.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:554
translate latin a2s2_ce754e61:

    # m "\"Like what Cassius did to Amicus during the second trial?\""
    m "\"Sicut Cassius Amico in secundo certamine fecit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:556
translate latin a2s2_f93f2b76:

    # "Neferu smirks."
    "Neferu callide subridet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:557
translate latin a2s2_4d519c10:

    # n "\"Even worse than that, [mc], preferably something that shows disloyalty, or insults the pride of the wolves in general. That is something they often can't look past.\""
    n "\"Etiam peius, [mc]; potius aliquid quod infidelitatem ostendat vel superbiam luporum in universum laedat. Hoc saepe ignoscere nequeunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:558
translate latin a2s2_33a9c7bd:

    # m "\"Didn't Amicus having sex with you show disloyalty...or hurt their pride?\""
    m "\"Nonne Amicus tecum concumbens infidelitatem ostendit...vel superbiam eorum laesit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:560
translate latin a2s2_ec35e7f1:

    # "Neferu waves his paw dismissively in the air."
    "Neferu manum contemptim per aerem iactat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:561
translate latin a2s2_9593d90e:

    # n "\"No, it's been established amongst the public that he was simply furthering his goal of an alliance with my species, which was completely in line with his character.\""
    n "\"Non; apud populum iam constitit eum tantum propositum suum foederis cum specie mea persequi, quod moribus eius omnino congruebat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:563
translate latin a2s2_19ef8b35:

    # n "\"As for pride, well, he wasn't the one raising his tail.\""
    n "\"De superbia autem: Amicus caudam non erexit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:564
translate latin a2s2_3f739ce1_1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:565
translate latin a2s2_8623f08a:

    # m "\"So we need something about Cassius and Cato that's out of their character?\""
    m "\"Ergo de Cassio et Catone aliquid opus est quod moribus eorum non congruat?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:566
translate latin a2s2_ff99e2b0:

    # n "\"Yes, something that shows them to be not who they say they are. The public must distrust them.\""
    n "\"Ita, aliquid quod eos ostendat non tales esse quales se dicant. Populus eis diffidere debet.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:568
translate latin a2s2_21067664:

    # "Neferu strokes his chin."
    "Neferu mentum mulcet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:569
translate latin a2s2_76d348b2:

    # n "\"Would be convenient to have all that footage that Virginia was talking about, but considering how secure it might be, that could be impossible.\""
    n "\"Commodum esset omnes illas imagines habere de quibus Virginia loquebatur; sed considerato quam diligenter custodiantur, hoc fieri nequiret.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:570
translate latin a2s2_0b07a1af:

    # m "\"Worth trying to get though.\""
    m "\"Tamen conari eas adipisci operae pretium est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:571
translate latin a2s2_efdf166c:

    # n "\"Yes, I'll have to discuss that further with Virginia.\""
    n "\"Ita; de hoc mihi cum Virginia plura tractanda sunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:572
translate latin a2s2_0bb958dd:

    # m "\"So...what should I be doing?\""
    m "\"Ergo...quid mihi faciendum est?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:573
translate latin a2s2_62bce323:

    # "While it feels good to {i}talk{/i} about what can be done to help Amicus, I personally want to {i}do{/i} something."
    "Quamquam iucundum est {i}loqui{/i} de iis quae ad Amicum adiuvandum fieri possunt, ipse aliquid {i}facere{/i} volo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:574
translate latin a2s2_b64ec806:

    # "Neferu pauses, then smiles at me."
    "Neferu consistit, deinde mihi arridet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:576
translate latin a2s2_972a01a0:

    # n "\"[mc], my duty is to not put you in danger, as I've said. I won't have you—\""
    n "\"[mc], officium meum est te in periculum non adducere, sicut dixi. Non patiar te—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:577
translate latin a2s2_8b534487:

    # m "\"Well, I don't care. I need to help. I'll do whatever I have to do.\""
    m "\"At nihil curo. Adiuvare debeo. Quidquid necesse erit faciam.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:579
translate latin a2s2_cb251dd7:

    # "Neferu raises an eyebrow at me."
    "Neferu supercilium ad me tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:580
translate latin a2s2_e8900594:

    # n "\"Oh yes? Even if it might risk your own life? Cato is only barely tolerating the protective line that being a Khemian citizen affords you. I would not push him further.\""
    n "\"Itane? Etiam si vita tua periclitetur? Cato vix limitem tutelae tolerat quem civitas Khemia tibi praebet. Eum ultra non provocaverim.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:581
translate latin a2s2_e98119fb:

    # m "\"Then I'll do things behind the scenes. I don't care, I just want to do {i}something{/i}.\""
    m "\"Ergo res clam agam. Nihil curo; tantum {i}aliquid{/i} facere volo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:582
translate latin a2s2_32a0b6df:

    # "Neferu sighs deeply."
    "Neferu alte suspirat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:584
translate latin a2s2_68f8d597:

    # n "\"We'll see. Just keep in mind that the most important thing to Amicus is that you stay alive. That's what you can do that will help him the most.\""
    n "\"Videbimus. Tantum memento Amico maxime referre ut vivus maneas. Hoc est quod facere potes ut ei maxime prosis.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:585
translate latin a2s2_0a1dfa8a:

    # "I take that in, still not fully convinced that there's nothing I can do."
    "Hoc considero, nondum omnino persuasus nihil esse quod facere possim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:587
translate latin a2s2_e860a6a9:

    # n "\"But I'll certainly let you know if I believe there's a way for you to help. As for me, my status leaves me untouchable, unless Cato wants to risk another war, which I guarantee you he does not.\""
    n "\"Sed certe tibi dicam si viam esse credam qua adiuvare possis. Ego autem condicione mea inviolabilis sum, nisi Cato alterum bellum periclitari velit; quod certe, tibi promitto, non vult.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:588
translate latin a2s2_8e11c874:

    # m "\"I'd imagine. He has first-hand experience.\""
    m "\"Ita puto. Ipse expertus est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:589
translate latin a2s2_e4456107:

    # n "\"Indeed.\""
    n "\"Certe.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:591
translate latin a2s2_823fa6e7:

    # com "\"Neferu, Cato wishes to enter your quarters.\""
    com "\"Neferu, Cato in cubiculum tuum intrare vult.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:592
translate latin a2s2_1350736e:

    # "I jump, wondering if the walls are thin enough for the old wolf to have heard us."
    "Subsilio, mecum quaerens an parietes tam tenues sint ut senex lupus nos audire potuerit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:593
translate latin a2s2_359145d8:

    # "Neferu doesn't seem surprised though."
    "Neferu autem mirari non videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:594
translate latin a2s2_44be1822:

    # n "\"Ah, as we expected. Com, please tell him to hold for a moment. I'm in the nude.\""
    n "\"Ah, sicut exspectabamus. Com, dic ei, quaeso, ut paulisper exspectet. Nudus sum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:595
translate latin a2s2_3fa27c24_1:

    # com "\"Yes, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Ita, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:596
translate latin a2s2_6a0b1014:

    # "Neferu looks at me."
    "Neferu me aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:598
translate latin a2s2_2ab1c2ca:

    # n "\"I suppose our mission starts now. I have my own drone recording in the corner there, hopefully to catch the old man saying something incriminating.\""
    n "\"Puto opus nostrum nunc incipere. Automaton meum in illo angulo imagines memoriae mandat; spero senem aliquid dicentem captare quod eum accusare possit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:599
translate latin a2s2_fb7498bc:

    # n "\"What I'd like you to do is to crouch behind those bushes, keep hidden and quiet.\""
    n "\"Te velim post illos frutices subsidere, occultum et quietum manere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:600
translate latin a2s2_22e1f324:

    # m "\"What? I thought I was supposed to be involv—\""
    m "\"Quid? Putabam me participaturum—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:601
translate latin a2s2_7d5ebf16:

    # n "\"You will be, but I'd rather he not filter himself because of you.\""
    n "\"Participabis; sed malim eum propter te dicta sua non temperare.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:602
translate latin a2s2_b26feabb:

    # "I hesitate for a second, then quickly do as I'm told, even though I do feel bitter at the feeling of being tossed aside once again."
    "Momentum cunctor, deinde celeriter quod iubeor facio, quamquam acerbe fero me rursus sepositum sentire."

# game/a2s2.rpy:604
translate latin a2s2_6d86b2c8:

    # ca "\"Neferu, I will override the security again if you do not—\""
    ca "\"Neferu, tutelam rursus vi removebo nisi—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:605
translate latin a2s2_e45d8975:

    # "Cato's voice crackles over the speakers, but that's when the jackal opens the door, and for a moment, his voice comes from two places at once."
    "Vox Catonis per instrumenta sonantia crepitat; tum autem chacalus ianuam aperit, et paulisper vox eius ex duobus locis simul venit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:606
translate latin a2s2_89d8e88e:

    # "I'm pretty well hidden behind a few trees and bushes, my surroundings dark enough that I'm pretty sure Cato wouldn't be able to see me through the leaves and twigs I'm peeking through."
    "Satis bene post paucas arbores et frutices occultus sum; circum me tam obscurum est ut fere certus sim Catonem me per folia et ramulos videre non posse, per quos prospicio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:607
translate latin a2s2_013aa70c:

    # "The two males stand awkwardly across from each other before Cato suddenly strides in, forcing the jackal to step aside, though Neferu keeps that smug smile on his face."
    "Ambo viri incommode alter contra alterum stant; deinde Cato subito magnis passibus intrat et chacalum recedere cogit, quamquam Neferu illum risum sibi placentem in vultu servat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:609
translate latin a2s2_28f9d232:

    # n "\"What a pleasure it is for you to visit me today.\""
    n "\"Quam iucundum est te hodie me visere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:610
translate latin a2s2_db7eddf8:

    # "As Cato walks in, I get a look at his face for the first time."
    "Dum Cato intrat, primum vultum eius aspicio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:612
translate latin a2s2_43d69664:

    # "I'd seen that he lacked his visor in the broadcast, but seeing it up close..."
    "In nuntio transmisso eum oculorum tegumento carere videram; sed id prope videre..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:613
translate latin a2s2_97434863:

    # "The stern looks I'd always imagined under his now-broken machinery is definitely there."
    "Severitas vultus quam sub machinatione eius, nunc fracta, semper finxeram certe adest."

# game/a2s2.rpy:614
translate latin a2s2_2218f92c:

    # "His eyes have a milky, gray quality to them, heavily scarred."
    "Oculi eius lactei ac cinerei sunt, cicatricibus graviter deformati."

# game/a2s2.rpy:615
translate latin a2s2_9b9d6a7f:

    # "The old wolf stops just in front of the fountain, his ears perked up high."
    "Senex lupus recta ante fontem consistit, auribus alte erectis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:616
translate latin a2s2_43432064:

    # "I wonder if he can see anything at all, and Neferu asks just that."
    "Mecum quaero an quidquam omnino videre possit; Neferu hoc ipsum rogat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:618
translate latin a2s2_d966e5e5:

    # n "\"How is your sight, Your Former Highness?\""
    n "\"Quomodo visus tuus se habet, Pristina Celsitudo Tua?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:619
translate latin a2s2_c355d82d:

    # "I see one of those ears twitch before the wolf slowly turns around."
    "Unam illarum aurium moveri video, antequam lupus lente se vertit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:621
translate latin a2s2_d068ce07:

    # ca "\"Non-existent, young prince.\""
    ca "\"Nullus est, iuvenis princeps.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:622
translate latin a2s2_666e96b7:

    # n "\"Oh please, just call me Nef—\""
    n "\"Oh, quaeso, tantum me Nef voca—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:623
translate latin a2s2_9e1d0a9d:

    # ca "\"Where is the alien?\""
    ca "\"Ubi est alienigena?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:624
translate latin a2s2_9064acb9:

    # "Neferu pauses."
    "Neferu consistit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:626
translate latin a2s2_55c4bea0:

    # n "\"Alex? Or do you mean—\""
    n "\"Alex? An dicis—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:627
translate latin a2s2_32da7a70:

    # ca "\"You know damn well who I'm referring to, jackal.\""
    ca "\"Optime scis quem dicam, chacale.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:628
translate latin a2s2_9c769902:

    # "Neferu raises his paws defensively, even though Cato can't see."
    "Neferu manus ad se defendendum tollit, quamquam Cato videre nequit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:630
translate latin a2s2_196b4dd9:

    # n "\"Apologies, Cato. [mc] told me he would be in the gardens doing landscaping work.\""
    n "\"Veniam peto, Cato. [mc] mihi dixit se in hortis futurum, eos ordinantem.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:631
translate latin a2s2_33b5c5e5:

    # "Cato snorts."
    "Cato fremens per nasum flat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:633
translate latin a2s2_2a5c8d76:

    # ca "\"I didn't hear him out there.\""
    ca "\"Eum ibi foris non audivi.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:635
translate latin a2s2_5f541b5a:

    # n "\"It is a rather large garden. A very beautiful one as well.\""
    n "\"Hortus satis magnus est. Valde pulcher quoque.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:637
translate latin a2s2_d7ba8ad3:

    # "Cato doesn't respond, instead staring about the room."
    "Cato non respondet; potius per cubiculum circumspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:639
translate latin a2s2_4c3d52d9:

    # n "\"Would you like some wine?\""
    n "\"Visne vinum?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:640
translate latin a2s2_14f0b3a7:

    # "Neferu gestures at the bedside table, picking up his own goblet to take a sip...loudly."
    "Neferu mensulam iuxta lectum gestu indicat, poculum suum tollens ut sorbeat...clare."

# game/a2s2.rpy:641
translate latin a2s2_a8e34772:

    # "I see Cato's ears twitch again before he turns to the jackal."
    "Aures Catonis rursus moveri video, antequam ad chacalum se vertit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:642
translate latin a2s2_7d2c921b:

    # ca "\"What is your plan with the alien?\""
    ca "\"Quod consilium de alienigena habes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:643
translate latin a2s2_19355011:

    # "Neferu frowns."
    "Neferu frontem contrahit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:645
translate latin a2s2_8e868ae6:

    # n "\"Plan?\""
    n "\"Consilium?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:649
translate latin a2s2_00715c79:

    # ca "\"Do not ever play games with me. That will be my only warning to you jackal.\""
    ca "\"Noli umquam mecum ludere. Haec sola admonitio mea tibi erit, chacale.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:651
translate latin a2s2_51c567ae:

    # "Cato's voice is so cold and ominous that even Neferu's grin wavers, but he recovers quickly, taking another loud slurp of wine."
    "Vox Catonis tam frigida et minax est ut etiam risus Neferu vacillet; celeriter tamen se recipit et alterum haustum vini clare sorbet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:653
translate latin a2s2_9bca9df2:

    # n "\"Mmh, such good wine. One of the few superior products your people produce. Now, as for [mc], I'm simply fulfilling a promise to Amicus.\""
    n "\"Mmh, quam bonum vinum. Una e paucis rebus praestantibus quas populus tuus facit. Nunc, de [mc], tantum promissum Amico datum praesto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:655
translate latin a2s2_03756327:

    # ca "\"I see. That wasn't so hard to tell me then, was it?\""
    ca "\"Intellego. Non tam difficile fuit id mihi dicere, nonne?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:656
translate latin a2s2_e5dd1961:

    # n "\"Speaking of, quite astonishing that he was so easily beaten by Cassius, of all people.\""
    n "\"Quod eum attinet, valde mirum est eum tam facile ab ipso Cassio victum esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:657
translate latin a2s2_49112564:

    # ca "\"Quite.\""
    ca "\"Valde.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:658
translate latin a2s2_4ff94688:

    # n "\"I wonder how he was able to accomplish such a feat.\""
    n "\"Mecum quaero quomodo tale facinus efficere potuerit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:659
translate latin a2s2_9b0afdd0:

    # ca "\"It was broadcast. You would have been able to see it.\""
    ca "\"Publice transmissum est. Videre potuisses.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:660
translate latin a2s2_52b6518c:

    # n "\"Ah, well, I don't watch Adastran broadcasts; too much melodrama and propaganda for my tastes.\""
    n "\"Ah, sane, transmissiones Adastranas non specto; nimis multa affectuum ostentatio et suasio publica pro gustu meo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:661
translate latin a2s2_e15ad2b9:

    # ca "\"{i}Pugnu{/i} is a combination of skill and luck, and it's not always the strongest that wins.\""
    ca "\"{i}Pugnu{/i} artem et fortunam coniungit; non semper fortissimus vincit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:663
translate latin a2s2_d8820af9:

    # n "\"Of course. Though I have to wonder...might any of that luck have been, well...manufactured?\""
    n "\"Certe. Tamen mecum quaerendum est...num pars illius fortunae, sane...arte facta fuerit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:664
translate latin a2s2_7881f3ba:

    # "Cato is silent for a moment."
    "Cato paulisper tacet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:665
translate latin a2s2_9ee7aa7c:

    # "Cato being silent is when you know that something is very wrong."
    "Cum Cato tacet, scis aliquid valde mali esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:667
translate latin a2s2_1d3b7c36:

    # ca "\"Are you implying something, jackal?\""
    ca "\"Aliquid innuis, chacale?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:669
translate latin a2s2_d92e77ec:

    # n "\"Oh no, I'm simply curious. I came to study the politics and workings of the empire while also trying to improve relations between our species. I feel knowing all the facets of wolven politics is important.\""
    n "\"Oh non, tantum curiosus sum. Veni ut rationes publicas et instituta imperii discerem, simul necessitudines inter species nostras meliores facere conans. Puto omnes rerum publicarum lupinarum partes cognoscere magni momenti esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:670
translate latin a2s2_f031b388:

    # "Cato sneers."
    "Cato contemptim rictum ostendit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:672
translate latin a2s2_5a844cb7:

    # ca "\"There's a fine line between studying and spying here.\""
    ca "\"Tenuis limes hic inter discendum et explorandum est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:673
translate latin a2s2_adaeddad_1:

    # "Neferu chuckles."
    "Neferu leniter ridet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:675
translate latin a2s2_286ef92a:

    # n "\"Well, what I do know is that you wolves often go about things in a theatrical fashion, and it's sometimes hard to tell what's real or not. I assumed the fight to be, well...somewhat staged.\""
    n "\"Hoc scio: vos lupi saepe res more scaenico agitis, et interdum difficile est discernere quid verum sit. Pugnam putabam, sane...aliquatenus compositam esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:676
translate latin a2s2_5e0b83c6:

    # ca "\"Heh.\""
    ca "\"Heh.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:677
translate latin a2s2_61322697:

    # "Cato chuckles, and immediately I know that Neferu is making a lot of mistakes here."
    "Cato cachinnat; statim scio Neferu hic multa peccare."

# game/a2s2.rpy:678
translate latin a2s2_27758e99:

    # "I'm not sure what his plan is, maybe he'd thought that Cato would be more friendly with him, or that he could lull the old wolf into a false sense of security somehow."
    "Nescio quid consilium eius sit; fortasse putaverat Catonem sibi amiciorem futurum, aut se quodammodo senem lupum falsa securitate sopire posse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:679
translate latin a2s2_5b52700b:

    # "Maybe he's just trying to feel the old man out."
    "Fortasse tantum conatur animum senis explorare."

# game/a2s2.rpy:680
translate latin a2s2_733bb542:

    # "I also get the feeling that maybe he shouldn't have had all that wine before doing this."
    "Suspicor quoque fortasse eum non debuisse tantum vini bibere antequam hoc faceret."

# game/a2s2.rpy:681
translate latin a2s2_ed0f0d91:

    # "His suave, care-free attitude works on most, either to charm, or to annoy, but Cato is not someone I feel it will work particularly well on."
    "Suavis et securus mos eius plerosque movet, sive delectando sive irritando; non tamen puto eum in Catone praecipue bene successurum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:682
translate latin a2s2_b8cbc92e:

    # "Either way, it's clear Cato knows exactly what's happening."
    "Quoquo modo, manifestum est Catonem exacte scire quid agatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:683
translate latin a2s2_6b6e68ce:

    # ca "\"I know Khemians pride themselves on their own intelligence, but I have to wonder why considering your extreme stupidity.\""
    ca "\"Scio Khemios ingenio suo superbire; tamen mecum quaero cur, cum tam stultus sis.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:685
translate latin a2s2_e7179fa0:

    # n "\"Oh?\""
    n "\"O?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:686
translate latin a2s2_41dcd7f3:

    # "Neferu casually sloshes his wine about in his goblet."
    "Neferu neglegenter vinum in poculo agitat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:687
translate latin a2s2_f4668fea:

    # ca "\"Your arrogance amazes me, young one. I know you were fortunate enough to have been birthed after the war, but it's as if you were never taught the history between our peoples.\""
    ca "\"Superbia tua me mirari facit, iuvenis. Scio te satis felicem fuisse ut post bellum nascereris; tamen quasi numquam historiam inter populos nostros didiceris.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:688
translate latin a2s2_cac15ba2:

    # n "\"I've spent countless hours studying this history, Cato, and that's mostly why I'm here.\""
    n "\"Innumerabiles horas hanc historiam discens consumpsi, Cato; et praecipue ideo hic sum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:689
translate latin a2s2_5ab60353:

    # ca "\"Mostly. It seems the rest of that reason is to fuck with the delicate balance our empire is currently in.\""
    ca "\"Praecipue. Reliqua causa videtur perturbare fragilem aequilibrium in quo imperium nostrum nunc versatur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:691
translate latin a2s2_29890f9c:

    # n "\"Certainly not. I am merely an observer.\""
    n "\"Certe non. Tantum spectator sum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:692
translate latin a2s2_c9cc744f:

    # "I want to tell Neferu to shut up, to just tell Cato to go look for me out in the gardens, or something."
    "Neferu dicere volo ut taceat, ut tantum Catoni dicat me in hortis foris quaerere, aut aliquid simile."

# game/a2s2.rpy:693
translate latin a2s2_7bbb9892:

    # "I can see the hackles on Cato's shoulders rising, and I can only hope that the jackal was right about being untouchable."
    "Pilos in umeris Catonis erigi video; tantum sperare possum chacalum recte de se inviolabili dixisse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:694
translate latin a2s2_d6451289:

    # ca "\"I know I offered you to stay in this palace as long as you pleased, and I never withdraw an offer without good reason, but have you thought of moving out to the city? There are many more accommodations out there.\""
    ca "\"Scio me tibi obtulisse ut in hoc palatio quamdiu velles maneres; numquam sine bona causa oblatum revoco. Sed cogitavistine in urbem migrare? Multo plura ibi hospitia sunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:696
translate latin a2s2_7c164873:

    # n "\"Oh, no thank you. I much prefer it here. Everyone is so...interesting.\""
    n "\"Oh, non, gratias. Multo magis hic esse malo. Omnes tam...miri sunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:697
translate latin a2s2_105d7592:

    # ca "\"Heh, it is just like a Khemian to take full advantage of a wolf's tolerance.\""
    ca "\"Heh, Khemio prorsus convenit patientia lupi quantum potest abuti.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:698
translate latin a2s2_d56e9c5b:

    # "Neferu quirks an eyebrow."
    "Neferu supercilium tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:700
translate latin a2s2_b6d6fe1b:

    # n "\"Tolerance? Not a word I often associate with a wolf.\""
    n "\"Patientia? Non est verbum quod saepe lupo coniungo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:701
translate latin a2s2_bb5325b6:

    # "I can tell that Neferu's losing his cool as well."
    "Video Neferu quoque tranquillitatem amittere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:703
translate latin a2s2_72ed3674:

    # ca "\"Our tolerance for your arrogance was unprecedented.\""
    ca "\"Patientia nostra erga superbiam vestram inaudita erat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:704
translate latin a2s2_244e0b9d:

    # "Neferu seems confused for a moment."
    "Neferu paulisper perplexus videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:705
translate latin a2s2_ec88dc44:

    # n "\"Oh, are you referring to the war? I'm sorry, we're quite a bit more blunt where I'm from, so I did not realize what you were getting at.\""
    n "\"Oh, bellum dicis? Ignosce: multo apertius ubi natus sum loquimur, itaque non intellexi quo tenderes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:707
translate latin a2s2_f93f2b76_1:

    # "Neferu smirks."
    "Neferu callide subridet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:708
translate latin a2s2_f38003bb:

    # n "\"For a moment, I thought you were coming on to me much like Amicus did.\""
    n "\"Paulisper putabam te concubitum mecum petere, sicut Amicus fecit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:710
translate latin a2s2_53bb83f7:

    # "Defnitely too much to drink, or this jackal is a lot crazier than I thought he was."
    "Certe nimis bibit; aut hic chacalus multo insanior est quam putaveram."

# game/a2s2.rpy:711
translate latin a2s2_5eb26e84:

    # n "\"You wolves tend to be aggressive like th-GRK!\""
    n "\"Vos lupi tam feroces esse soletis, sicu-GRK!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:717
translate latin a2s2_3e35f0d7:

    # "Cato becomes a blur, closing the five foot distance between the two of them in less than a second."
    "Cato tam celeriter movetur ut vix videatur, quinque pedes inter ambos minus quam uno secundo transiens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:719
translate latin a2s2_cb6075bb:

    # "The next thing I know, Cato has the jackal up against one of the pillars, slamming Neferu so hard against it that I see the plaster crack and fall away."
    "Statim Cato chacalum contra unam e columnis tenet, Neferu tam vehementer allidens ut tectorium findi et decidere videam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:720
translate latin a2s2_339f987f:

    # "Neferu gasps loudly, kicking out at Cato a few times as he struggles with the old wolf's thick arms."
    "Neferu clare anhelat et aliquoties Catonem pedibus ferit, dum crassis senis lupi brachiis resistit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:721
translate latin a2s2_b8f7df3d:

    # n "\"G—get...off!\""
    n "\"L—laxa...me!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:722
translate latin a2s2_7fa384f1:

    # "Neferu kicks out again, this time at Cato's groin."
    "Neferu rursus calcem iacit, hac vice in inguen Catonis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:723
translate latin a2s2_f11567ec:

    # "If the old wolf felt anything, he doesn't show it, instead holding Neferu tightly in place while he snarls in his face."
    "Si senex lupus quidquam sensit, id non ostendit; potius Neferu firmiter in loco tenet et in vultum eius fremit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:724
translate latin a2s2_098399bf:

    # ca "\"Speaking of tolerance...I have tolerated YOUR arrogance for far too long...just because you are the Pharaoh's son.\""
    ca "\"Quod patientiam attinet...superbiam TUAM nimis diu toleravi...tantum quia filius Pharaonis es.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:725
translate latin a2s2_2a2569bd:

    # ca "\"The {i}second{/i} son, and of a ruler who has so little power over his kingdom in the first place. I shouldn't be surprised—\""
    ca "\"Filius {i}secundus{/i}; et rectoris cui regnum suum iam tam parum paret. Mirari non debui—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:727
translate latin a2s2_0566bb53:

    # "Cato pulls Neferu forward then slams him back against the pillar again, causing more plaster to fall and the jackal's teeth to clack together loud enough that I can hear it."
    "Cato Neferu ante trahit, deinde rursus contra columnam allidit, ita ut plus tectorii cadat et dentes chacali tam clare inter se collidantur ut eos audiam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:728
translate latin a2s2_622a6b0e:

    # ca "\"You're all the fucking same, every single one of you, but somehow you're the worst I've yet to meet.\""
    ca "\"Omnes, per deos, iidem estis, unusquisque vestrum; tamen tu quodammodo pessimus es quem adhuc conveni.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:730
translate latin a2s2_16d6610c:

    # "Again, Cato slams Neferu against the pillar, and I start to stand up, wishing I had a nervo."
    "Rursus Cato Neferu contra columnam allidit; ego surgere incipio, optans instrumentum nervo habere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:731
translate latin a2s2_0e9fbcdf:

    # "Neferu growls, trying another kick."
    "Neferu fremit et aliam calcis percussionem conatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:732
translate latin a2s2_25c58b11:

    # ca "\"Is this the next generation of Khemian we must deal with? I know you weren't alive for the war, but it seems another one is inevitable if you're an example of what's to come!\""
    ca "\"Haec est proxima Khemiorum generatio quacum agere debemus? Scio te inter bellum nondum vixisse; sed aliud bellum inevitabile videtur si tu exemplum es eorum qui futuri sunt!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:733
translate latin a2s2_3ea3480d:

    # "Neferu tries to speak, but lets out a choked cough."
    "Neferu loqui conatur; sed tussim suffocatam emittit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:734
translate latin a2s2_dfbc9ee1:

    # ca "\"Hmm?\""
    ca "\"Hmm?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:735
translate latin a2s2_fabe3b89:

    # "Cato loosens his grasp and Neferu gasps a few times."
    "Cato tenacitatem laxat; Neferu aliquoties anhelat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:736
translate latin a2s2_2aa2e1cf:

    # n "\"You...know...Amicus was...a bit less rough...but if you wanted to put your paws on me, you only had to—\""
    n "\"Tu...scis...Amicus...paulo lenior erat...sed si manus mihi imponere volebas, tantum debebas—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:738
translate latin a2s2_98e4f76a:

    # "This time, Cato almost lifts the jackal off his feet, cutting Neferu off with a horrific gag, like he's throwing up."
    "Hac vice Cato chacalum paene a pedibus tollit et Neferu interrumpit horrendo suffocationis sono, quasi vomat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:739
translate latin a2s2_52f9f5b4:

    # ca "\"I must say, you have a funny way of going about building an alliance. It's as if you thought tail-raising would get you whatever you wanted.\""
    ca "\"Dicendum est te miro modo foedus construere. Quasi putavisses caudam erigere tibi quidquid velles conciliaturum esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:740
translate latin a2s2_94424998:

    # "Now Neferu really starts to struggle, kicking around aimlessly, throwing his head left and right, sending drool flinging from his muzzle."
    "Nunc Neferu vere luctari incipit, pedibus sine fine iactatis, capite dextra sinistraque agitato et saliva e rostro sparsa."

# game/a2s2.rpy:741
translate latin a2s2_ae28f6e2:

    # "Cato doesn't relent, and I know this is my cue to do something."
    "Cato non cedit; scio nunc mihi aliquid faciendum esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:742
translate latin a2s2_328b1bee:

    # ca "\"It's been a while since I've killed a jackal. My paws have been itching to do it again. Maybe you'll be my next?\""
    ca "\"Iam diu est ex quo chacalum occidi. Manus meae rursus hoc facere gestiunt. Fortasse tu proximus eris?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:743
translate latin a2s2_23157c03:

    # "I don't know what to do exactly."
    "Nescio exacte quid faciam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:744
translate latin a2s2_6c4b1d89:

    # "I have no weapon, but I wonder if maybe I can at least distract the wolf long enough for Neferu to get away, to breathe again."
    "Nullum telum habeo; tamen mecum quaero an saltem lupum tam diu distrahere possim ut Neferu effugiat et rursus respiret."

# game/a2s2.rpy:745
translate latin a2s2_25ea1c44:

    # "So I run out of my hiding spot, rustling the branches and leaves as I do."
    "Itaque ex latebra mea curro, ramos et folia dum exeo susurrantia faciens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:746
translate latin a2s2_c4d9e78a:

    # "Cato is so focused on what he's doing to Neferu that he doesn't seem to even hear me."
    "Cato tam intentus est in eo quod Neferu facit ut me ne audire quidem videatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:747
translate latin a2s2_cd8e76bb:

    # "As I run at him, I can see the wolf grinning maniacally into Neferu's face, like this really is something he's been wanting to do for a very long time."
    "Dum in eum curro, lupum furiose in vultum Neferu ridentem video, quasi hoc vere diu facere voluerit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:748
translate latin a2s2_64ea04f5:

    # "He finally seems to hear me at the last second, turning his head in my direction before I lower my shoulder to try and tackle him off of Neferu."
    "Tandem ultimo momento me audire videtur et caput versus me vertit; ego umerum demitto ut eum impetu a Neferu removeam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:752
translate latin a2s2_8de6df84:

    # "It's like hitting a brick wall covered in fur."
    "Quasi parietem latericium pilis obtectum feriam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:753
translate latin a2s2_3b6eb23e:

    # "I make contact with the old man's side, and for a moment I get a whiff of musk and perfume before I'm sent right back down on my ass."
    "Latus senis ferio; paulisper odorem corporis et unguentorum sentio, deinde recta rursus in nates cadere cogor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:754
translate latin a2s2_017afb26:

    # "I wonder for a moment if I've dislocated my shoulder, looking up in a daze at what result my attack might have had, if any."
    "Paulisper mecum quaero an umerum loco moverim, attonitus suspiciens quem effectum impetus meus habuerit, si quem habuit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:755
translate latin a2s2_4b3aa748:

    # "To my relief, I see Neferu on his paws and knees, gagging and coughing, drool stringing from his muzzle."
    "Levatus video Neferu manibus genibusque nixum, nauseantem et tussientem, saliva e rostro filis pendente."

# game/a2s2.rpy:756
translate latin a2s2_bd18ac9b:

    # "Cato is standing slightly to the side, looking in my direction, over my head, but he clearly knows where I am."
    "Cato paulo ad latus stat et versus me, supra caput meum, aspicit; manifeste tamen scit ubi sim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:757
translate latin a2s2_1848f4fa:

    # "He only focuses on me for a moment though, then he turns his head in the direction of the coughing jackal, Neferu crawling away at this point."
    "Sed momentum tantum mihi animum attendit, deinde caput versus tussientem chacalum vertit; Neferu iam reptans recedit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:758
translate latin a2s2_17476a28:

    # "Cato makes his way towards him before drawing back a foot."
    "Cato ad eum accedit, deinde pedem retro ducit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:759
translate latin a2s2_3768a9e6:

    # "I can only reach out, not even having enough time to ask Cato to stop before the wolf kicks the jackal between the legs."
    "Tantum manum porrigere possum; ne tempus quidem habeo Catonem rogandi ut desistat, antequam lupus chacalum inter crura calce ferit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:761
translate latin a2s2_1ebb5a77:

    # "He does it so hard that I see Neferu's knees skip off the ground for a moment before he pitches face-first into the marble, on his knees and clutching at himself as he lets out a howl of agony."
    "Tam vehementer facit ut genua Neferu momentum a terra subsilire videam; deinde vultu primum in marmor incidit, genibus nixus et se stringens, ululatum summi doloris edens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:762
translate latin a2s2_78be6c62:

    # "I cringe, immediately thinking of the time I kicked Amicus, and how much harder Cato must have kicked Neferu."
    "Vultum contraho, statim memor temporis quo Amicum calce percussi et quanto vehementius Cato Neferu percussisse debeat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:763
translate latin a2s2_f772f9cd:

    # "I start to move towards them again, in case Cato thinks of doing anything else, but the old wolf simply stands there, breathing heavily, head tilted down as he listens to Neferu moan."
    "Rursus ad eos moveri incipio, si forte Cato quid aliud facere velit; senex autem lupus tantum ibi stat, graviter respirans, capite demisso dum Neferu gementem audit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:765
translate latin a2s2_3adf7842:

    # ca "\"For the kicks you gave me earlier...that should put your whoring out of commission for a few days, no?\""
    ca "\"Pro calcibus quibus antea me feristi...hoc scortationem tuam per aliquot dies impediet, nonne?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:766
translate latin a2s2_e9abf46b:

    # "Neferu is curled up on his knees at this point, paws tucked into himself."
    "Neferu iam in genibus contractus est, manibus intra se conditis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:767
translate latin a2s2_9e94989c:

    # "It's at this point that I see a gush of red liquid overflow from his muzzle, and for one horrific moment, I wonder if somehow Cato had kicked him so hard that he'd ruptured his organs, or something..."
    "Tum video liquorem rubrum e rostro eius abundanter effundi; uno horrendo momento mecum quaero an Cato eum tam vehementer calce ferire potuerit ut viscera eius rupta sint, aut quid simile..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:768
translate latin a2s2_95440210:

    # "...but no, it's the wine, and it spills across the marble."
    "...sed non, vinum est et per marmor effunditur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:769
translate latin a2s2_36e15300:

    # "Cato wrinkles his nose at the retching sounds before carefully stepping around the jackal."
    "Cato ad sonos vomentis nasum contrahit, deinde caute circa chacalum transit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:771
translate latin a2s2_2b94f286:

    # ca "\"As I said, I won't withdraw my offer for you to stay, but there are many apartments open in the city...just know that you will not be able to take your new 'citizen' with you.\""
    ca "\"Sicut dixi, oblatum meum ut hic maneas non revocabo; sed multae diaetae in urbe vacant...tantum scito te novum 'civem' tuum tecum ducere non posse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:772
translate latin a2s2_de572135:

    # ca "\"Otherwise, I'd like to try this discussion again in the future, if you're willing to be more cooperative.\""
    ca "\"Alioquin velim hoc colloquium postea rursus conari, si promptior eris ad cooperandum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:773
translate latin a2s2_051f1133:

    # "With that, the old wolf stalks out of the bedroom."
    "His dictis, senex lupus magnis passibus e cubiculo exit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:775
translate latin a2s2_d70c7b73:

    # "At the same time, two white drones float in, hovering over Neferu."
    "Simul duo automata alba intus volitant et super Neferu pendent."

# game/a2s2.rpy:776
translate latin a2s2_34051599:

    # "One lowers itself to the ground to begin cleaning up the mess while the other holds out what looks like a couple capsules on a plate, which it balances on a metal appendage."
    "Alterum ad terram descendit ut sordes purgare incipiat; alterum quod duas fere capsulas esse videtur in patina porrigit, quam in appendice metallica librat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:777
translate latin a2s2_c3871582:

    # com "\"Neferu, you seem to have vomited. Would you like anti-nausea medication?\""
    com "\"Neferu, vomuisse videris. Visne medicamentum contra nauseam?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:778
translate latin a2s2_a51293c4:

    # "I stumble over to the jackal to kneel at his side and try to help in any way that I can."
    "Titubans ad chacalum accedo, ut ad latus eius genua flectam et quoquo modo possim adiuvare coner."

# game/a2s2.rpy:779
translate latin a2s2_2a14a374:

    # "He simply keeps his eyes screwed shut, holding up a paw before returning it to his sore spot."
    "Tantum oculos firmiter clausos tenet et manum tollit, deinde eam ad locum dolentem reddit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:780
translate latin a2s2_7a64487e:

    # "Awkwardly, I rub at his shoulder, trying to ignore the smell as the drone does its work of cleaning up the puke."
    "Incommode umerum eius frico, odorem neglegere conans dum automaton vomitum purgat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:781
translate latin a2s2_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:782
translate latin a2s2_1ddd22fa:

    # "A few minutes later, I manage to help the jackal to the bed, his breath ragged the entire way."
    "Paucis minutis post chacalum ad lectum adiuvare possum, spiritu eius tota via aspero."

# game/a2s2.rpy:783
translate latin a2s2_02940988:

    # "It's strange seeing him like this."
    "Mirum est eum sic videre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:784
translate latin a2s2_57db973b:

    # "Usually so confident and in control."
    "Plerumque tam certus sui et compos rerum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:785
translate latin a2s2_8f129225:

    # "I never expected anyone to do anything like this to him...but I guess if someone was going to do it, it was Cato."
    "Numquam exspectavi quemquam tale quid ei facturum...sed puto, si quis id facturus erat, eum Catonem esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:786
translate latin a2s2_8ec45018:

    # m "\"Are you sure you're okay?\""
    m "\"Certusne es te bene valere?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:787
translate latin a2s2_331fa012:

    # "I ask for what's probably the third time as I sit next to him, and Neferu manages a smile despite the clear pain he's in."
    "Fortasse tertia vice hoc rogo, ad latus eius sedens; Neferu arridere potest, quamquam manifeste dolet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:790
translate latin a2s2_af2a9f64:

    # n "\"Ugh...no, but I'll have to go to the physician to be sure...all the way in the city since Cato saw fit to imprison the palace doctor.\""
    n "\"Ugh...non, sed ad medicum eundum est ut certus sim...usque in urbem, quoniam Catoni placuit medicum palatii in carcerem mittere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:791
translate latin a2s2_c15885b1:

    # m "\"Do you need like...ice, or something? I dunno, he hit you so fucking hard.\""
    m "\"Egesne...glacie aut re simili? Nescio; per deos, tam vehementer te percussit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:793
translate latin a2s2_b97cbccf:

    # n "\"I'll manage. I just miscalculated. I'll know how to handle him in the future.\""
    n "\"Me expediam. Tantum rationes perperam duxi. Posthac sciam quomodo eum tractem.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:794
translate latin a2s2_31733592:

    # "I frown, not really feeling like that's the case."
    "Frontem contraho, non re vera credens rem ita esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:795
translate latin a2s2_17e88264:

    # "As I'm trying to help him though, Com's voice comes over the intercom again."
    "Dum tamen eum adiuvare conor, vox Com rursus per instrumenta ad colloquendum auditur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:796
translate latin a2s2_15b075bb:

    # com "\"Virginia requests access to your room, Neferu.\""
    com "\"Virginia rogat ut in cubiculum tuum intret, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:797
translate latin a2s2_3c81a36f:

    # "Neferu suddenly straightens up, moving his paws from his crotch to his thighs."
    "Neferu subito corpus erigit, manus ab inguine ad femora movens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:799
translate latin a2s2_e35e7ce5:

    # n "\"Granted.\""
    n "\"Permitto.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:802
translate latin a2s2_3cb7ae6c:

    # "She nods at the two of us before wrinkling her nose."
    "Nobis ambobus annuit, deinde nasum contrahit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:804
translate latin a2s2_3d555a62:

    # v "\"Ugh, smells like rancid wine in here.\""
    v "\"Ugh, vinum rancidum hic olet.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:805
translate latin a2s2_12a517e9:

    # n "\"Indeed. What did you need, Virginia?\""
    n "\"Certe. Quid opus tibi erat, Virginia?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:806
translate latin a2s2_56b15f16:

    # "To my surprise, Virginia turns to me."
    "Miror cum Virginia ad me se vertit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:808
translate latin a2s2_f1ffc131:

    # "Instead of the hostile expression she'd been wearing the last time we'd encountered each other, it's much kinder, much to my relief."
    "Pro vultu infenso quem ultima vice qua inter nos convenimus habuerat, multo benignior est; hoc me valde levat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:809
translate latin a2s2_b772c142:

    # v "\"[mc]? I had a discussion with Cassius about seeing Amicus. He seems accepting of the idea, under one condition.\""
    v "\"[mc]? Cum Cassio de Amico videndo locuta sum. Videtur rem accipere, sub una condicione.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:810
translate latin a2s2_f85b39eb:

    # "There's a pause."
    "Paulisper tacet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:811
translate latin a2s2_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"Quid?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:813
translate latin a2s2_edfe6f38:

    # v "\"Well, he wishes to speak with you in private.\""
    v "\"Sane, tecum solus loqui vult.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:814
translate latin a2s2_bb870827:

    # m "\"Private?\""
    m "\"Solus?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:815
translate latin a2s2_76421756:

    # "Neferu immediately speaks up next to me."
    "Neferu statim iuxta me loquitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:816
translate latin a2s2_3bb9c1a2:

    # n "\"That is not wise, [mc]. We should negotiate with him to allow me to be there.\""
    n "\"Hoc imprudens est, [mc]. Cum eo agere debemus ut me adesse permittat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:817
translate latin a2s2_b9fb6640:

    # "Virginia laughs."
    "Virginia ridet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:819
translate latin a2s2_1ad5b297:

    # v "\"You really think Cassius would allow a Khemian in on a private conversation?\""
    v "\"Re vera putas Cassium Khemium in privato colloquio adesse permissurum?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:821
translate latin a2s2_340b7a66:

    # "Virginia pauses, eying the jackal, Neferu currently still hunched up despite his attempts to keep straight."
    "Virginia consistit et chacalum aspicit, qui adhuc incurvus est quamquam rectus manere conatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:822
translate latin a2s2_ced15569:

    # v "\"What happened to you?\""
    v "\"Quid tibi accidit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:824
translate latin a2s2_771a0cc2:

    # n "\"Nothing of note.\""
    n "\"Nihil memorabile.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:825
translate latin a2s2_eabfc3a3:

    # "I raise an eyebrow, which Virginia sees."
    "Supercilium tollo, quod Virginia videt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:826
translate latin a2s2_dcbb295e:

    # v "\"[mc], what happened?\""
    v "\"[mc], quid accidit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:827
translate latin a2s2_63033175:

    # m "\"Well...\""
    m "\"Bene...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:828
translate latin a2s2_da968a2a:

    # "I pause, watching as Neferu raises his own eyebrow, but makes no attempt to stop me."
    "Consisto, observans dum Neferu quoque supercilium tollit; tamen me prohibere non conatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:829
translate latin a2s2_1dcb22ae:

    # m "\"Well, Neferu pissed off Cato and Cato...hurt him.\""
    m "\"Sane, Neferu Catonem irritavit et Cato...eum laesit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:831
translate latin a2s2_2d69350f:

    # v "\"What!?\""
    v "\"Quid!?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:833
translate latin a2s2_fe82014e:

    # n "\"I was attempting to pry information from the old man about the staged trial...I was unsuccessful.\""
    n "\"Conabar a sene notitias de certamine composito elicere...frustra conatus sum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:835
translate latin a2s2_99784616:

    # v "\"Why did you even think you {i}could{/i} be successful? Cato knows exactly what we're up to, no doubt. This is so unlike you; it jeopardizes everything, Neferu.\""
    v "\"Cur omnino putavisti rem tibi bene cedere {i}posse{/i}? Cato certe exacte scit quid agamus. Hoc moribus tuis tam alienum est; omnia in periculum adducit, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:836
translate latin a2s2_f605ce70:

    # "Virginia seems completely bewildered, and now that I think about it, I have to agree."
    "Virginia omnino perplexa videtur; iam, cum hoc considero, assentiri debeo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:837
translate latin a2s2_bba8771a:

    # "What {i}was{/i} Neferu thinking?"
    "Quid Neferu {i}cogitabat{/i}?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:841
translate latin a2s2_5f43a80a:

    # "But then Virginia narrows her eyes as she sees the jackal grinning, now openly covering his crotch."
    "Sed tum Virginia oculos contrahit, cum chacalum subridentem et nunc aperte inguen tegentem videt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:842
translate latin a2s2_37fb03a1:

    # v "\"What?\""
    v "\"Quid?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:843
translate latin a2s2_02f55aee:

    # n "\"Well, I may have not achieved {i}exactly{/i} what I wanted, but I attained something just as valuable.\""
    n "\"Sane, fortasse non {i}exacte{/i} id quod volui effeci; sed rem aeque pretiosam adeptus sum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:844
translate latin a2s2_c18ac922:

    # "Neferu glances at the corner of the room, where his drone is."
    "Neferu angulum cubiculi aspicit, ubi automaton eius est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:845
translate latin a2s2_ce2ae05f:

    # m "\"You recorded it all?\""
    m "\"Omnia memoriae mandavisti?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:846
translate latin a2s2_fd9e538d:

    # n "\"Yes, and an attack on the Pharaoh's son will not look very nice on the Khemian news channels, will it?\""
    n "\"Ita; et impetus in filium Pharaonis in transmissionibus nuntiorum Khemiis non admodum bonus videbitur, nonne?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:848
translate latin a2s2_35a71ac6:

    # v "\"Neferu...\""
    v "\"Neferu...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:849
translate latin a2s2_b0ae740c:

    # "A dark tone enters the wolf's voice."
    "Obscurus sonus in vocem lupae intrat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:850
translate latin a2s2_3e74f632:

    # v "\"That risks war.\""
    v "\"Hoc periculum belli facit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:852
translate latin a2s2_845d8d9b:

    # "The jackal rolls his eyes, adjusting himself rather lewdly."
    "Chacalus oculos sursum vertit, se ad inguen satis obscene componens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:853
translate latin a2s2_257c6349:

    # n "\"I would never actually send it, but Cato does not know that. It's simply convenient blackmail material if things don't go as planned.\""
    n "\"Numquam re vera id mitterem; sed Cato hoc nescit. Tantum commoda res est qua eum minando cogamus, si res non ex consilio procedant.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:854
translate latin a2s2_037ff8a3:

    # "Virginia squeezes the bridge of her snout, closing her eyes."
    "Virginia radicem rostri comprimit et oculos claudit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:856
translate latin a2s2_58ed6a40:

    # v "\"You don't know Cato very well, do you...and neither do I. Sometimes I believe he {i}wants{/i} another war. Did he hit you...\""
    v "\"Catonem non bene nosti, nonne...nec ego. Interdum credo eum aliud bellum {i}velle{/i}. Percussitne te...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:857
translate latin a2s2_6cc15208:

    # "Virginia's eyes drift lower."
    "Oculi Virginiae deorsum feruntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:859
translate latin a2s2_28ac0b78:

    # n "\"Yes. Anyway, he's no longer the emperor. It's Cassius I'd use it against.\""
    n "\"Ita. Utut est, ille non iam imperator est. Contra Cassium eo uterer.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:860
translate latin a2s2_28829bec:

    # v "\"You know Cato is his advisor?\""
    v "\"Scis Catonem consiliarium eius esse?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:862
translate latin a2s2_7f9aac5c:

    # n "\"But still not the emperor. I would hope your brother has large enough stones—\""
    n "\"Sed tamen non imperator. Speraverim fratrem tuum testiculos satis magnos habere—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:863
translate latin a2s2_e6acf4b2:

    # "Again, the jackal adjusts himself."
    "Rursus chacalus se componit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:864
translate latin a2s2_7e6eb13f:

    # n "\"—to do his job and not listen to a war-mongering advisor.\""
    n "\"—ut munus suum praestet et consiliario bellum concitanti non pareat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:865
translate latin a2s2_a45d9c8f:

    # v "\"One would hope.\""
    v "\"Ita quis speret.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:866
translate latin a2s2_a1d88f50:

    # "Virginia continues to look unconvinced."
    "Virginia adhuc persuasa non videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:867
translate latin a2s2_8583d362:

    # "I shift around impatiently next to Neferu."
    "Iuxta Neferu impatiens corpus moveo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:868
translate latin a2s2_dc4a188f:

    # m "\"So did he want to see me now?\""
    m "\"Ergo nunc me videre volebat?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:869
translate latin a2s2_1e7982fe:

    # "Virginia turns to me, again looking as if she had forgotten that I was there."
    "Virginia ad me se vertit, rursus quasi me adesse oblita sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:871
translate latin a2s2_8d192b18:

    # v "\"That seemed to be the case.\""
    v "\"Ita videbatur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:872
translate latin a2s2_4f0442af:

    # "Neferu sighs loudly."
    "Neferu clare suspirat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:874
translate latin a2s2_2dbdfdaa:

    # n "\"At least try to convince him to allow you to be present, Virginia. I don't want [mc] to be left alone with him.\""
    n "\"Saltem conare ei persuadere ut te adesse permittat, Virginia. Nolo [mc] cum eo solum relinqui.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:875
translate latin a2s2_d4958b8f:

    # v "\"There is little to worry about. Cass is not Cato...but I can try.\""
    v "\"Parum est quod timeamus. Cass non est Cato...sed conari possum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:876
translate latin a2s2_c8cbd96c:

    # "Virginia looks to me."
    "Virginia me aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:878
translate latin a2s2_87c2ea16:

    # v "\"Ready, [mc]?\""
    v "\"Paratus es, [mc]?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:879
translate latin a2s2_7dcd7627:

    # "I quickly get up, following the wolf to the door."
    "Celeriter surgo, lupam ad ianuam sequens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:880
translate latin a2s2_ea7cbf16:

    # "I look back at Neferu, the jackal looking uncharacteristically disheveled as he's still hunched up around his junk."
    "Neferu respicio; chacalus contra morem inordinatus videtur, adhuc circa genitalia incurvus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:883
translate latin a2s2_720f3525:

    # "He gives me a meaningful look, probably meant to tell me to be careful, so I give him a quick nod before following the wolf out the door."
    "Obtutu significante me aspicit, fortasse ut mihi caveam dicat; itaque celeriter ei annuo et lupam per ianuam sequor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:887
translate latin a2s2_8b88a349:

    # "We walk in silence, the only sound being the birds and the swishing of our robes as we make our way through the halls."
    "Taciti ambulamus; aves tantum et tunicarum nostrarum susurri audiuntur dum per ambulacra pergimus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:888
translate latin a2s2_7a51525a:

    # "I'm not sure exactly where we're going, but after a while, I realize it must be the throne room."
    "Nescio exacte quo eamus; post aliquod tamen tempus intellego ad aulam solii nos ire debere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:889
translate latin a2s2_44a4e915:

    # "I stare at the back of the she-wolf's head, contemplating a few things."
    "Occiput lupae intueor, aliquot res animo volvens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:890
translate latin a2s2_f0a28a0a:

    # "Virginia is the person I know the least about in this palace...which probably means she's doing the best job at playing this little game."
    "De Virginia omnium in hoc palatio minime scio...quod fortasse significat eam optime hoc parvum ludum agere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:891
translate latin a2s2_5c43c9eb:

    # "I want to ask her a lot of things, but I'm worried about over-stepping boundaries, something that seems rather easy to do with her."
    "Multa eam rogare volo; tamen timeo ne limites excedam, quod cum ea satis facile fieri videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:892
translate latin a2s2_b491a252:

    # "As we get closer to that door, I can't help myself from asking at least one question."
    "Cum ad illam ianuam propius accedimus, non possum me retinere quin saltem unam quaestionem faciam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:893
translate latin a2s2_7e4ac271:

    # m "\"So do you...do you care that Amicus is in the dungeons? Like, you want to get him out not just because you want to be his advisor, right?\""
    m "\"Ergo...curasne quod Amicus in carceribus subterraneis est? Dico, eum liberare vis non tantum quia consiliaria eius esse vis, nonne?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:894
translate latin a2s2_fc310d66:

    # "Immediately, I see the wolf's ears flick back in...hopefully mild annoyance and not extreme anger."
    "Statim aures lupae retro moveri video...ut spero, levi molestia, non summa ira."

# game/a2s2.rpy:895
translate latin a2s2_97c7cabc:

    # "Her voice is steady when she answers me, though."
    "Vox tamen eius firma est cum mihi respondet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:897
translate latin a2s2_6cb0e3c4:

    # v "\"First of all, it's not any of your business what my motivations are, [mc].\""
    v "\"Primum, causae meae ad te omnino non pertinent, [mc].\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:898
translate latin a2s2_493400d0:

    # "Virginia doesn't follow that up immediately, so we're left in an awkward silence as we walk the last ten feet to the throne room door."
    "Virginia non statim plura dicit; itaque incommodo silentio ultimos decem pedes ad ianuam aulae solii ambulamus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:899
translate latin a2s2_5121d00d:

    # "She pauses there and finally looks at me, her eyes narrowed."
    "Ibi consistit et tandem me aspicit, oculis contractis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:900
translate latin a2s2_0a2655b2:

    # v "\"But Amicus is my brother, and for that alone, I love him.\""
    v "\"Sed Amicus frater meus est, et vel eo solo eum amo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:902
translate latin a2s2_c3acaaab:

    # v "\"And though he's a complete dullard, he's one of the few to be genuinely kind to me in this palace. He is a good wolf.\""
    v "\"Et quamquam omnino hebes est, unus e paucis est qui in hoc palatio vere benigni mihi sint. Bonus lupus est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:904
translate latin a2s2_de1bc55d:

    # "Virginia turns away, raising a paw to hover over the black panel."
    "Virginia se avertit, manum tollens et super tabellam nigram tenens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:905
translate latin a2s2_675f36cf:

    # v "\"But you would already know that.\""
    v "\"Sed hoc iam scias.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:906
translate latin a2s2_24a29e95:

    # "With that, she presses the panel and the doors slide open."
    "His dictis, tabellam premit et ianuae delapsae aperiuntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:910
translate latin a2s2_82996485:

    # "I immediately spot Cassius at the other end of the cavernous room, looking a bit small and insignificant on the extravagant throne."
    "Statim Cassium in altero immensae aulae fine conspicio; in solio sumptuoso paulo parvus et parvi momenti videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:911
translate latin a2s2_03a502ea:

    # "Probably not the best impression for the emperor of Adastra to make."
    "Fortasse non optima species est quam imperator Adastrae praebeat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:912
translate latin a2s2_b076f0a9:

    # "As I'm thinking this, we begin to make our way toward him."
    "Dum haec cogito, ad eum procedere incipimus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:913
translate latin a2s2_4a6c005e:

    # "A drone hovers in front of the white wolf, holding up a screen under his face."
    "Automaton ante lupum album in aere pendet, tabulam visoriam sub vultu eius tenens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:914
translate latin a2s2_80f5ec8b:

    # "He's not looking at it now though, instead narrowing his eyes at the two of us as Virgina escorts me to the base of the steps."
    "Nunc tamen eam non aspicit; potius oculos in nos ambos contrahit, dum Virginia me ad imos gradus deducit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:917
translate latin a2s2_968c9eb1:

    # v "\"Here he is, brother.\""
    v "\"Ecce, frater.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:918
translate latin a2s2_bc1bf438:

    # "Cassius shifts around in his seat, and for a moment, I think I catch sight of some sort of booster seat under his rear."
    "Cassius in sede se movet; paulisper puto me quandam sedem ad eum altius tollendum sub natibus eius conspicere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:920
translate latin a2s2_0a834553:

    # c "\"Thank you, Virginia. You can leave us be, now.\""
    c "\"Gratias, Virginia. Nunc nos solos relinquere potes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:921
translate latin a2s2_c52303b6:

    # "Virginia hesitates, clasping her paws together in front of herself."
    "Virginia cunctatur, manibus ante se iunctis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:923
translate latin a2s2_656bb656:

    # v "\"...Brother, I would feel more comfortable if I were allowed to stay. I'd rather not leave you alone with an un-profiled alien.\""
    v "\"...Frater, melius me haberem si manere mihi liceret. Malim te solum cum alienigena nondum explorato non relinquere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:924
translate latin a2s2_f69900c3:

    # "Cassius snorts, waving his paw dismissively."
    "Cassius per nasum flat et manum contemptim iactat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:926
translate latin a2s2_6886d4c8:

    # c "\"I've interacted with it many times before. I will be fine. If not, then the drones will take care of him.\""
    c "\"Iam saepius cum illo egi. Bene me habebo. Sin minus, automata eum curabunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:928
translate latin a2s2_93ee6f07:

    # "Cassius makes eye-contact with me as he says that last part, clearly meaning for me to take it as a warning...or a threat."
    "Cassius oculos meos aspicit dum ultimam partem dicit, manifeste volens me id ut admonitionem...vel minas accipere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:929
translate latin a2s2_e93b18a5:

    # "Virginia hesitates again, and Cassius's eyes drift toward her in question."
    "Virginia rursus cunctatur; oculi Cassii interrogantes ad eam feruntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:930
translate latin a2s2_b57e333f:

    # "That's when the she-wolf bows deeply before turning away."
    "Tum lupa se alte inclinat, deinde avertitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:931
translate latin a2s2_94f3be6a:

    # "As she passes me, she gives me her own look, not unlike Neferu's."
    "Dum me praeterit, ipsa quoque me obtutu aspicit Neferu obtutui non dissimili."

# game/a2s2.rpy:932
translate latin a2s2_bd0a3f97:

    # "{i}Be careful.{/i}"
    "{i}Cave.{/i}"

# game/a2s2.rpy:935
translate latin a2s2_27c2f01a:

    # "I continue to face Cassius as I listen to Virginia's soft footsteps recede behind me, then I hear the door open and close."
    "Adhuc Cassium specto dum lenia Virginiae vestigia post me recedere audio; deinde ianuam aperiri et claudi audio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:936
translate latin a2s2_4e679c62:

    # "I keep my eyes low, on Cassius's feet, though I can tell he's looking directly at me."
    "Oculos in pedibus Cassii demissos teneo, quamquam sentio eum recta me aspicere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:937
translate latin a2s2_f38717ce:

    # "The silence drags on."
    "Silentium protrahitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:938
translate latin a2s2_e9d7bc95:

    # "I wonder if the white wolf is using Cato's technique of using silence to intimidate."
    "Mecum quaero an lupus albus Catonis arte utatur, silentium ad terrendum adhibens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:939
translate latin a2s2_56bb44bd:

    # "Finally though, he clears his throat loudly, almost making me jump."
    "Tandem tamen fauces clare purgat et me paene subsilire facit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:942
translate latin a2s2_0c6e0d68:

    # c "\"First, I want to say that you may speak freely here. I only want the truth.\""
    c "\"Primum, dicere volo te libere hic loqui posse. Tantum veritatem volo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:944
translate latin a2s2_b260da1e:

    # "I look up at him then, and see that he's not looking at me anymore."
    "Tum oculos ad eum tollo et video eum me non iam aspicere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:945
translate latin a2s2_484a3096:

    # "Instead it's to the side, as if he's lost in thought."
    "Potius ad latus aspicit, quasi cogitationibus absorptus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:946
translate latin a2s2_c687f3ae:

    # c "\"I'm confused as to how all of this could have happened, so know that if you speak the truth, you will be free from any consequences.\""
    c "\"Perplexus sum quomodo haec omnia accidere potuerint; scito igitur, si vera dicis, nihil mali inde tibi futurum esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:947
translate latin a2s2_93be9e0e:

    # "Consequences?"
    "Quid mali?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:948
translate latin a2s2_6a84473e:

    # "He's making it sound as if I've committed some sort of crime or conspiracy...I mean, maybe I've been a part of some, but it's definitely not my fault."
    "Loquitur quasi aliquod scelus aut coniurationem commiserim...fortasse quidem quibusdam interfui, sed certe culpa mea non est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:949
translate latin a2s2_02f3083d:

    # m "\"What do you want to know?\""
    m "\"Quid scire vis?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:951
translate latin a2s2_bb5a0ea9:

    # "Cassius's eyes flick to mine then, and I see mild surprise there."
    "Tum oculi Cassii ad meos feruntur; levem stuporem ibi video."

# game/a2s2.rpy:952
translate latin a2s2_ed450dd2:

    # "He's still probably not used to an alien like me speaking directly to him in full sentences."
    "Fortasse nondum adsuetus est alienigenam qualis ego sum recta et integris sententiis secum loqui."

# game/a2s2.rpy:953
translate latin a2s2_9ec55a5a:

    # "He pauses again before resting his chin on a paw, clearly trying to look casual."
    "Rursus cunctatur, deinde mentum in manu ponit, manifeste conans securus videri."

# game/a2s2.rpy:955
translate latin a2s2_6fb20c57:

    # c "\"Who exactly are you.\""
    c "\"Quis exacte es.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:956
translate latin a2s2_09722dcb:

    # "I raise an eyebrow."
    "Supercilium tollo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:957
translate latin a2s2_93364a0b:

    # m "\"[mc], you already know this.\""
    m "\"[mc], hoc iam scis.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:959
translate latin a2s2_22b1f27e:

    # c "\"I know your name, but I want to know more beyond that. What is it that you're doing here? How did my brother find you?\""
    c "\"Nomen tuum scio; sed ultra id plura scire volo. Quid hic facis? Quomodo frater meus te invenit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:960
translate latin a2s2_91cdd30a:

    # "Immediately, our conversation reaches a point where I find myself unsure of what to say."
    "Statim colloquium nostrum ad eum locum pervenit quo nescio quid dicam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:961
translate latin a2s2_67c07bd6:

    # "How much {i}can{/i} I say to him?"
    "Quantum ei dicere {i}possum{/i}?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:962
translate latin a2s2_45fa0e08:

    # "Obviously I can't trust him at all."
    "Plane ei omnino confidere non possum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:963
translate latin a2s2_5c1f227f:

    # "I know that."
    "Hoc scio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:964
translate latin a2s2_4103832d:

    # "But I also know that he's in complete control over what happens to Amicus, and there may be a few things I have to give up to keep my wolf safe."
    "Sed etiam scio eum omnino regere quid Amico accidat; fortasse mihi quaedam concedenda erunt ut lupum meum salvum servem."

# game/a2s2.rpy:965
translate latin a2s2_ed29841e:

    # "So, I square my shoulders and look Cassius in the eye."
    "Itaque umeros firmo et oculos Cassii aspicio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:966
translate latin a2s2_043dbd6a:

    # m "\"I want to know that Amicus is okay first...and I want to see him.\""
    m "\"Primum scire volo Amicum bene valere...et eum videre volo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:967
translate latin a2s2_3811efc5:

    # "Immediately Cassius's demeanor changes from sour suspicion to sour fury."
    "Statim Cassius ab acerba suspicione ad acerbam iram transit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:969
translate latin a2s2_d4c8247b:

    # c "\"Excuse me!? You aren't the one to make demands here! I am the emperor, and you will answer my questions!\""
    c "\"Quid dixisti!? Tu hic postulare non potes! Ego imperator sum, et quaestionibus meis respondebis!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:970
translate latin a2s2_31345f49:

    # "I get the vague sensation of my balls drawing up into my stomach as I realize how dangerous all of this is."
    "Leviter sentio quasi testiculi mei in ventrem retrahantur, cum intellego quam periculosa haec omnia sint."

# game/a2s2.rpy:971
translate latin a2s2_9693519b:

    # "My thoughts go to that physician...Felix, being sent to the dungeons without a second thought."
    "Cogito illum medicum...Felicem, sine ulla cunctatione in carceres missum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:972
translate latin a2s2_4a4e9e11:

    # "But I know I have protections, and I have to trust them now if I'm going to make any sort of deal with Cassius."
    "Sed scio me tutela munitum esse; nunc ei confidere debeo si quodcumque pactum cum Cassio facere volo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:973
translate latin a2s2_1a36bdb3:

    # m "\"Yeah, but you're not {i}my{/i} emperor. I answer to the Pharaoh.\""
    m "\"Ita, sed non imperator {i}meus{/i} es. Pharaoni pareo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:974
translate latin a2s2_a6550882:

    # "I'm spitballing, but it seems to be working as it gives Cassius pause."
    "Temere coniecto; tamen proficere videtur, cum Cassium cunctari faciat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:976
translate latin a2s2_1e5a0a6c:

    # "After a moment, it seems like he's able to collect himself."
    "Post momentum se colligere posse videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:978
translate latin a2s2_1c7e553a:

    # c "\"So I've heard. But remind yourself that you are on Adastra, therefore you are to abide by our laws and customs, and lying to the emperor is punishable by death.\""
    c "\"Ita audivi. Sed memento te in Adastra esse, itaque legibus et moribus nostris parere debere; imperatori mentiri morte punitur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:979
translate latin a2s2_6b0fdf8a:

    # "And again that feeling in my stomach."
    "Et rursus ille sensus in ventre meo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:980
translate latin a2s2_fdf1b1cc:

    # "But I have to remind myself; rules don't matter here, it's all about playing their game."
    "Sed mihi commemorare debeo: regulae hic nihil valent; omnia in ludo eorum agendo posita sunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:981
translate latin a2s2_eadc2301:

    # "I know that Cassius would never have me executed or imprisoned while Neferu is here."
    "Scio Cassium numquam me necari aut in carcerem mitti iussurum dum Neferu hic est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:982
translate latin a2s2_f34e3227:

    # "That would be far too risky for the empire as a whole."
    "Hoc toti imperio nimis periculosum esset."

# game/a2s2.rpy:983
translate latin a2s2_d2bb9dfb:

    # "I can't be intimidated by empty threats...even if they threaten my life."
    "Inanibus minis terreri non possum...etiamsi vitam meam minantur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:984
translate latin a2s2_c73dc725:

    # "If I want to help Amicus, I have to push the limits."
    "Si Amicum adiuvare volo, limites urgere debeo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:985
translate latin a2s2_971f9c5b:

    # "At least within reason."
    "Saltem rationis intra terminos."

# game/a2s2.rpy:986
translate latin a2s2_bf7c7bda:

    # "I also remind myself that I'm not completely untouchable, as Neferu's balls can attest to."
    "Mihi quoque commemoro me non omnino inviolabilem esse, sicut testiculi Neferu testari possunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:987
translate latin a2s2_5a3a7f9c:

    # m "\"I just want to see my former master. If you can guarantee me that, then I'll tell you what happened.\""
    m "\"Tantum dominum meum pristinum videre volo. Si hoc mihi praestare potes, tibi narrabo quid acciderit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:989
translate latin a2s2_6ae75210:

    # "Another long pause as Cassius just glares at me, then he lets out a little huff."
    "Altera longa mora fit dum Cassius tantum me torve aspicit; deinde leniter flat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:991
translate latin a2s2_a4d5ba04:

    # c "\"Fine.\""
    c "\"Bene.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:992
translate latin a2s2_b2ea9f0f:

    # "It's almost funny how he's still acting like a child despite now being the emperor of Adastra."
    "Paene ridiculum est eum adhuc quasi puerum se gerere, quamquam nunc imperator Adastrae est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:993
translate latin a2s2_d3d64bc9:

    # "So, I take a deep breath."
    "Itaque alte spiritum duco."

# game/a2s2.rpy:994
translate latin a2s2_6c47567f:

    # "I consider lying, of course, but what Amicus did was an honest mistake...at least in my opinion."
    "Sane cogito mentiri; sed quod Amicus fecit error sine dolo erat...saltem mea sententia."

# game/a2s2.rpy:995
translate latin a2s2_b28a80d4:

    # "Lying will probably only make things worse when the truth should be so understandable."
    "Mendacia fortasse tantum res peiores facient, cum veritatem tam facile intellegi oporteat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:996
translate latin a2s2_4a68462a:

    # "So I start at the beginning, how Amicus came upon the records of my people in the archives, how he rushed to my planet to find a willing pet."
    "Itaque ab initio narro: quomodo Amicus in tabulariis monumenta populi mei invenerit et ad planetam meum festinaverit ut animal domesticum volens inveniret."

# game/a2s2.rpy:997
translate latin a2s2_c6179b35:

    # "How everything suddenly went south when he found out far too late that we were not part of the {i}Galaxias{/i}, and finally how we tried to keep it all a secret to keep the empire safe."
    "Quomodo omnia subito male cesserint cum nimis sero cognoverit nos ad {i}Galaxias{/i} non pertinere; denique quomodo omnia celare conati simus ut imperium salvum servaremus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:998
translate latin a2s2_12eba6fe:

    # "I emphasize the \"keeping the empire safe\" part, even if it wasn't originally at the top my priorities."
    "Partem \"imperii salvi servandi\" urgeo, etiamsi initio non inter praecipua proposita mea erat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:999
translate latin a2s2_cfa4331a:

    # "I'm telling the truth, even if I'm stretching it a bit."
    "Verum dico, etiamsi paulo extendo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1001
translate latin a2s2_1fdf223b:

    # "Cassius listens to all of this with various reactions; contempt, surprise, anger, then contemplation."
    "Cassius haec omnia variis animi motibus audit: contemptu, stupore, ira, deinde consideratione."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1003
translate latin a2s2_27d86b2c:

    # "I'm struck by the contrast between him and Cato."
    "Discrimen inter eum et Catonem me percellit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1004
translate latin a2s2_a3fee1b8:

    # "While Cato keeps his emotions in check (aside from the occasional explosions of rage), Cassius wears it all on his sleeve."
    "Cato affectus suos cohibet, praeter subitas irarum eruptiones; Cassius autem omnia aperte ostendit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1005
translate latin a2s2_90d1b92b:

    # "Not that different from Amicus in that way, even if his personality is."
    "Ea re non tam dissimilis Amico est, quamquam ingenium eius diversum est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1006
translate latin a2s2_0506e540:

    # "When Cassius still doesn't say anything, I sigh."
    "Cum Cassius adhuc nihil dicit, suspiro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1007
translate latin a2s2_68509d13:

    # m "\"It was an honest mistake. You've got to understand that.\""
    m "\"Error sine dolo erat. Hoc intellegere debes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1008
translate latin a2s2_94a95ede:

    # c "\"I already know that it was a mistake; even Amicus would not make First Contact on purpose. I had just wondered what sort of stupidity caused it.\""
    c "\"Iam scio errorem fuisse; ne Amicus quidem consulto Primum Congressum faceret. Tantum quaesiveram qualis stultitia eum effecerit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1009
translate latin a2s2_252c7360:

    # m "\"He had no reason to think we were un-contacted; we were recorded in the library, or whatever...\""
    m "\"Nullam habuit causam cur putaret nos nondum conventos esse; in bibliotheca, vel quidquid erat, descripti eramus...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1010
translate latin a2s2_75cd1c27:

    # "Cassius suddenly shifts on his throne."
    "Cassius subito in solio se movet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1012
translate latin a2s2_ea697611:

    # c "\"What are you? Species and planet name.\""
    c "\"Quid es? Speciei et planetae nomen.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1013
translate latin a2s2_84f15627:

    # "His last sentence has the inflection of an expectant demand."
    "Ultima sententia eius sonum postulationis responsum exspectantis habet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1014
translate latin a2s2_01485bef:

    # "Now I'm left to stand in silence."
    "Nunc ego tacitus stare cogor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1015
translate latin a2s2_48c2eb31:

    # "No fucking way am I telling this wolf brat where I'm from."
    "Nullo prorsus modo huic lupo insolenti dicam unde sim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1016
translate latin a2s2_bfa9af29:

    # "Cassius must see this on my face immediately, because his fur once again puffs out in anger."
    "Cassius hoc statim in vultu meo videre debet; pili enim eius rursus ira eriguntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1018
translate latin a2s2_543637c3:

    # c "\"Do you want to see Amicus, or not? I need to know this to verify that what you are saying is truthful.\""
    c "\"Visne Amicum videre, an non? Hoc scire debeo ut comprobem quae dicis vera esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1019
translate latin a2s2_d3007c40:

    # m "\"Is that really why? I know what you wolves do to other aliens. Why would I give away my people like that?\""
    m "\"Estne haec vera causa? Scio quid vos lupi aliis alienigenis faciatis. Cur ita populum meum prodam?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1021
translate latin a2s2_79c643ae:

    # "Cassius puffs himself up even bigger, and I wonder if he's going to start screaming at me, then he suddenly just deflates."
    "Cassius pilos etiam magis erigit; mecum quaero an mihi clamare incipiat, deinde subito se relaxat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1023
translate latin a2s2_46d56006:

    # c "\"The problem here is First Contact, yes? So why would I go out to find and...do whatever you think it is I'd do to your people? I have no interest in furthering the problem. I simply want to know.\""
    c "\"Quaestio hic est Primus Congressus, nonne? Cur igitur exeam ut inveniam et...quidquid putas me populo tuo facturum esse faciam? Non mihi propositum est malum augere. Tantum scire volo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1024
translate latin a2s2_be8537ff:

    # m "\"But why do you care?\""
    m "\"Sed cur rem curas?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1026
translate latin a2s2_ed9b9763:

    # "Cassius snaps his eyes back up to mine."
    "Cassius oculos subito rursus ad meos tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1027
translate latin a2s2_8a00cbc0:

    # c "\"Believe it or not, [mc], I am trying to help Amicus. Do you not know the consequence of such a crime? He could be executed for this!\""
    c "\"Crede sive noli, [mc], Amicum adiuvare conor. Nescisne quae huius sceleris poena sit? Ob hoc necari potest!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1028
translate latin a2s2_69613b65:

    # "Now my heart does a backflip."
    "Nunc cor meum quasi retro subsilit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1029
translate latin a2s2_d58e4bda:

    # m "\"What!? Why?\""
    m "\"Quid!? Cur?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1030
translate latin a2s2_67fda588:

    # c "\"Because it is a sacred rule created by the parents! Disobeying them risks our entire empire to abandonment!\""
    c "\"Quia sacra regula a Parentibus facta est! Iis non parere periculum facit ne totum imperium nostrum deseratur!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1031
translate latin a2s2_acf9009e:

    # m "\"But...you're the emperor. If you want him kept alive, can't you just do that?\""
    m "\"Sed...tu imperator es. Si eum vivum servari vis, nonne tantum hoc facere potes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1032
translate latin a2s2_c7b9b83f:

    # "I feel myself starting to panic a little."
    "Me paulum pavere incipere sentio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1033
translate latin a2s2_a6d0c424:

    # "I'd thought that maybe Amicus would be kept in the dungeons for a while, but never that he could be at risk of being executed."
    "Putaveram fortasse Amicum aliquamdiu in carceribus servatum iri; numquam autem eum periculo necis obiectum esse posse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1035
translate latin a2s2_ec470e98:

    # c "\"...If it were only I that knew of this...maybe. But there are others that know of his crime, and they expect me to terminate all evidence of the First Contact.\""
    c "\"...Si solus ego hoc scirem...fortasse. Sed alii sunt qui scelus eius sciunt, et exspectant me omnia Primi Congressus indicia delere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1036
translate latin a2s2_2ea734e9:

    # "Cassius stares at me, and I realize part of that evidence is of course...me."
    "Cassius me intuetur; intellego partem illorum indiciorum sane esse...me."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1037
translate latin a2s2_9bb3c809:

    # m "\"Are you talking about Cato? He's just your advisor, right? You can ignore him.\""
    m "\"Catonem dicis? Tantum consiliarius tuus est, nonne? Eum neglegere potes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1038
translate latin a2s2_5c502bb7:

    # "This time Cassius doesn't respond, looking away again."
    "Hac vice Cassius non respondet et oculos rursus avertit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1039
translate latin a2s2_cdeb6d62:

    # c "\"If I can make the case that this was a truly honest mistake, then maybe I have a chance of convincing these...others.\""
    c "\"Si causam proponere possum ut hic vere error sine dolo fuerit, fortasse occasionem habeo his...aliis persuadendi.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1041
translate latin a2s2_48e7f22a:

    # c "\"Better yet, convince them that this wasn't First Contact at all. Are you even sure your people are completely unaware of the {i}Galaxias{/i}?\""
    c "\"Melius etiam, eis persuadere hunc omnino non Primum Congressum fuisse. Certusne omnino es populum tuum de {i}Galaxias{/i} nihil scire?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1042
translate latin a2s2_adc432f8:

    # "I start to say that I am pretty sure, but he's looking at me in a strange way."
    "Dicere incipio me satis certum esse; sed ille miro modo me aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1043
translate latin a2s2_ed2e0458:

    # m "\"Um...our governments are pretty secretive. They might know something.\""
    m "\"Em...rectores nostri satis arcani sunt. Fortasse aliquid sciunt.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1044
translate latin a2s2_b51e9cab:

    # c "\"So it's possible that a crime wasn't committed at all, simply a misunderstanding, and knowing where you came from can help us determine that.\""
    c "\"Ergo fieri potest ut nullum omnino scelus commissum sit, sed tantum error; et scire unde veneris nos hoc discernere adiuvare potest.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1045
translate latin a2s2_2a2e949f:

    # "I'm a bit caught off-guard by all of this."
    "Haec omnia me paulo improviso opprimunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1046
translate latin a2s2_73864744:

    # "I guess I'd just expected Cassius to let Amicus rot in the dungeons while he enjoyed his emperorship."
    "Puto me tantum exspectavisse Cassium passurum ut Amicus in carceribus putresceret, dum ipse imperio suo frueretur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1047
translate latin a2s2_9dd3c25c:

    # "But I'm reminded of what Virginia had said earlier, that although they might stab each other in the back, they're still siblings."
    "Sed recordor quid Virginia antea dixerit: quamquam alter alterum insidiis prodat, adhuc fratres sunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1048
translate latin a2s2_5901ea27:

    # m "\"Didn't you once say that you don't care about the parents? Wouldn't it be part of your plan for them to abandon the empire?\""
    m "\"Nonne aliquando dixisti te Parentes non curare? Nonne imperium ab eis deseri pars consilii tui esset?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1049
translate latin a2s2_a335bca4:

    # "Cassius sighs deeply."
    "Cassius alte suspirat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1051
translate latin a2s2_42122e84:

    # c "\"I've said many things, but I've found that once you become emperor, your perspective on things change.\""
    c "\"Multa dixi; sed inveni, simul atque imperator fis, modum quo res aspicias mutari.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1052
translate latin a2s2_67014ef2:

    # m "\"Like...how much you need the parents?\""
    m "\"Velut...quantum Parentibus egeas?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1054
translate latin a2s2_e7aa8f87:

    # "Cassius glares at me, so I just go on."
    "Cassius me torve aspicit; itaque tantum pergo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1055
translate latin a2s2_2b2ef116:

    # m "\"How would they find out anyway? Amicus said something about monitors? Obviously we can just talk about it out in the open without anything happening.\""
    m "\"Quomodo omnino id resciant? Amicus aliquid de monitoribus dixit? Plane de hoc palam loqui possumus et nihil accidit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1056
translate latin a2s2_990e5d4d:

    # "I look around, as if expecting a monitor to poke its head out from behind one of the pillars."
    "Circumspicio, quasi monitorem exspectem caput post unam e columnis proferre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1057
translate latin a2s2_f188e909:

    # c "\"I don't know, but what I do know is that the fewer who know, the better.\""
    c "\"Nescio; sed hoc scio: quo pauciores sciunt, eo melius.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1058
translate latin a2s2_5c64b0f5:

    # m "\"What even is a monitor?\""
    m "\"Quid omnino est monitor?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1059
translate latin a2s2_8864afe9:

    # "Cassius shrugs."
    "Cassius umeros tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1061
translate latin a2s2_ebb270ca:

    # c "\"Again, I don't know. None have appeared in living memory...but that does not mean we should not be cautious. The risk is far too great.\""
    c "\"Rursus dico: nescio. Quoad viventium memoria patet, nulli apparuerunt...sed hoc non significat nobis non cavendum esse. Periculum nimis magnum est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1062
translate latin a2s2_7ba5465f:

    # "I don't really understand this."
    "Hoc non re vera intellego."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1063
translate latin a2s2_2fe9441f:

    # "I feel like if the parents are as powerful and all-knowing as these aliens make them out to be, then they probably already know I'm here."
    "Mihi videtur, si Parentes tam potentes et omnia scientes sunt quam hi alienigenae eos esse dicant, eos fortasse iam scire me hic esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1064
translate latin a2s2_0275651a:

    # "Before I can bring this up to Cassius, though—"
    "Antequam tamen hoc Cassio proponere possum—"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1065
translate latin a2s2_8e3156f7:

    # c "\"So what are you, and where are you from?\""
    c "\"Quid igitur es, et unde es?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1066
translate latin a2s2_a5ed7e8b:

    # "I think."
    "Cogito."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1067
translate latin a2s2_c8e659bb:

    # "He's right that it wouldn't make sense for the wolves to go after Earth."
    "Recte dicit lupis rationi non convenire Terram persequi."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1068
translate latin a2s2_17a12f5f:

    # "It is technically the last thing that the empire would want, especially with Cassius as emperor considering his isolationist views."
    "Re vera ultimum est quod imperium vellet, praesertim Cassio imperatore, secludendi proposito eius considerato."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1069
translate latin a2s2_4aa458e7:

    # "But most importantly, it could help Amicus."
    "Sed praecipue Amicum adiuvare potest."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1070
translate latin a2s2_a5e8d1c4:

    # "I take a deep breath."
    "Alte spiro."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1071
translate latin a2s2_58fd0999:

    # m "\"And if I tell you, you'll let me see Amicus?\""
    m "\"Et si tibi dico, me Amicum videre permittes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1073
translate latin a2s2_bebecefa:

    # c "\"...Yes.\""
    c "\"...Ita.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1074
translate latin a2s2_4a788f43:

    # "I don't like only being able to go on his word, but for some reason, I feel like he's being sincere."
    "Non mihi placet tantum verbo eius niti posse; tamen aliqua de causa sentio eum sincere loqui."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1075
translate latin a2s2_1bb5226a:

    # m "\"I'm a human, from the planet Earth.\""
    m "\"Homo sum, e planeta Terra.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1077
translate latin a2s2_fe647475:

    # c "\"Human...Earth...\""
    c "\"Homo...Terra...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1078
translate latin a2s2_134c430f:

    # "Cassius mumbles the words, the Lingua cutting off and allowing me to hear the wolf's accented voice un-filtered."
    "Cassius verba murmurat; Lingua cessat et mihi vocem lupi proprio sono distinctam sine interpositione audire permittit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1079
translate latin a2s2_168b3f7c:

    # "He pulls the floating drone at his side toward himself, tapping at the screen a few times, probably making notes."
    "Automaton ad latus suum volitans ad se trahit, tabulam aliquoties pulsans, fortasse notas faciens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1080
translate latin a2s2_a3ec275c:

    # "It feels incredibly wrong at that moment, like I've betrayed all humans somehow...but again, I can't see why it would put Earth in danger."
    "Illo momento res incredibiliter mala videtur, quasi omnes homines quodammodo prodiderim...sed rursus non video cur hoc Terram in periculum adducat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1081
translate latin a2s2_b11219c7:

    # "On top of that, I'm also counting on Amicus becoming emperor eventually, and I know he'd never do anything to my planet."
    "Praeterea confido Amicum tandem imperatorem futurum esse; scio eum numquam planetae meo quidquam facturum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1082
translate latin a2s2_0b0e8109:

    # "I'm playing the game."
    "Ludum ago."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1083
translate latin a2s2_a3e1504d:

    # "Cassius stares at the screen a while, and I shift around on my feet."
    "Cassius tabulam aliquamdiu intuetur; ego in pedibus corpus moveo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1084
translate latin a2s2_80513949:

    # m "\"So...I can go see him now?\""
    m "\"Ergo...nunc eum videre possum?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1085
translate latin a2s2_0e4620fa:

    # "He snaps his gaze up to mine."
    "Subito oculos ad meos tollit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1087
translate latin a2s2_6be067b0:

    # c "\"Yes, now is best. Cato should not be back for a few more hours, but I can only give you twenty minutes, just to be safe.\""
    c "\"Ita, nunc optimum est. Cato aliquot horas nondum redire debet; sed tantum viginti minuta tibi dare possum, ut caveamus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1088
translate latin a2s2_845eef23:

    # m "\"Cato? What about him?\""
    m "\"Cato? Quid de eo?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1090
translate latin a2s2_c09b8999:

    # c "\"What do you mean, 'what about him'?\""
    c "\"Quid vis dicere, 'quid de eo'?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1091
translate latin a2s2_5581ec29:

    # "I want to ask Cassius why it sounds like Cato is in charge and not he himself, but I know not to press those buttons right now."
    "Cassium rogare volo cur sonet quasi Cato praesit, non ipse; tamen scio eum nunc non esse irritandum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1092
translate latin a2s2_ff1cbaea:

    # m "\"Never mind. So, can I see him regularly?\""
    m "\"Nihil refert. Ergo, eum regulariter videre possum?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1094
translate latin a2s2_8b9b3738:

    # "Cassius sighs loudly again, standing up."
    "Cassius rursus clare suspirat et surgit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1095
translate latin a2s2_b74fa0aa:

    # c "\"If it's not often and you come to me first...and if Cato's away.\""
    c "\"Si non saepe, et prius ad me venis...et si Cato abest.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1096
translate latin a2s2_aece2856:

    # "Yep, definitely not fully in charge."
    "Ita, certe non omnino praeest."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1097
translate latin a2s2_bccddb95:

    # "Cato's clearly got some control over Cassius."
    "Cato manifeste aliquam potestatem in Cassium habet."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1098
translate latin a2s2_be62fcc1:

    # "Either way, I'm too happy at the thought of being able to see Amicus semi-regularly to care at the moment."
    "Quoquo modo, nunc nimis laetus sum cogitans me Amicum aliqua assiduitate videre posse ut hoc curem."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1100
translate latin a2s2_f27f026b:

    # c "\"Anyway, Com, escort [mc] to the dungeons to visit Amicus for twenty minutes.\""
    c "\"Utut est, Com, [mc] ad carceres subterraneos deduc ut Amicum viginti minuta visat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1101
translate latin a2s2_f6cc0fac:

    # "That's when I remember I have other questions."
    "Tum memini me alias quaestiones habere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1102
translate latin a2s2_fa6aacee:

    # m "\"Wait, uh...do you have contact with the parents now?\""
    m "\"Exspecta, em...iamne cum Parentibus colloqueris?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1104
translate latin a2s2_5e2484b2:

    # "Cassius looks at me strangely."
    "Cassius miro modo me aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1105
translate latin a2s2_f227dffe:

    # c "\"Yes, we made contact after I became emperor. It was expected.\""
    c "\"Ita, convenimus postquam imperator factus sum. Hoc exspectabatur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1106
translate latin a2s2_127c2f3b:

    # m "\"Oh! That's...good.\""
    m "\"Oh! Hoc...bonum est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1107
translate latin a2s2_007d1314:

    # c "\"Indeed. Though we had to implement the traditional technique. It's a bit archaic, but highly effective.\""
    c "\"Certe. Morem tamen traditum adhibere debuimus. Paulo antiquus est, sed valde efficax.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1108
translate latin a2s2_4c3ca240:

    # m "\"Oh. So, do you have the stretch drive again?\""
    m "\"Oh. Ergo, Propulsionem Dilatatoriam rursus habetis?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1109
translate latin a2s2_94556ad1:

    # "Cassius looks at me suspiciously."
    "Cassius suspiciosus me aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1110
translate latin a2s2_ac0ed160:

    # m "\"Hey, I need to get home eventually, and you'd be getting rid of the problem if you got me there.\""
    m "\"Heus, tandem domum mihi redeundum est; te malo liberaveris si me eo perduxeris.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1111
translate latin a2s2_7fde3883:

    # c "\"Well, no not yet, but I've only spoken with them a few times. I'll be meditating on that today. I'll keep you updated when we discuss things in the future.\""
    c "\"Sane, nondum; sed tantum pauca cum eis colloquia habui. Hodie de eo meditabor. Te certiorem faciam cum posthac res tractabimus.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1112
translate latin a2s2_cfa91801:

    # m "\"You want to talk to me again?\""
    m "\"Rursus mecum loqui vis?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1114
translate latin a2s2_1fb96901:

    # c "\"Yes.\""
    c "\"Ita.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1115
translate latin a2s2_c4852865:

    # "Cassius then stalks off while a drone circles around me, telling me to follow it."
    "Cassius tum magnis passibus abit, dum automaton circa me circuit et iubet ut id sequar."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1117
translate latin a2s2_c3e30c9c:

    # "I think about apologizing then for the whole nervo incident, but then I realize if he's not going to mention it, then maybe I shouldn't either."
    "Tum cogito veniam petere propter totam rem instrumento nervo factam; deinde intellego, si ipse eam non memorabit, fortasse neque me debere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1118
translate latin a2s2_b903b68a:

    # "I realize then how strange the whole exchange has been."
    "Tum intellego quam mirum totum colloquium fuerit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1120
translate latin a2s2_284b6a36:

    # "Cassius had seemed like a whole different person...but I guess now he thinks of me more as an equal...at least in terms of intelligence."
    "Cassius quasi omnino alius visus erat...sed puto eum iam me magis aequalem habere...saltem ingenio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1121
translate latin a2s2_660685f0:

    # "It makes him almost tolerable."
    "Hoc eum paene tolerabilem facit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1124
translate latin a2s2_b4d00ffb:

    # "I'm lead to a part of the palace that I've never been to before."
    "Ad partem palatii ducor ubi numquam antea fui."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1125
translate latin a2s2_e8ac0645:

    # "We go through a small door, into a small room that has a small pit in it."
    "Per parvam ianuam in parvum cubiculum ingredimur, in quo parva fovea est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1128
translate latin a2s2_3f027a7a:

    # "A ladder leads down into this pit, a pit that I can only imagine leads to the dungeons."
    "Scala in hanc foveam descendit; puto foveam ad carceres ducere debere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1129
translate latin a2s2_031ba2df:

    # "The hole is dark, and as I pause, I can feel the drone hovering behind me."
    "Foramen obscurum est; dum consisto, automaton post me in aere pendens sentio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1130
translate latin a2s2_787ecfe3:

    # com "\"Please proceed down the ladder, [mc].\""
    com "\"Per scalam descende, quaeso, [mc].\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1131
translate latin a2s2_2df05ce3:

    # "I get a prickling sensation on the back of my neck, and I wonder for a moment if this is some sort of trap."
    "Pruritum in cervice sentio; momentum mecum quaero an hoc aliquis dolus sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1132
translate latin a2s2_05efc97f:

    # "I mean, of course it feels like a trap; I have a creepy AI nudging me toward a pit of darkness, all set up by Cassius."
    "Sane, quasi dolus videtur: mens artificiosa horrenda me versus foveam obscuram impellit, omnibus a Cassio paratis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1133
translate latin a2s2_3ae3dffa:

    # "Despite the feeling, I force myself downward, shakily lowering myself to the ladder, several times feeling as if I'm going to slip and fall."
    "Quamquam ita sentio, me deorsum ire cogo, trepidus me ad scalam demittens et aliquoties sentiens me lapsurum et casurum esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1134
translate latin a2s2_196286d8:

    # "I have no idea how deep this thing goes, but as I start to think it might be a significant drop, my foot hits solid ground."
    "Nullam ideam habeo quam alte descendat; cum tamen cogitare incipio fortasse magnum intervallum esse, pes meus terram solidam tangit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1137
translate latin a2s2_eba71bf7:

    # "To my surprise, I get exactly what I had been expecting."
    "Miror cum exacte id invenio quod exspectaveram."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1138
translate latin a2s2_9dfbe634:

    # "It's what looks like, well...a straight-up dungeon."
    "Videtur, sane...verus omnino carcer subterraneus esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1139
translate latin a2s2_7d8acb71:

    # "Dim, yellow lighting is cast across the stone walls and floor, the air musty and stale, the halls quiet."
    "Obscura lux flava per parietes et pavimentum lapideum spargitur; aer situ et vetustate gravis est, ambulacra quieta."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1140
translate latin a2s2_b24f0d1a:

    # "The air is cold and, fleetingly, I'm glad that Amicus has at least that."
    "Aer frigidus est; breviter gaudeo Amicum saltem hoc habere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1141
translate latin a2s2_b7123140:

    # "And as I'm thinking this, I hear movement up ahead."
    "Dum haec cogito, motum ante me audio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1142
translate latin a2s2_6e4e2e71:

    # "Shuffling footsteps and shadows being cast on the walls of the hallway in front of me."
    "Vestigia trahuntur et umbrae in parietes ambulacri ante me iaciuntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1143
translate latin a2s2_7ea8c454:

    # "I take a few steps forward, but Com buzzes behind me."
    "Paucos passus procedo; Com autem post me bombum edit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1144
translate latin a2s2_73d04d17:

    # com "\"Remain close to the ladder, please.\""
    com "\"Prope scalam mane, quaeso.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1145
translate latin a2s2_68fd5c8f:

    # "I stop and wait impatiently, wondering if what's up ahead is indeed Amicus."
    "Consisto et impatiens exspecto, mecum quaerens an qui ante me sit vere Amicus sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1146
translate latin a2s2_e2b736a2:

    # "Again, I get that creeping feeling that I've been betrayed somehow, that what's up ahead is some sort of monster Cassius decided to feed me to."
    "Rursus ille sensus subrepit me quodammodo proditum esse, quod ante me sit monstrum aliquod cui Cassius me devorandum dare decreverit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1147
translate latin a2s2_0e71ea10:

    # "Instead though, what turns the corner is...Amicus."
    "Sed qui circa angulum apparet est...Amicus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1149
translate latin a2s2_a03423ed:

    # "For a moment, my wolf stands there at the other end of the hall, staring at me."
    "Paulisper lupus meus in altero ambulacri fine stat et me intuetur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1150
translate latin a2s2_cd3e60d8:

    # "Then, before I know it, he's running at me."
    "Deinde, antequam intellego, ad me currit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1153
translate latin a2s2_0d4fbcf5:

    # "I start to move forward, but Com tells me to stay put once again, more firmly this time."
    "Procedere incipio; Com autem rursus iubet ut loco maneam, hac vice firmius."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1154
translate latin a2s2_8aac8bd8:

    # "So I force myself to wait, watching as my wolf sprints at me."
    "Itaque me exspectare cogo, lupum meum ad me rapidissime currentem observans."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1155
translate latin a2s2_0e73a76d:

    # "As he gets closer, I open my arms and the next next thing I know, I'm caught up in a mass of fur, warmth, and tears."
    "Cum propius venit, brachia aperio; statim in mole pilorum, caloris et lacrimarum comprehensus sum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1157
translate latin a2s2_27b7f10b:

    # a "\"[mc]!\""
    a "\"[mc]!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1158
translate latin a2s2_b6285003:

    # "I'm spun around in a circle, my face pressed hard against the wolf's neck before I'm set down again."
    "In orbem circumagor, vultu meo firmiter ad collum lupi presso, antequam rursus deponor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1159
translate latin a2s2_f56f8bd4:

    # "Amicus doesn't let me go though, clutching me tightly to his body."
    "Amicus tamen me non dimittit, ad corpus suum firmiter stringens."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1160
translate latin a2s2_cf097460:

    # "He'd sounded happy at first, but now I feel him gasp and shake."
    "Primo laetus sonuerat; nunc autem eum anhelare et tremere sentio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1161
translate latin a2s2_2e87079d:

    # m "\"Amicus?\""
    m "\"Amice?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1162
translate latin a2s2_8aa2d28e:

    # "I pull back as much as he'll let me so I can see his face."
    "Quantum ille sinit me retraho ut vultum eius videre possim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1164
translate latin a2s2_7546acef:

    # "I see then that he's crying, not even trying to hide it as he looks down at me with reddened eyes."
    "Tum eum flere video; ne celare quidem conatur dum oculis rubentibus me desuper aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1165
translate latin a2s2_bbf83b9d:

    # "He looks...okay for the most part."
    "Videtur...fere bene valere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1166
translate latin a2s2_aaf62d89:

    # "His fur is a bit disheveled, and maybe he's a little thinner, but otherwise he looks healthy."
    "Pili eius paulo inordinati sunt et fortasse paulo gracilior est; ceterum sanus videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1167
translate latin a2s2_756123c4:

    # "The most noticeable change is actually his smell; a hint of musk without any scent of lavender."
    "Mutatio maxime manifesta re vera odor eius est: levis odor corporis, sine ullo lavendulae odore."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1168
translate latin a2s2_0d4a74bb:

    # "Amicus is looking at me just as closely, and one of his paws comes up to brush a thumb pad across my cheek."
    "Amicus aeque diligenter me aspicit; una e manibus eius tollitur ut pollicis pulpam per genam meam ducat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1169
translate latin a2s2_df47693d:

    # "It's then that I realize that I'm crying too."
    "Tum intellego me quoque flere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1170
translate latin a2s2_7c7401dd:

    # "So I press my face against his chest again and we stay like that for a while."
    "Itaque vultum rursus pectori eius premo et ita aliquamdiu manemus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1171
translate latin a2s2_05d3000d:

    # "After about ten minutes, our breathing is under control and the wolf's grip on me loosens, though he doesn't let go."
    "Post decem fere minuta respirationes nostras regimus et lupus me minus firmiter tenet, quamquam non dimittit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1172
translate latin a2s2_e65ff725:

    # "Finally, Amicus is the first to speak."
    "Tandem Amicus primus loquitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1174
translate latin a2s2_29f34300:

    # a "\"[mc], I am so, so sorry. What are you still doing here? You're a Khemian. You need to go to Neferu and tell him that you want to be taken home...or at least to Khemia.\""
    a "\"[mc], tam, tam vehementer veniam peto. Quid adhuc hic facis? Khemius es. Ad Neferu ire debes et ei dicere te domum reduci velle...vel saltem in Khemiam.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1175
translate latin a2s2_5aa47945:

    # "His voice breaks."
    "Vox eius frangitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1177
translate latin a2s2_dcea8d95:

    # a "\"You need to get off of Adastra; it is not safe for you here. At the very least, have Virginia help smuggle you from the palace, you could—\""
    a "\"Ex Adastra abire debes; hic tibi tutum non est. Saltem fac ut Virginia te clam e palatio educat; posses—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1178
translate latin a2s2_22a49b55:

    # "I reach up a hand and press it against his muzzle, both to stop him from telling me to do things I won't be doing, and also because I feel like Com is recording this, even if Cassius doesn't mean to monitor us."
    "Manum tollo et rostro eius admoveo, tum ut eum desistere faciam mihi ea praecipere quae non faciam, tum quia sentio Com haec memoriae mandare, etiamsi Cassius nos observare non cogitat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1180
translate latin a2s2_43314322:

    # "Amicus pauses in surprise as I clamp his muzzle shut, then I see his eyes well up again as he reaches up to cup my hand and press his face into it, closing his eyes."
    "Amicus stupens consistit dum rostrum eius clausum teneo; deinde oculos eius rursus lacrimis impleri video, dum manum meam sua complectitur et vultum in eam premit, oculis clausis."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1182
translate latin a2s2_318e9a2f:

    # m "\"I'm fine...I'm here to...help you.\""
    m "\"Bene me habeo...hic sum ut...te adiuvem.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1183
translate latin a2s2_6bdc9e71:

    # "I choose my words carefully."
    "Verba mea caute eligo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1184
translate latin a2s2_007d9b26:

    # m "\"I'm GOING to help you, and I'm not leaving until I do.\""
    m "\"Te ADIUVABO; non abibo donec hoc fecerim.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1186
translate latin a2s2_5555655e:

    # a "\"[mc]—\""
    a "\"[mc]—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1187
translate latin a2s2_d220ec8f:

    # m "\"I'm not leaving.\""
    m "\"Non abibo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1189
translate latin a2s2_951c6fc7:

    # a "\"Please—\""
    a "\"Quaeso—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1191
translate latin a2s2_d5ac55ca:

    # "This time, I bring my other hand up to his mouth."
    "Hac vice alteram manum ad os eius tollo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1192
translate latin a2s2_e13623cb:

    # m "\"I'm safe. Neferu is keeping me very safe. Nothing can be done to me. I'm a Khemian, now.\""
    m "\"Tutus sum. Neferu me tutissimum servat. Nihil mihi fieri potest. Nunc Khemius sum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1193
translate latin a2s2_7a61a916:

    # com "\"Ten minutes remaining, [mc].\""
    com "\"Decem minuta restant, [mc].\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1194
translate latin a2s2_a0520921:

    # "Already?"
    "Iam?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1195
translate latin a2s2_108e34be:

    # "Suddenly I'm pressed up against the wolf's chest again as Amicus hugs me tightly."
    "Subito rursus ad pectus lupi premor, dum Amicus me firmiter amplectitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1198
translate latin a2s2_f0be3f5e:

    # a "\"I'm such a damn fool. I never think of others. I ruined your life, and for what?\""
    a "\"Tam stultus sum, per deos. Numquam alios cogito. Vitam tuam everti, et quam ob rem?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1199
translate latin a2s2_c651d0c8:

    # m "\"No.\""
    m "\"Non.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1200
translate latin a2s2_90d07e1a:

    # "I press back again."
    "Rursus me ab eo paulum removeo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1201
translate latin a2s2_1586c36d:

    # m "\"I know that I can leave with Neferu's help, but I'm choosing not to.\""
    m "\"Scio me auxilio Neferu abire posse; sed eligo non abire.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1202
translate latin a2s2_42c2d6c6:

    # "Amicus opens his mouth to say more, but I cut in before he can."
    "Amicus os aperit ut plura dicat; sed ego ante eum interrumpo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1203
translate latin a2s2_16f9f2aa:

    # m "\"I want to be here, and I'm going to—\""
    m "\"Hic esse volo; et ego—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1204
translate latin a2s2_98678438:

    # "I'm about to say \"take down Cato\", but I cut myself off."
    "Iam dicturus sum \"Catonem deponam\", sed me interrumpo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1205
translate latin a2s2_7c5caf8b:

    # m "\"—help you, even Cassius wants to. I'm gonna get you out of here no matter what.\""
    m "\"—te adiuvabo; etiam Cassius vult. Te hinc liberabo, quidquid acciderit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1206
translate latin a2s2_5c4af324:

    # "More tears start to well up, so I just hug him and we stay like that for a while."
    "Plures lacrimae colligi incipiunt; itaque tantum eum amplector et ita aliquamdiu manemus."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1208
translate latin a2s2_c520bf0b:

    # "I wish I'd thought of things to say...I'm sure there are things I could have brought up that might have helped me, or Amicus..."
    "Utinam res dicendas cogitavissem...certe sunt quae commemorare potuerim ut mihi aut Amico prodessent..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1209
translate latin a2s2_9d509a56:

    # "...but my mind is blank as all I want to do is hold my wolf."
    "...sed mens mea vacua est, cum tantum lupum meum tenere velim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1210
translate latin a2s2_f740bb8a:

    # a "\"Please, just...just don't involve yourself too much. Keep yourself safe. Being a Khemian doesn't guarantee all that if you...meddle.\""
    a "\"Quaeso, tantum...ne nimis te immisceas. Te salvum serva. Khemius esse haec omnia non praestat si...intervenis.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1211
translate latin a2s2_0c8706bc:

    # "I can hear Amicus trying to choose his own words carefully."
    "Amicum caute verba sua eligere conantem audio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1212
translate latin a2s2_391e603b:

    # m "\"Yeah, Cato's already shown me that.\""
    m "\"Ita, Cato hoc iam mihi ostendit.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1213
translate latin a2s2_4308e229:

    # "Amicus jerks back, looking at me."
    "Amicus subito se retrahit et me aspicit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1215
translate latin a2s2_26bb83d4:

    # a "\"Did he do something to you?\""
    a "\"Fecitne aliquid tibi?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1216
translate latin a2s2_cea65ed2:

    # m "\"Not me, Neferu.\""
    m "\"Non mihi, Neferu.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1217
translate latin a2s2_9dcfb04f:

    # a "\"What happened?\""
    a "\"Quid accidit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1218
translate latin a2s2_074fdf43:

    # m "\"Uh...Neferu was kind of being...forward, and he got kicked in the nuts.\""
    m "\"Em...Neferu paulo...procax erat, et in testiculos calce percussus est.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1220
translate latin a2s2_946a040d:

    # a "\"What!?\""
    a "\"Quid!?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1221
translate latin a2s2_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Ita.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1223
translate latin a2s2_f1b83b89:

    # a "\"But he's the Pharaoh's son...\""
    a "\"Sed filius Pharaonis est...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1224
translate latin a2s2_200b459d:

    # m "\"Yeah, so I know that I need to be especially careful.\""
    m "\"Ita, itaque scio mihi praecipue cavendum esse.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1225
translate latin a2s2_94f1b43f:

    # "The look of shock on Amicus's face slowly changes to one of slight amusement."
    "Stupor in vultu Amici lente in levem oblectationem mutatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1227
translate latin a2s2_c68234f8:

    # a "\"Well, that's something I can't imagine.\""
    a "\"Hoc sane animo fingere nequeo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1228
translate latin a2s2_2f0a4cbb:

    # m "\"It was definitely something.\""
    m "\"Res memorabilis certe erat.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1229
translate latin a2s2_27ebcb7e:

    # "I'm glad to see Amicus smiling at least a little."
    "Gaudeo Amicum saltem paulum arridentem videre."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1230
translate latin a2s2_e235e45e:

    # com "\"One minute.\""
    com "\"Unum minutum.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1232
translate latin a2s2_bfe94f78:

    # "I feel a flash of annoyance at the AI before Amicus is hugging me tightly again."
    "Irritatio contra mentem artificiosam me breviter pervadit, antequam Amicus rursus me firmiter amplectitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1233
translate latin a2s2_2096b2c3:

    # m "\"I'm going to be careful...I'm just gonna help everyone figure out how best to clear your name.\""
    m "\"Cavebo...tantum omnes adiuvabo ut cognoscant quomodo nomen tuum optime a crimine purgetur.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1234
translate latin a2s2_6a76c69b:

    # a "\"I love you...so much.\""
    a "\"Te amo...tantopere.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1235
translate latin a2s2_58124b9d:

    # m "\"I love you, too.\""
    m "\"Ego quoque te amo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1236
translate latin a2s2_fc145c15:

    # com "\"Time limit has been reached. Please proceed to the ladder, [mc]. Please proceed to your cell, Amicus.\""
    com "\"Terminus temporis expletus est. Ad scalam procede, quaeso, [mc]. Ad cellam tuam procede, quaeso, Amice.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1237
translate latin a2s2_48313199:

    # "Amicus's embrace doesn't loosen and instead, he lowers his head to kiss me."
    "Amicus amplexum non laxat; potius caput demittit ut me osculetur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1238
translate latin a2s2_5ffbfc3d:

    # "I kiss back."
    "Ego quoque eum osculor."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1239
translate latin a2s2_ac1fb6de:

    # com "\"Please untangle your limbs and oral cavities and proceed to your respective directives.\""
    com "\"Membra vestra et cava oris diducite, quaeso; deinde uterque mandato suo obtemperet.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1241
translate latin a2s2_dc3eb339:

    # "Amicus huffs in annoyance before drawing back."
    "Amicus molestia flat, deinde recedit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1242
translate latin a2s2_67ab9a54:

    # m "\"And I'll be back! I just need to ask Cassius for the right times.\""
    m "\"Et redibo! Tantum Cassium de temporibus aptis rogare debeo.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1244
translate latin a2s2_64f873ff:

    # a "\"Alright, there's much more I want to say to you, so please...return soon, if you possibly can.\""
    a "\"Bene, multo plura tibi dicere volo; itaque quaeso...mox redi, si omnino potes.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1246
translate latin a2s2_8248afcb:

    # m "\"Of course! As soon as I can.\""
    m "\"Certe! Simul atque potero.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1248
translate latin a2s2_2f295915:

    # "Amicus gives me a small smile, and though I see tears in his eyes, they don't overflow this time."
    "Amicus mihi paulum arridet; quamquam lacrimas in oculis eius video, hac vice non effunduntur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1252
translate latin a2s2_977f3e21:

    # "The journey back to Neferu's room is when it all hits me at once, and I have to constantly wipe my eyes in case someone like Alex, Neferu...or Cato comes around the corner and sees me."
    "Dum ad cubiculum Neferu redeo, omnia simul animum meum percutiunt; oculos continuo tergere debeo, ne quis ut Alex, Neferu...vel Cato circa angulum veniat et me videat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1253
translate latin a2s2_8150136d:

    # "I already desperately miss Amicus, and now that I've just left him, I'm reminded of how alone I feel now that he's not always by my side."
    "Amicum iam vehementer desidero; nunc cum eum modo reliquerim, memini quam solus me sentiam, cum non semper ad latus meum sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1254
translate latin a2s2_440d4842:

    # "Next time I visit, I'll bring a bunch of stuff to say, do, and eat."
    "Proxima vice qua visam, multa dicenda, facienda et edenda afferam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1255
translate latin a2s2_0074dba9:

    # "I can't imagine the dungeon food is any good."
    "Non possum cibum carcerum ullo modo bonum fingere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1256
translate latin a2s2_47b3acef:

    # "Maybe we can find more privacy next time, and we'll be able to plan things out, maybe pass information on to him somehow."
    "Fortasse proxima vice secretiorem locum inveniemus et res disponere poterimus, vel ei quodammodo notitias tradere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1257
translate latin a2s2_127a6fd8:

    # "The thought of this makes me feel a little bit better, and my eyes are mostly dry as I near the jackal's room."
    "Haec cogitatio me paulo melius habere facit; oculi mei fere sicci sunt cum ad cubiculum chacali accedo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1258
translate latin a2s2_a98c1efe:

    # "It's at that moment that I get a strange wiff of something in the air."
    "Illo momento mirum cuiusdam rei odorem in aere sentio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1261
translate latin a2s2_ad57f7b3:

    # "Like...mothballs?"
    "Velut...globuli contra tineas?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1262
translate latin a2s2_7b4eca0d:

    # "That's all that comes to mind."
    "Hoc solum in mentem venit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1263
translate latin a2s2_458fe5b3:

    # "It's something that I've never smelled in the palace before, so I find myself pausing in the hallway, looking around."
    "Est odor quem numquam antea in palatio sensi; itaque in ambulacro consisto et circumspicio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1264
translate latin a2s2_dc5667ae:

    # "Nothing seems out of place."
    "Nihil loco suo motum videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1265
translate latin a2s2_e82a7bc6:

    # "It's quiet and bright, as it usually is, but that's when I realize where I am."
    "Quietum et clarum est, ut solet; tum autem intellego ubi sim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1266
translate latin a2s2_ca9ffcb4:

    # "There's a door to my left, and I immediately know that's the meditation room."
    "Ianua ad sinistram est; statim scio eam cubiculi meditationis esse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1267
translate latin a2s2_8ab85954:

    # "I remember then that Cassius mentioned that he wanted to meditate, to talk to the parents."
    "Tum memini Cassium dixisse se meditari velle, ut cum Parentibus loqueretur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1268
translate latin a2s2_4cbb4f01:

    # "Is he in there doing that right now...and is that smell part of it?"
    "Estne intus id nunc faciens...et estne ille odor pars eius?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1269
translate latin a2s2_56f31f18:

    # "I'm reminded of the night I first met Amicus, that I'd smelled something like burning rubber in the air."
    "Memini noctis qua primum Amicum conveni, meque odorem velut gummis ardentis in aere sensisse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1270
translate latin a2s2_d493559a:

    # "This isn't that, but I have to wonder if maybe the...parents emit this odd smell when they arrive?"
    "Non hic idem est; tamen mecum quaerendum est an fortasse...Parentes hunc mirum odorem edant cum adveniunt?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1271
translate latin a2s2_0b523dc8:

    # "I stand there for a while, listening."
    "Aliquamdiu ibi sto et ausculto."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1272
translate latin a2s2_10c27758:

    # "I don't hear anything, but that smell continues, and I know now that it's definitely coming from that room."
    "Nihil audio; odor autem pergit, et iam scio eum certe ex illo cubiculo venire."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1273
translate latin a2s2_d57ac0bd:

    # "My eyes are squarely locked on the black panel."
    "Oculi mei recta in tabella nigra fixi sunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1274
translate latin a2s2_5ee0b41c:

    # "I want to open it, but I know I can't."
    "Ianuam aperire volo; sed scio me non posse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1275
translate latin a2s2_435ec8b7:

    # "If Cassius really is in the middle of talking to the parents, I could ruin everything."
    "Si Cassius vere cum Parentibus nunc colloquitur, omnia perdere possim."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1276
translate latin a2s2_f068a50f:

    # "So, I start to turn away, deciding that I'll ask Neferu what might be going on in there."
    "Itaque averti incipio, decernens Neferu rogare quid intus agatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1277
translate latin a2s2_1d25761c:

    # "But as I do, the door opens, and a cloud of billowing, white smoke comes out."
    "Dum autem id facio, ianua aperitur et nubes fumi albi tumens exit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1281
translate latin a2s2_fb218f0b:

    # "I gasp and jump back, seeing a figure standing in the doorway."
    "Anhelo et retro subsilio, figuram in limine stantem videns."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1282
translate latin a2s2_c16ba91d:

    # "It's Cassius, and he's hacking and coughing, gasping for breath."
    "Cassius est, qui vehementer tussit et spiritum anhelans quaerit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1283
translate latin a2s2_b9680cbf:

    # "I can see that he's shaking too, and I'm about to back away when he locks eyes on me."
    "Eum quoque tremere video; iam recessurus sum cum oculos in me figit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1284
translate latin a2s2_efba35b5:

    # "His eyes are wide, bloodshot, and I can see what looks like vomit on his chest."
    "Oculi eius dilatati et sanguine suffusi sunt; in pectore eius quod vomitus esse videtur conspicio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1285
translate latin a2s2_fa4c67ed:

    # "His muzzle hangs open, as if trying to talk to me."
    "Rostrum eius apertum pendet, quasi mecum loqui conetur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1286
translate latin a2s2_71d140fd:

    # "He's hyperventilating though, and that's finally when I step forward."
    "Nimis tamen celeriter respirat; tandem procedo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1287
translate latin a2s2_f388506e:

    # m "\"Cassius...are you okay?\""
    m "\"Cassi...bene te habes?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1288
translate latin a2s2_f6e99dc7:

    # "I have to walk into the cloud to get to him, and I'm enveloped in that chemical smell, immediately coughing out the acrid smoke."
    "Ut ad eum perveniam, in nubem ingredi debeo; ille odor chemicus me circumdat, et statim propter acrem fumum tussio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1289
translate latin a2s2_29487704:

    # c "\"H—h—help...me...\""
    c "\"S—s—succurre...mihi...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1291
translate latin a2s2_57b471f7:

    # "Cassius reaches out to me and I catch his paw."
    "Cassius manum ad me porrigit; eam prehendo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1293
translate latin a2s2_3d57563e:

    # "Immediately, he slumps against me and I stumble under his significant weight."
    "Statim in me labitur; sub magno pondere eius titubo."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1294
translate latin a2s2_04ad15c0:

    # "Nowhere near to that of Amicus, but he is a wolf after all."
    "Longe minus quam Amici est; tamen lupus est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1295
translate latin a2s2_8059cacc:

    # m "\"What happened?\""
    m "\"Quid accidit?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1296
translate latin a2s2_4cd77819:

    # "I try to peer into the room, but it's so smokey...I see what looks like a little fire in the middle though, a pot burning something inside."
    "In cubiculum prospicere conor; sed tam fumosum est...video tamen quod igniculus in medio esse videtur, ollam aliquid intus comburentem."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1297
translate latin a2s2_15d03103:

    # "Did...did Cassius hotbox himself with something?"
    "Num...num Cassius inclusus fumo aliquo se inebriavit?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1298
translate latin a2s2_71f0dae4:

    # c "\"P—P—Parents...demons...\""
    c "\"P—P—Parentes...daemones...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1299
translate latin a2s2_2c1b407f:

    # "I don't know what to do."
    "Nescio quid faciam."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1300
translate latin a2s2_f0bee6be:

    # "At first, I start to try and pull Cassius along toward Neferu's room, but I immediately switch course, deciding that I definitely won't make it."
    "Primo Cassium versus cubiculum Neferu trahere incipio; statim tamen cursum muto, decernens me eo certe pervenire non posse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1301
translate latin a2s2_c6c7c0a7:

    # "Amicus's room is closer."
    "Cubiculum Amici propius est."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1302
translate latin a2s2_988b26d9:

    # "I just hope I can still get in there."
    "Tantum spero me adhuc intrare posse."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1303
translate latin a2s2_b733949b:

    # c "\"I can't...I can't...\""
    c "\"Non possum...non possum...\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1304
translate latin a2s2_77b36f73:

    # "Cassius whines and then suddenly lets out a retch."
    "Cassius queritur, deinde subito nauseans sonum edit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1305
translate latin a2s2_5c00268e:

    # "I try to ignore it, just kind of hoping that someone else will come around the corner to help me, even if it's Cato."
    "Eum neglegere conor, tantum sperans aliquem alium circa angulum venturum ut me adiuvet, etiamsi Cato sit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1306
translate latin a2s2_a1c80d87:

    # "As I'm thinking this, I realize that the hall seems to stretch further and further ahead of me."
    "Dum haec cogito, intellego ambulacrum ante me magis magisque extendi videri."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1307
translate latin a2s2_763db420:

    # "The light takes on an odd quality, strangely sharp and bright...and just like that, I instantly fall into what feels like a dream."
    "Lux miram speciem accipit, mire acrem et claram...et ita subito in id delabor quod somnium videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1309
translate latin a2s2_a478a500:

    # m "\"Goddammit, what were you smoking?\""
    m "\"Per deos, quid fumabas?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1310
translate latin a2s2_b55c3fef:

    # c "\"Parents!\""
    c "\"Parentes!\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1311
translate latin a2s2_6b3b9fe2:

    # "Cassius squeaks."
    "Cassius acute exclamat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1312
translate latin a2s2_8a01cd35:

    # "I'm angry, not just because this dumb wolf got me high on who-knows-what—"
    "Iratus sum, non tantum quia hic stultus lupus me ignoto quodam veneno inebriavit—"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1313
translate latin a2s2_3837dac2:

    # "—but because I'm realizing that this is what Cassius was referring to when he said the \"traditional technique\" of contacting the parents had worked."
    "—sed quia intellego hoc esse quod Cassius dicebat cum \"morem traditum\" Parentum conveniendorum successisse dixit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1314
translate latin a2s2_ad2112e2:

    # "All he was doing was getting high on some DMT shit."
    "Tantum aliquo foedo veneno DMT inebriabatur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1315
translate latin a2s2_31aee648:

    # "Is this how it's always been?"
    "Itane semper fuit?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1316
translate latin a2s2_6d574a4e:

    # "Are the wolves...all the aliens just getting their crazy parent ideas from some drug?"
    "Num lupi...omnes alienigenae insanas illas de Parentibus opiniones tantum ex aliquo veneno accipiunt?"

# game/a2s2.rpy:1317
translate latin a2s2_46998d9d:

    # "The hall continues to extend ahead of me, and suddenly I feel like I'm looping in time, like time doesn't matter at all anymore."
    "Ambulacrum ante me extendi pergit; subito sentio me in tempore in orbem ferri, quasi tempus omnino non iam referat."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1318
translate latin a2s2_d8536067:

    # "I can see why Cassius is panicking; I'm starting to myself."
    "Intellego cur Cassius paveat; ipse quoque pavere incipio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1319
translate latin a2s2_6e0062b7:

    # "After what seems like an eternity, I manage to find Amicus's door."
    "Post id quod aeternitas videtur, ianuam Amici invenire possum."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1320
translate latin a2s2_56f8dc4c:

    # "Shakily, I reach out and press the panel, the door sliding open."
    "Trepidam manum porrigo et tabellam premo; ianua delabitur et aperitur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1323
translate latin a2s2_3893e2da:

    # "I practically throw Cassius onto the bed."
    "Cassium paene in lectum iacio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1324
translate latin a2s2_7bd459ae:

    # "He seems to have stopped blubbering at this point."
    "Iam singultus edere desiisse videtur."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1325
translate latin a2s2_d39da6b9:

    # "I collapse onto the sofa, my anger at the wolves and so-called parents dissipating from my mind as the high increases."
    "In lectulum corruo; ira mea contra lupos et sic dictos Parentes ex animo evanescit, dum ebrietas veneni crescit."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1326
translate latin a2s2_84e158ff:

    # "I raise my hands in front of my face and immediately regret it as they start to stretch and bend."
    "Manus ante vultum meum tollo; statim paenitet, cum extendi et flecti incipiunt."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1327
translate latin a2s2_d4667060:

    # "Quickly, I jerk them back to my chest, hugging myself, trying to keep my breathing under control."
    "Celeriter eas ad pectus retraho et me amplector, respirationem regere conans."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1328
translate latin a2s2_07563632:

    # "It feels like I'm sinking into a crater, like the ceiling is raising up above me, and that time won't start moving again."
    "Sentio me quasi in craterem subsidere, tectum super me attolli et tempus non iam moveri incipere."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1329
translate latin a2s2_c036a09c:

    # "I gasp and clutch at the cushions, shutting my eyes, trying to calm myself down."
    "Anhelo et cervicalia stringo, oculis clausis, me ipsum sedare conans."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1330
translate latin a2s2_da56184e:

    # com "\"You seem to be worried about something. Wanna stress tablet to help you out?\""
    com "\"De aliquo sollicitus videris. Visne pastillum ad sollicitudinem levandam quod te adiuvet?\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1331
translate latin a2s2_1a3a0fca:

    # "That voice...sounds kinda like Com...kinda not."
    "Illa vox...quodammodo Com similis sonat...quodammodo non."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1332
translate latin a2s2_9046708a:

    # m "\"I—\""
    m "\"Ego—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1333
translate latin a2s2_5954ba2b:

    # com "\"They help you chill.\""
    com "\"Te relaxare adiuvant.\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1334
translate latin a2s2_bb392094:

    # m "\"Wha—\""
    m "\"Qu—\""

# game/a2s2.rpy:1335
translate latin a2s2_58c3b4a3:

    # "My confusion over Com's voice melts away as mercifully, darkness takes me..."
    "Confusio mea de voce Com evanescit, dum tenebrae, levamen afferentes, me occupant..."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1338
translate latin a2s2_20c56fa2:

    # "I'm relieved to find myself back up in space."
    "Levatus me rursus in spatio reperio."

# game/a2s2.rpy:1339
translate latin a2s2_b8b9fb0e:

    # "I float; content, calm, happy, even though I sense someone watching me, just behind me..."
    "Fluito, contentus, placidus, laetus, quamquam aliquem me observare sentio, recta post me..."

